<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Plan Rui</para>
  <para style="toc1">Plan Rui</para>
  <para style="toc2">Plan Rui</para>
  <para style="mt1">Plan Rui</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Mosi chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,410-1,400 <char style="w">BC</char> takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi kowh tanga lawmbawr mih chekhai. Mami bowih dow amatni Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh Mosi ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih ming dow Plan Rui pahai chap pe ming chepaw rik ruita mih lawnguan kowi kowh plan ruiah iawk mih krowngchow nadowi; ana pek sar paw arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami khin khe Israeluüa uowi mih dow Kanan pren ria kowi kowh Moab pren dowm nai kowi chekhai. Aigupta pren hown uang lawt hownia Kanan pren ria kowi uang towm mowr kowi tawng iawng ngai chow Israeluüa vüi Thurai chang pe mih lawnguan mami bowih kowi ruiah khai. Nami klen kowi Israeluüa vüi tawng iawng mih ari aiang ngai chow Thurai peah mih lawnguan paw mami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Thurai khamah mih Kanan pren kowi kowkup mih khin khe Israeluüa nakala prasi kownkow mami ari aiang chün lainowmma lakke chekhai. Aia kowng dowi rawn Israeluüa kowi Mosi mala mih laiklow maten dow mami bowih kowi ruiah khai. Mami bowih achur prakowi kowh Mosi kowng mih lawnguan tarapdow risi iawng hai aia rik ruila mih chepaw naia kown; nadowi now Josua ruiah mih chepaw naia kown, nadowi now akeng mih maru ta ruiah mih chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih hailawm Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi dow ari arow bowih pahai Hebraiuüa tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Risi: Risi pami dow Thurai hownia kowh taah mih laiklow maru-uüa kowi krawi tek mih maru chekhai. Alai kowh Israeluüa chowng khe dow mukmang kowi risiuüa hown Thurai uang taklang reng, now Thurai hownia kowh taah mih laiklow maru-uüa kowi risiuüa krawi tek pe reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Uowila uiting uangtak: Uowila uiting uangtak pami dow kimchak ün, tasin taken mih ün kowng khe kowmatia sak kowi rau mih hai prüa mih krang tüng mih chekhai. Nami dow kawngmu ri chepaw na, now chenchap ri chepaw na chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Rutchün khawkleng: Rutchün khawkleng pami dow tasen müa uanh chekhai. Napawk, reh, leba, kawngma hai lukruk ün tasen müa kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih uanh maten kowi rutchün khawkleng pape khai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Salawnma: Salawnma pami dow phen hown kowh thawpah mih mawkra prowng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Mosi laiklow lowk: Khamah mih pren hown atawnchow uang ting mih lawnguan 1:1-4:43</para>
  <para style="io1">Mosi laiklow pre: Khamah mih pren kowi chimsaima nauowi kown mih lawnguan 4:44-26:19</para>
  <para style="io1">Mosi laiklow sum: Khamah mih pren kowi kowh vüi tatow sangbowk laitawm mih lawnguan 27:1-30:20</para>
  <para style="io1">Mosi chownglawng chur pra kowh khin: Khamah mih pren uat kowi Mosi kowng mih lawnguan 31:1-34:12</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Mosi rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Mami bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih dow Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih laiklow chekhai. Maiawngün laiklow Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih khin khe amatni uowi mih dow Moab pren kowi kowh Suf marow re-e kowh <char style="w">süngrüp süngkangma</char> kowi chekhai. Nami dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi chekhai. Amatni uowi rah papra pra dow Paran marow chekhai, now akeng prakowi uowi mih dow Tofel, Laban, Hezerawt hai Dizahab marow chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />(Sinai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sinai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hungh dow Horeb hungh chekhai.</char></note> hungh hownia Seir hungma mawngma iawng mang hanow Kades-Barnea kowi kowtowm kown mih dow lailowk ni chowtaih lakke khai).<verse eid="DEU 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Israeluüa kowi natek pe kownkow aia kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana maten dow Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe khai. Naiawngün laiklow Mosi tek pe mih dow Aigupta pren hownia amatni uang lawt kung kowi 40 ning khe kowh lailowk la kowi lacher pani khe chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Naiawngün laiklow aia tek pe mih dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun hai Basan pren mang Awk kowi saita kung kowi chekhai. Mang Sihun uowi mih dow Hesbawn marow kowi chekhai, now mang Awk uowi mih dow Edrei hai Astarawt marow kowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sinai hungh hownia Israeluüa lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Maiawngün ari arow laiklow maten Mosi tek khe amatni uowi mih dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh Moab pren kowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />Mosi tek pe mih, “Sinai hungh re-e a-i uowi reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai tek a-i mih, ‘Mami hungh re-e enni uowi mih akrama khowk chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih lutla <char style="w">tangbung</char> büah hanow Amawruüa pren kowi kowh hungma mawngma kowi hai aria aret kowi kowh maru-uüa tut-e kowkowi büa diah. Amatni uowi mih dow Araba kowi, hungma mawngma süng kowi, laina kowi, Negeb hai sata pang kowi chekhai. Naiawngün süng dow Kananuüa kowh pren hailawm Lebanawn iawng panow Iufratis awma mowr chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Sünta, naiawngün süng maten dow ang peta enni mih chowbowt. Naiawngün süng dow enni kowh pipu Abraham, Isak, Jakawb hai amatni kung kowi kowh uang ta uowi mih krungchakuüa kowi napeah kownkow ang khamah mih chekhai. Naiawngün süng dow kowkowi hanow kowpowngta büah bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rui aluchowuüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />“Mosi plan tek pe mih, ‘Sinai hungh kowi a-i uowi khe ang tek enni mih maiawng: Ang malowkchow ang nowng khet enni dowi. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih lainowmma pe prung enni khai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow enni mih mukuang kowi kowh krek nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng lainowmma kawm khai bowt. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai dow 1,000 phow pacham pe prung enni küng lah, now aia dow aia kowh laikham iawng pacham pe enni <char style="w">prasi</char> lah. <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Nachenganchepaw ang malowkchow tawng iawng chow enni kowh <char style="w">kurdik</char> ang nowng kur kown chow? Enni takhowk taran mih srui kowi ang malowkchow tawng iawng chow ang nowng chet enni kown? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Naiawng rakowi enni chowlowkkow <char style="w">krungchak</char> hownia chanlaima mih, <char style="w">prengia</char> uowima mih hai atukma miuüa kowi ruiah sangrum chi büa diah; amatni kowi dow naming nakhet enni kown mih kurdik ang napeah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />“Nakhowk khe enni klang ang mih, ‘En tek iawng chang mih naiung kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Naiawng rakowi enni chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh chanlaima miuüa hai atukma miuüa kowi naming nakhet enni kown mih kurdik ang peah khai. Tawngbak mih kowi dow 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh <char style="w">siphai</char> aluchow, tawngbak mih kowi dow 100 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow, tawngbak mih kowi dow 50 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow, now tawngbak mih kowi dow 10 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow ang thawpah khai. Nami klen kowi tawngbak miuüa kowi dow tara chet mih hai maru iuk ang thawpah khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Now tara chet miuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Israeluüa lala chepaw, Israeluüa hown akeng chenchap chepaw takhowk taran hanow pre powchak kowh laiklow enni nasünta pe kown. Now amatni kowi dow tara nowm enni nachet pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Enni chet tara mih khin khe mia pra paw enni natawi ia tangila kown nadowi. Aiuk asowm bowkbowk kowh laiklow enni nasünta pe kown takla. Tara chet dow Thurai kowh lup chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mia iawng mih maru kowi paw hangkow kram büa diah. Now enni tut-e achet krat lai mih tara dow ang tut-e uang pawla büa taih, now naiawngün dow ang chet sow,’ pah manow. <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Nami klen kowi tawng chow enni achang takla mih paw nami khin khe ang tek enni khowk.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kowkumü pren mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai <char style="w">ana pek</char> iawng Sinai hungh hownia lawt hanow Amawruüa pren kowi kowh hungma mawngma süng prakowi a-i tarowng mang khai. Nakhowk khe mün khowt chow iuk hai kramra uowi mih süngrüp süngkangma iawng a-i mang takla mih enni khi khowk chekhai. Naiawng hai Kades-Barnea kowi dow a-i kowting khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Nami kung kowi ang tek enni mih, ‘Amawruüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi enni uang ting khowk; mami pren mih CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pe a-i kown chowbowt. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Mü madiah, CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren enni pur kowi chowbowt. CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai laiklow iawng kowkowiah hanow pren mih kowpowng büa diah. Hangkow kram büa diah, sak paw hangkow nenah büa diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Nakhowk khe enni bowkbowk uangah now uang tek ang mih, ‘Kowrik chin maru ne diah. Amatni dow tawng mih tiama iawng chow mang e iung kown mih hai tawng marow ngai chow a-i nakrumla kown mih pakowrik mü lah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Enni kowh nami laiklow dow ang nauta khai. Naiawng rakowi enni chowlowkkow krungchak hownia lowk ia chi bowkbowk kowi 12 ia maru ang ruiah khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Now amatni dow paimi hungma mawngma süng kowi kowpün khai, now Iskawl <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> kowi kowkowi büah hanow tawng ngai chow uowi mih kowkrawi müla büah khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Amatni dow paimi pren hownia kowh uih-ak paw uang pawla ne khai. Now uang tek büah mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pe a-i mih pren lainowmma klangiung!’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanan pren kowi kowkowi kown nau dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Nachenganchepaw paimi pren kowi kowkowi kown mih enni nau dowi. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh ana pek kowi enni <char style="w">kingküa</char> khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Enni dow enni matia tangbung lak kowi Thurai kowi kingküa mih laiklow enni tek khai. Enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG sui a-i khai. Naiawng rakowi Amawruüa rut kowi apta a-i now piakta a-i kownkow Aigupta pren hownia aia uang lawtla a-i mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Tawngplawng kowchow pai kowi a-i kowkowi kown? A-i kowchinah miuüa piakta a-i sak nak khowk. Paimi prenchakuüa dow a-i lak-e lang kür hai lang kro pe. Amatni kowh marow paw aiukma kangowh pe, now marow <char style="w">tap</char> paw akro kuang dawnglang mowr chi pe. Nami klen kowi Anakuüa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anakuüa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow aiuk akroma panow bawlima kangowh chekhai.</char></note> kowi paw khila büah pe pami ta dowi bow?’ enni pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Naiawng enni tek mih ang ta hanow ang tek enni mih, ‘Hangkow kram büah. Paimi prenchakuüa kowi kaah kram dowi. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30-31" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni pur kowi rik mang reng chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi hai süngrüp süngkangma kowi enni vüi aia dowk tasen mih enni khi khowk nadowi bow? Nami iawng dow enni vüi aia nadowk tasen iawk kown taih. Chapa kowi khemla hanow a-pa cham pawla mih iawng makowi uang ting dowi mowr CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai uang pawla enni mih enni tuk khowk nadowi bow?’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Naiawng khowt CHAKRAMANG chang enni khowk chepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai luk kowi enni neplawng nesak dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />Aia dow enni kowh <char style="w">tangbung khup rah</char> natüng enni kownkow hai natüng enni tiama kownkow tawi uowila enni reng chekhai. Aia dow ni-e khe uangnim iowng chunglung mih dawng kowi hai iak-e khe maih lün iowng chunglung mih dawng kowi uowiah hanow enni pur kowi rik mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34-36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34-36" />“Enni kowh laiklow tata now CHAKRAMANG kunmarau lai kowh kham sawi se tek mih, ‘Enni pipu-uüa kowi napeah kown pahai ang khamah mih pren klangiungma mih dow Jefune kowh chapa Kaleb lowk iachow taih nakhi kown. Kaleb klen kowi dow kawmat chowng kowi kowh maru ngakuüa miapaw natawi khi kown nadowi. Kaleb dow achi anawmma hai ang kowh laiklow chün khai. Naiawng rakowi aia chawpla mih krawng srui aia hai aia krungchakuüa kowi ang napeah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:34-36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />“Enni rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow ang luk kowi paw lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek ang mih, ‘Paimi pren kowi en paw natawi ka kup kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nachenganchepaw en kowh akhowng mih Nun kowh chapa Josua dow naka kup kown. Josua kowi phai peah sakkraingra diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow paimi pren napowng kownkow Israeluüa kowi nakruitownah kown mih dow aia chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“A-i kowh chauüa kowi nakhümla bowk kown towbowt,” padow enni tek khai. Naiawng enni tek mih khin khe naiawngün ngeuüa hawmh dow aiung <char style="w">angak</char> tawngpaw tuk dowi tak chekhai. Naiawngünuüa chowtaih paimi pren kowi naka kup kown. Pren mih dow amatni kowi ang napeah kown, now amatni dow paimi pren napowngta kown. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Nachenganchepaw enni dow kawmat kung pra plan büah hanow sata Rik pra kowh tiama iawng mangah now süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi büa diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Nami laiklow tata hanow enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak anging changta khai bowt. Kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai ana pek iawng anging tarü tasen kown towbowt,’ pakhai. Naiawng enni tek hanow enni dowk tasen müa <char style="w">rutchün khawkleng</char> bowk khai. Hungma mawngma süng kowi kowtasen kown mih aiachow padow enni ka tuak khai.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Nachenganchepaw natek enni kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Hang cham dowk tasen büa diah. Ransu-uüa tut-e enni nacham sum kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni tut-e ang natawi uowi kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />“Nami laiklow ang tek enni khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw enni chün dowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek kowi üala hanow owrowma hai hungma mawngma süng prakowi enni awr pün khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Naiawng enni kowpün mih khita hanow hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa maten dow uang dowk enni tasen khai. Amatni dow kuai kunmarau khe kowh kawikrawi maru mih iawng uang talut hanow Seir hungma mawngma süng hownia Hawrma hungh mowr uang krawi sen enni khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Nakhowk khe dow enni uang plan hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni uang nguk uang kar khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow enni kowh kar klow sünta enni dowi chekhai; aia dow pitta param khai. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Naiawng rakowi Kades-Barnea kowi akrama enni uowila khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Mosi plan tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng kung prakowi a-i plan hanow sata Rik pra kowh mangla mih tiama iawng mangah now süngrüp süngkangma kowi a-i kowkowi khai. Seir hungma mawngma süng kowi a-i krawi mangla mih dow akhin krama chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‘Mami hungma mawngma süng kowi enni krawi mang mih akrama khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow tawngphak prakowi tarü büa diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />“Nami kung kowi dow natek enni kownkow aia tek ang mih, ‘Khaleng dow Seir hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih enni kowh tainau Esau krungchakuüa kowh pren iawng enni namang kown takla. Amatni dow khi enni hanow nakram enni kown. Nachenganchepaw kaneuma uowiah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Esau krungchakuüa kowi mih enni nahauah tasen kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh pren dow ditchow paw ang nape enni kown nadowi; khawk chawpra krowngchow khowm padow ang nape enni kown nadowi. Mami Seir hungma mawngma süng dow nachangla pren kownkow Esau kowi ang peta mih chowbowt. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Chakkham hai tui khowm padow amatni hownia mih enni naranah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih enni kowh lup maten kowi pe enni <char style="w">prasi</char> khai. Mami süngrüp süngkangma aiukma mih iawng enni uaimang mih khin khe paw aia dow mingkhet enni khai. Mami 40 ning mowr aia dow tawi uowila enni khai, now tawng chap paw khawr hown aia dow tow enni dowi chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng Seir hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih a-i tainau Esau krungchakuüa kowh pren iawng a-i kowmang khai. Elat marow hai Eziawn-Geber marow hownia Araba lawngrawi pra kowh mangla mih tiama dow a-i towla hanow Moab pren kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma prakowi a-i haimang khai.<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />“Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Moabuüa kowi hangkow pusala büah, tasen paw hangkow haula büah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh pren dow ditchow paw ang nape enni kown nadowi chekhai. Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Ar marow dow Lawt krungchakuüa kowi ang peta mih chowbowt,’ pah ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Moabuüa dowi rawn Ar marow kowi uowi mih dow Emimuüa chekhai. Emimuüa dow maru iun akawmma hai akürma chekhai, now Anakuüa iawng akroma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Anakuüa kowi iawng Emimuüa kowi paw Refaimuüa pahai maru tukah reng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Moabuüa dow amatni kowi Emimuüa pahai hawah khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Seir hungma mawngma süng kowi rik uowi mih dow Hawruüa chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw nami hownia amatni kowi dow akung kowi Esau krungchakuüa uang prütta khai. Amatni kowh pren dow Esau krungchakuüa uang khünta pe khai. Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG peah mih Kanan pren kowi Israeluüa kowchang iawng Esau krungchakuüa paw Hawruüa kowi changah khai).<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Now Mosi plan tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Kawmat dow rü büah hanow Zared lawngrawi paipra kowi kowkowi büa diah,’ pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Zared lawngrawi paipra kowi a-i kowkowi khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Kades-Barnea hownia lawt kowh Zared lawngrawi mapra pown kowi a-i uang towm mowr kowi 38 ning a-i kowita khai. Nami chowng khe kowh siphaiuüa maten dow nami 38 ning takra kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham iawng kowng bowk khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni bowkbowk kowi tangbung khupra hownia nakowngta kownkow CHAKRAMANG kingküaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16-18" />“Naiawngün siphai hawmuüa kowng bowk kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Ani dow Ar marow ria iawng kowmangah hanow Moabuüa kowh pren sünghi enni naklenla kown. <verse eid="DEU 2:16-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Tawkchedow Amawnuüa kowh pren ria kowi enni kowting mih khin khe Amawnuüa kowi enni napusaah kown nadowi, now tasen paw enni nahauah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Amawnuüa kowh pren dow ditchow paw ang nape enni kown nadowi. Nami pren dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Lawt krungchakuüa kowi ang peta mih chowbowt,’ pah ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />(Amawnuüa kowh pren dow Refaimuüa kowh pren pahai maru tukah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami pren kowi rik uowi mih dow Refaimuüa chekhai. Amawnuüa dow amatni kowi Zamzumimuüa pahai hawah khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Refaimuüa dow akürma hai maru iun akawmma chekhai. Amatni dow Anakuüa iawng akroma kangowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow Amawnuüa rut kowi CHAKRAMANG pe sumah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi prütta hanow amatni kowh pren dow Amawnuüa khünta pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Nami powm iawng dow CHAKRAMANG mih Esau krungchakuüa vüi kowi paw chang pe khai. Hawruüa kowi paw Esau krungchakuüa rut kowi CHAKRAMANG pe sumah khai. Naiawng rakowi Hawruüa kowi prütta hanow amatni kowh pren dow Esau krungchakuüa khünta pe khai. Kawmat pat paw Seir hungma mawngma süng kowi dow Esau krungchakuüa uowi reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Nami powm iawng dow Avimuüa kowi paw Filistinuüa uangah hanow uang khünta pe uowi rah khai. Avimuüa kowh kua maten Filistinuüa khünta pe mih dow Gaza marow mowr chekhai).<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sihun kowi Israeluüa nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Now Mosi plan tek mih, “Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih maiawng, ‘Lawt büah hanow Arnawn aw paipra pown kowi kowkowi büa diah. Sünta, Hesbawn marow kowi kowh Amawruüa mang Sihun hai aia kowh pren mih ang peta enni mih chowbowt. Amatni kowi dow kowsenah büa diah, now amatni kowh pren dow powngta pe büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Ani hownia now palusama maru kowi enni lawnguan kowi kramra hai takrow takraira ang uown peah kown. Palusama maru mih enni lawnguan kowi ta hanow nachür bowt kown, now enni rakowi amatni kowh saktuak dow lainowmma napusa kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Nami kung kowi dow taking tasangra nauowila kownkow Kedemawt süngrüp süngkangma hownia Hesbawn marow mang Sihun tut-e ang kowchin pe satang phowng mih khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />Ang krawi tek pe mih, ‘En kowh pren iawng pe mang anging diah. Hawmlawm pra hai lakuai pra krawi mangla dowi kowi tiama rowkrowk anging namang kown taih. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28-29" />Anging chala kown mih chakkham hai tui asung ün anging pela en kown taih. Jawrdan aw haipown hanow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai nape anging kown mih pren kowi ting dowi mowr mih en pren iawng pe mang anging diah; khawk hown taih anging namang kown. Seir hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh Esau krungchakuüa hai Ar marow kowi kowh Moabuüa iawng dow en paw pe mang anging diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 2:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Nachenganchepaw Hesbawn marow mang Sihun mih nauta dowi. Aia kowi dow enni rut kowi nape sumah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih aia kowh saktuak akhawtma hai laiüama changta pe khai. Aia kowh pren dow kawmat mowr a-i powngta pe khai.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Sünta, mang Sihun hai aia kowh pren dow en rut kowi ang apta en mih chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi kowkowiah hanow aia kowh pren mih kowpowngta kownkow hai kowuowi bowt kownkow tarowng büah bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32-33" />“Nami kung kowi dow mang Sihun mih aia kowh siphai hawmuüa maten kowi uang pawla now uang sen a-i kownkow Jahaz marow kowi uang khai. Nakhowk khe aia kowi dow a-i rut kowi CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai mih pe sumah khai. Aiamat hailawm aia kowh chapauüa hai aia kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi a-i saita khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:32-33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Nakhowk khe aia kowi dow a-i nowngta hanow aia kowh marow maten a-i piakta pe bowk khai. Nakowi kowh kachakuüa, masiuüa hai ngeuüa hawmh kowi asaima a-i saita khai; mia kowi paw a-i pe singah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Nachenganchepaw marow kowi kowh tawncher hai asung khakma mih uanh dow a-i matia vüi a-i uang lutla pe kria khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Arnawn lawngrawi ria kowi kowh Aroer marow hai nami lawngrawi kowi kowh marow hownia Gilead süng mowr a-i powngta pe bowk khai. A-i nowng powngla dowi mih marow dow lowkchow paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai mih a-i rut kowi apta a-i bowk khai. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nachenganchepaw Amawnuüa süng kowi kowh Jabawk aw ria, hungma mawngma süng hai CHAKRAMANG pe kowi a-i dowi mih arah kowi dow a-i krawi kowila dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Mang Awk kowi Israeluüa nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Nami kung kowi dow Basan pren pra kowh mangla mih tiama iawng a-i haimang khai. Nami khin khe uang dowk a-i tasen kownkow Basan pren mang Awk mih aia kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi uang pawla now Edrei marow kowi uang khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Mang Awk kowi hangkow kram diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aiamat hailawm aia kowh pren hai aia kowh siphai hawmuüa kowi dow en rut kowi ang apta en mih chowbowt. Hesbawn marow kowi kowh Amawruüa mang Sihun kowi en changah iawng aia kowi paw en nachangah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai mih Basan pren mang Awk kowi hai aia kowh siphai hawmuüa kowi dow a-i rut kowi ap a-i khai. Amatni kowi dow a-i saita bowk khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh marow maten mih a-i powngta pe bowk khai. Aia kowh 60 klüng mih marow dow a-i pawta pe bowk khai; lowkchow paw a-i pawta pe dowi mih marow uowi dowi chekhai. Basan pren kowi kowh Argawb süng maten dow Awk mang kowi a-i powngta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Basan pren kowi kowh marow maten dow tap kroma kangowh chekhai. Now <char style="w">tapplawt</char> kowi kowh aklia müa paw akhawtma kangowh chekhai. Now tap uowi dowi mih kua paw ahuma uowi khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Naiawngün kua hai marow dow asaima a-i piakta pe khai. Hesbawn marow mang kowi a-i changah iawng dow amatni kowh kachakuüa, masiuüa hai ngeuüa hawmh kowi asaima a-i saita pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Nachenganchepaw tawncher hai asung khakma mih uanh dow a-i matia vüi a-i uang pawla khai.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Naiawng hai Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh süng dow Amawruüa kowh mang pre ia hownia a-i powngta pe khai. Nami süng dow Arnawn lawngrawi hownia Hermawn hungh mowr chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(Sidawnuüa dow Hermawn kowi Siriawn pahai tek pe khai, now Amawruüa dow Senir pahai tek pe khai). <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Awk mang kowh pren maten dow a-i powngta pe bowk khai. Nai kowi kowh uowi mih marow ün, Gilead süng ün, Saleka marow hownia Edrei marow mowr Basan pren kowi kowh süng srui dow a-i powngta pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Refaimuüa pungmadawng kowi ta sing uowi mih dow Basan pren mang Awk lowk iachow taih. Mang Awk kowh <char style="w">salawnma</char> dow lawngha hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. Nami dow areng klang taku muk hai adowng phia tali muk chekhai. Nami salawnma dow kawmat pat Amawnuüa kowh Rabba marow kowi uowi reng tak chekhai).<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh süng taret mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Nakhowk khe Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh a-i powngah mih süng dow ang ret enni khai. Arnawn lawngrawi re-e kowh Aroer marow hownia tawngphak prakowi Gilead süng dawnglang dow Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa kowi ang peah khai. Nami dow Gilead süng tawngphak pra kowh adak rep kowi kowh marow maten chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Now Gilead süng tawngphak pra kowh aluk rep ta lat mih maten hai mang Awk kowh Basan pren dow Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang kowi ang peah khai. (Basan pren kowi kowh Argawb süng maten dow Refaimuüa kowh pren pahai tek pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Gesur hai Maka rihi mowr Argawb süng srui dow Manase krungchak Jair pami kowpowngta now aia ming chap pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Basan pren kowi dow kawmat mih ‘Jair Marow’ pahai tek pe khai).<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Now Gilead süng dow Manase chuprek chaprek Makir kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang peah khai. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Nachenganchepaw Gilead mrawkphak pra kowh süng maten dow Reuben hai Gad krungchakuüa kowi ang peah khai. Nami dow Arnawn lawngrawi dawnglang kowi kowh rihi mowr, now nami hownia Amawnuüa kowh rihi Jabawk aw mowr chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Amatni sum krungchak kowh satkup pra kowh süng dow Jawrdan lawngrawi chekhai. Nami lawngrawi rihi dow tawngphak pra kowh Galili sata hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Sata Kowng mowr chekhai. Now satlawt pra kowh rihi dow Pisga hungma mawngma daw hownia satkup pra kowh Jawrdan aw mowr chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Nami khin khe ang tek pe amatni mih, ‘Enni kowi dow mami pren napowngah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni khowk. Nachenganchepaw enni pungmadawng kowi kowh kür uowi miuüa nget dow natawi dowk tasen kownkow enni kowh tainau Israeluüa pur kowi Jawrdan aw narik pown kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Nakhowk khe chiang ang pe enni mih marow maten kowi enni kowh masi, chauüa hai tawncher ahuma mih enni ta ia towla kown. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Enni kowi iawng enni kowh tainau-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG pe tanaiah dowi mowr enni natawi khowngah kown takla. Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe enni mih pren enni kowh tainau-uüa kownowng powng dowi mowr dow enni natawi dowk tasen kown takla. Nami kung kowi chiang ang peta enni khowk mih mami süng kowi enni nauang ia plan kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanan pren kowi Mosi ka kup dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Nami khin khe Josua kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Mang Sihun hai mang Awk kowi tawng chow CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai changah mih en khi khowk. Naiawng hai Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh pren ün kowi paw CHAKRAMANG nachangah kown taih. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Naiawngün pren kowi hangkow kram büa diah. Enni vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai matia nadowk enni tasen iawk kown taih,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23-24" />“Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, ang chup en. Mün khowt chow en kowh kraingra hai en kowh kürra uowi mih en kowh nar kowi en uown tüng pe krowngchow khowk. En changah iawng mih lup nowng chang mih hai en tüngah iawng mih kür nowng tüng mih krawng luk kowi hai mukuang kowi mia iawng mih thurai tak chow uowi? <verse eid="DEU 3:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Jawrdan aw haipown kowh paimi hungma mawngma süng klangiungma mih pren hai Lebanawn hungh dow sakrauma hown pe khi ang diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Nachenganchepaw enni rakowi CHAKRAMANG kunmarau ang kowh sünta ang lai dowi bowt chekhai. Aia tek ang mih, ‘Nakhowk tak. Nami lawnguan kowi hauang tek ang tham bowt. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Pisga hungh chut kowi kowpün hanow satkup, satlawt, tawngphak hai mrawkphak prakowi krawi tang mü diah. Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi en tawi ka pown dowk chedow pren mih krawi tang müla akat now na towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Josua kowi tawng chow achang takla mih phai tekla pe diah. Aia kowi dow peah sakkraingra diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kawmuüa kowi nakruila hanow narik mang kown mih dow aia chekhai, now en nakowmüah kown mih pren dow maru kawmuüa hown aia nakowpowngta kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Naiawng rakowi Bet-Peur marow hown tatang klowk mih lawngrawi kowi a-i uowi hüah khai.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Lai chün lawnguan kowi Mosi peah ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />“Israeluüa low, kawmat kowh ang sang enni kown mih ana pek hai ari aiang maten kaneuma sünta büa diah. Maiawngün ana pek hai ari aiang dow enni nachünah kown takla. Enni che chün khai hanow enni nasing kown, now CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai nape enni kown chowbowt mih pren enni naka powng kown. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Ang nape enni kown mih ana kowi tawngpaw hangkow chütla diah, now iut paw hangkow iutla diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh ana pek ang nape enni kown mih srui enni nachünah kown.<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />“Baal-Peur kowi uowi khe tawng chow CHAKRAMANG chang enni mih enni matia mik hown enni khi khowk chekhai. Enni pungmadawng hownia Peur hungh kowi kowh Baal thurai kowi tawi chup miuüa maten kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih kowngta bowk khai. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Nachenganchepaw alai kowh enni pungmadawng kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e kaah sakowmma hai uowi mih maten dow kawmat paw sing uowi bowk tak chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai ana pek iawng mami ari arow hai ari aiang dow ang tüngsang enni khai. Maiawngün dow enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni nachünah kown. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Maiawngün ari aiang mih chünah büah kaneu diah. Maiawngün ari aiang chün mih hownia akeng chenchapuüa tut-e enni kowh chanlaira hai prengia natatüng kown. Maiawngün ari aiang lawnguan kowi ta hanow akeng chenchapuüa natek kown mih, ‘Kowbüah dow chanlaima, prengia chakma hai kri kraingma mih chenchap chekhai nowm,’ napa büah kown. <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />A-i iawng mih kri kraingma mih chenchap mia chow uowi? CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow a-i hawah now uang tatawn reng chekhai. Akeng chenchapuüa dow amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi hawah chepaw uang tatawn pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Ani kowh ang pe enni mih rirow hai ana pek dow aiungma hai anowmma chekhai. Maiawng mih rirow hai ana pek dow mia iawng mih chenchap kri kraingma mih tut-e chow uowi tak?<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />“Enni khi-ah mih maten natamata dowi kownkow enni sing uowi mowr dow uowiah kaneu büa diah, now kowmatia sak kowi paw khetah kaneu diah. Enni kowh chownglawng kowi tawng ngai chow Thurai chang enni mih enni kowh chu-uüa chauüa kowi enni natüngsangah kown: <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Sinai hungh kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni kowiowng khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Ang kowh laiklow natala kownkow maru kawmuüa kowi kuaah diah. Ang kowh laiklow ta hanow lusa kowi sing uowi mowr khe pacham ringkaw ang büa lah, now amatni kowh chauüa kowi ang kowh ana pek pacham tüngsangah büa lah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Nami khin khe enni kowkowiah hanow hungh tut kowi enni kowiowng khai. Nakhowk khe nami hungh dow uangnim atatma mih hown tamum klum hanow aiiuma chekhai, now maih lün paw kuang dawng mowr chi bia laplap khai. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Nami khin khe maih dawng hownia CHAKRAMANG mih uang klang enni khai. Aia kowh laiklow dow enni ta chowdiah. Tawkche aia powm dow enni khi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Aia dow enni tut-e aia kowh <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm</char> natown kown mih tek enni khai. Nami dow hamüt klüng mih ana pek chekhai. Nami hamüt klüng mih ana pek dow nachünah kownkow aia pe enni ana khai. Nami hamüt klüng mih ana pek dow huapher pre buk kowi aia ruiah khai. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün ana pek dow natüngsang enni kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek ang khai. Nahanow naiawngün ana pek dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi enni kowpowngah kown mih pren kowi paw enni naia chün kown towbowt.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hang arup chup mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15-19" />“Sinai hungh re-e maih dawng hownia CHAKRAMANG uang klang enni khe aia kowh powm dow enni khi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nachupah kownkow tawng iawng mih arup paw enni nathawp dowi kown mih kaneuma pe pe ching büa diah. Kachakuüa lah, masiuüa lah, krawng luk kowi kowh asadua lah, kuang dawng kowi kowh iow mih uakling uaber lah, kam hai sowr mih chap lah, tui kowi kowh uowi mih chap lah, kuang dawng kowi kowh krek, lama, sat hai nowi mih chap lah lusa kowi kowh maru maten vüi CHAKRAMANG towah mih chekhai. Naiawngün arup dow enni nathawp kown nadowi, now mukuang kowi kowh uowi mih chap kowi paw enni nachup kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 4:15-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Sak kowi towah büa diah. CHAKRAMANG dow lang klo enni khai, now taping maih iawng mih Aigupta pren hownia aia uang lawtla enni khai. Naiawng aia uang lawtla enni mih dow aiamat kowh maru enni pacham chowng lah pakowh chekhai. Now kawmat dow enni mih aia kowh maru chowng khai bowt.<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />“Enni rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow kunmarau ang khai. Naiawng rakowi nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren klangiung mih kowi aia dow pe kup ang dowi chekhai. Nami lawnguan kowi aia dow kham sawi se tekta ang khai bowt. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Ang dow mami re-e nakowng kown towbowt; Jawrdan aw ang tawi ka pown dowi bowt. Nachenganchepaw enni dow Jawrdan aw haipown hanow paimi pren klangiungma mih enni nakowpowng kown chowbowt. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Naiawng rakowi kaneu büa diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tow enni mih sangbowk laitawm hangkow tamata büah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai hang enni khowk iawng enni naia thawp arup kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lowra sia nowng kam mih maih iawng chekhai. Aia dow khowrbown dawma; aia klen kowi akeng chap kowi cham chup mih mapaw aia nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Pur prakowi dow paimi pren kowi enni naka chu naka chah kown, now akrama enni nauowi kown. Nakhowk khe paw enni matia vüi tawng iawng mih arup paw enni naia thawp kown nadowi. Thawp <char style="w">arup aren</char> mih dow angak chekhai. Naiawng chang mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Naiawng rakowi mami laiklow natawi thuak saksi kownkow ani mih krawng hai mukuang kowi ang towngla khai. Enni che ang kowh sangbowk laitawm piakta khai hanow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh pren kowi enni kowuowi khe alenma enni napiak kown. Paimi pren kowi akrama enni ka uowi dowi tham; enni nachum ngengche kown taih. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Now CHAKRAMANG mih akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi nauetta enni plawt kown. Nakowi dow maru iun a-echow taih enni natawi sing kown. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Nakhowk khe dow singh hai hua hown kowh maru thawpah mih thurai rup kowi enni natawi chup kown. Naiawngün arup dow khi paw khi dowi, ta paw ta dowi, cha paw cha dowi hai anam paw ia hüp dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün pren hownia dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni nacham kown. Enni kowh sak maiow hown che enni krawi cham khai hanow aia kowi dow enni nakrum kown. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Akrat pusara enni luk kowi uang ting mih khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai prakowi enni nauang plan kown, now aia laiklow enni nachün bowt kown. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow saksing sanara atekma chekhai. Aia dow natowta enni hüah kown nadowi, aia dow nachumta enni kown nadowi, now enni kowh pipu-uüa vüi kowi kowh aia towta sangbowk laitawm khowk mih paw natamata kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32-33" />“Palusama kowi krawi sam mü büah madiah. Enni vüi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG chang enni iawng akeng chenchap vüi kowi chang pe mih enni khi tak chünchü, now enni ta ne tak chünchü. Lusa kowi Thurai thawp maru hownia enni chowng mowr kowi krawi sam mü madiah. Maih hownia CHAKRAMANG klangah kung kowi enni iawng sing mih maru uowi ne chünchü. <verse eid="DEU 4:32-33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Nachangla enni aia maru kownkow Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai uang lawtla enni iawng akeng chenchapuüa kowi amatni kowh thuraiuüa lawtla mih uowi ne chünchü krawi sam mü büah madiah. Enni kowi dow enni matia pur kowi chaingra, awdara, tasenra, kürra hai kramra ün tüng enni khükhü CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla enni khai.<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />“Naiawngün lup maten tüng enni mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai pami hai aia klen kowi amia iawng mih paw Thurai uowi dowi bowt pami enni pacham tuk lah pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Aia dow natüngsang enni kownkow <char style="w">mukuang pren</char> hownia aia kowh laiklow pe sünta enni khai. Now lusa kowi dow aia kowh akraingma mih maih pe khi enni khai, now aia dow nami maih dawng hownia uang klang enni khai. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Aia dow enni kowh pipu-uüa kowi sakrauah khai, now amatni kowh krungchakuüa kowi aia kloah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow tawi uowila enni khükhü aia kowh kür akraingma mih hown Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni khai. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Naiawng aia chang enni mih dow enni lak-e kowh lang iuk hai lang kür mih chenchapuüa kowi prütta now amatni kowh pren nape powng enni kownkow hai nape uowi enni kownkow chekhai. Now nami iawng dow kawmat uang phaw khowk.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />“Ani kowh ang tek enni mih laiklow dow tukah reng büa diah, now sak kowi towah reng diah. CHAKRAMANG dow krawng hai mukuang kowi kowh Thurai chekhai; aia klen kowi akeng mih thurai lang uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ari aiang hai ana pek maten che enni chün khai hanow enni hai enni kowh chauüa naiung kown. Naiawngün ang pe enni ana mih dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma enni naia singla kownkow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satlawt pra kowh tatung tanimra marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41-43" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi mih Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh süng kowi marow sum buk ruiah khai. Nami marow dow cham saita maru kung kowi kowh tatung tanimra chekhai. Tawkchedow saita kown mih saktuak uowi dowi kowi rut tawi khawk tawi kowh saita mih maru chowtaih naiawngün marow kowi kowpowt hanow naia tatung tanim kown. Reuben krungchakuüa vüi tatung tanimra marow dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Bezer dowm nai chekhai. Gad krungchakuüa vüi tatung tanimra marow dow Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt marow chekhai. Manase krungchakuüa vüi tatung tanimra marow dow Basan süng kowi kowh Golan marow chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 4:41-43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Mosi plan phuang pe Thurai rirow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44-46" />Maiawngün ari aiang dow Israeluüa kowi kowh Mosi phuang pe mih chekhai. Nakhowk khe amatni uowi mih dow Bet-Peur pur pra kowh lawngrawi kowi chekhai. Nami dow Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowh pren kowi chekhai. Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt kung kowi Mosi hai Israeluüa rik nowngta mih dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:44-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Amatni dow mang Sihun kowh pren hai Awk mang kowh Basan pren powngta pe khai. Nami Amawruüa kowh mang pre ia kowh pren dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Nami pre pren kowh rihi dow Arnawn lawngrawi re-e kowh Aroer marow hownia Siriawn hungh mowr chekhai. (Siriawn hungh dow Hermawn hungh chekhai). <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Amatni kowh süng dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi chekhai. Nami süng mrawkphak pra kowh rihi dow Sata Kowng mowr chekhai, now satlawt pra kowh rihi dow Pisga hungma mawngma le mowr chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Thurai kowh hamüt klüng mih ana pek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Israeluüa maten kowi Mosi hawah now tek pe mih, “Israeluüa low, ani kowh ang pe enni kown mih rirow hai ana pek dow sünta büa diah. Naiawngün dow tasangah büa diah, now kaneuma chünah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai mih Sinai hungh kowi tow a-i sangbowk laitawm lowk khai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Nami sangbowk laitawm dow a-i pipu-uüa vüi krowngchow nadowi; nami dow kawmat kowh a-i sing uowi miuüa vüi paw na chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />CHAKRAMANG dow Sinai hungh luk kowi kowh maih hownia enni hown tatang klowk tek lai khai. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Nami khin khe kram maih kowh hungh kowi enni kowuam pün dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG hai enni takra kowi ang uowiah hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow ang phuang enni khai.<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />“Maih hownia CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup chang hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“‘Ang klen kowi dow akeng mih thurai kowi enni nachup naiia kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“‘Tawng iawng mih arup paw enni nathawp kown nadowi. Nami dow kuang kowi kowh uowi mih chap iawng pana lah, lusa kowi kowh uowi mih chap iawng pana lah, sata kowi kowh uowi mih chap iawng pana lah, enni nathawp kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Naiawngün arup kowi dow enni nachupiia kown nadowi, now amatni kowh lup enni nachang pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh Thurai. Ang dow khowrbown dawma; ang klen kowi akeng chap kowi enni cham chup mih mapaw ang nau dowi chekhai. Sui ang miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh angak <char style="w">ripra</char> sum tali chowng mowr ang peah reng kown. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Nachenganchepaw sakrau ang miuüa hai ang ana pek chün miuüa kowi dow athawng aiawng chowng mowr ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang natüng pe reng kown.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“‘CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ming enni narük naklak kown nadowi; rük naklak mih kowi dow ang naripah kown.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“‘CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ana pek iawng Tanai Ni dow khangah hanow chimsaima towah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Pasapta kowi taruk ni mowr mih enni kowh lup maten enni nachang kown. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />Nachenganchepaw ranit ni mih ni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi Tanai Ni chekhai. Nami ni dow enni matia lah, enni kowh chauüa lah, enni kowh narma narla lah, enni kowh chia hai <char style="w">kawrngaramchük</char> lah, enni kowh akeng mih tawncher lah, enni tut-e tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa lah, amia iawng mih paw nachang lup kown nadowi. Nahanow enni iawng dow enni kowh naruüa paw naka tanai kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Sak kowi towah büah reng diah. Akat khe dow Aigupta pren kowi enni paw nar taih chekhai. Nami nar lup changra hownia dow aia kowh bawng akürma mih hown CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih uang lawtla enni khai. Naiawngün lawnguan enni natukla reng kownkow Tanai Ni nasunah kown mih aia pe enni ana khai.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“‘CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ana pek chünah hanow enni kowh u-pa kowi ringkawah büa diah. Nahanow ang nape enni kown mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma enni nasing kown, now enni naiung kown.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“‘Hang sai maru sak.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“‘Hang chang iang.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“‘Hang ku.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“‘Klowkchakuüa luk kowi hang thuak dai lai saksi.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“‘Enni klowkchakuüa kowh masi chepaw, kim üa chepaw, krawng bawn chepaw, narma narla chepaw, chia hai kawrngaramchük chepaw, tawng iawng mih chap paw hang cham irh büa diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Sinai hungh luk kowi maih, uangnim hai iiu kraingma dawng hownia CHAKRAMANG mih maiawngün ana pek dow atünma uang phuang enni khai. Maiawngün klen kowi dow tawngpaw aia tekla enni dowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow akung kowi huapher pre buk mih kowi aia ruiah hanow pe ang khai.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Hungh luk kowi maih lün pluplup mih khin khe uangnim aiiuma mih hownia CHAKRAMANG klang enni mih klow dow enni ta khowk. Nami ni khe krungchak towng kowi kowh aluchowuüa hai lawngtang aluchowuüa mih ang tut-e uang khai. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Nakhowk khe enni tek ang mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow mün khowt chow kraingra hai rowsira uowi pami aia uang tüng anging khai. Maih dawng hownia aia kowh laiklow dow anging ta khai. Thurai kowh klow ta chepaw lusa maru ia sing mih anging tuk khowk. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Nachenganchepaw anging kram khai. CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowh klow che anging plan ta hanow anging nakowng ngengche kown chekhai. CHAKRAMANG kowh maih nakamta anging kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Lusa maru pungmadawng kowi maih dawng hownia masing Thurai kowh laiklow ta kung kowi a-i iawng sing mih mia chow uowi? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai tek mih en phai kowsünta diah. Aia tek en mih maten uang tek anging taih; en tek iawng anging nachün kown taih,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Naiawng enni tek ang mih dow CHAKRAMANG tawi ta chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek ang mih, ‘Naiawngün maru-uüa tek en mih ang ta khowk. Kowbüah tek en mih iung chow. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ringkawma hown nakram ang kown mih hai ang kowh ana pek nachün kown mih sak amatni tut-e pacham uowi reng lah. Nahanow amatni hai amatni kowh chauüa mih chowngchowng saksakma naiung kown. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Amatni dow tangbung kowi naplan bowt kown mih tek pe diah. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Nachenganchepaw en dow ang tut-e mami re-e ta uowi diah. Ang kowh ana pek, ari arow hai ari aiang maten ang nape en kown, now naiawngün dow kowbüah kowi en natüngsangah kown. Amatni kowi ang pe powngah mih pren kowi kowuowi büah khe naiawngün dow nachünah büah kown,’ pah ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Israeluüa kowi Mosi plan tek pe mih, “Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih ana maten kaneuma enni nachünah kown takla. Nami ana pek hownia dow ditchow paw enni naia süt kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Enni namangah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni ana mih tiama kowi mang büa diah. Nahanow enni nasing kown, now iungra paw enni naka kown. Nami klen kowi enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma enni nauowi kown.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Lang pankri mih ana pek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Maiawngün ari aiang hai ana pek maten dow ang natüngsang enni kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe ang ana khai. Maiawngün dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh pren enni kowpowng mih khin khe enni nachünah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Enni hailawm enni kowh chauüa hai enni kowh krungchakuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek hai ari arow maten chownglawng prat chünah büa diah, now CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kramah büa diah. Nahanow nami pren kowi dow chowngdawng sakklangma enni nasing kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Israeluüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah: Mami rirow hai ana pek maten dow kaneuma chünah büa diah. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai khamta khowk iawng dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni naiung kown, now lainowmma enni naprung nase kown.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Israeluüa low, sünta büa diah! CHAKRAMANG lowkchow taih a-i kowh Thurai. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi dow enni kowh sak maiow hai enni kowh kür maiow hown sakrauah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Ani kowh maiawngün ang pe enni mih ana maten dow sak kowi towah büa reng diah. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Maiawngün ana maten dow enni kowh chauüa kowi plan plan tüngsangah büa diah. Kim kowi uowi khe, cham mang cham kat khe, tanai khe, now chang lup khe maiawngün lawnguan dow lawp pe büah reng diah. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Maiawngün ana pek dow ruiah hanow bawng kowi hai kaubeng kowi sükah büah reng diah. Nami dow ana pek enni naia ka tuakla reng kown mih amat müa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Now enni kowh kimplawt mawm kowi hai marow tapplawt kowi naiawngün ana pek dow ruiah büah reng diah.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi natamata dowi kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Enni kowh pipu Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah tut-e CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai napeah kown pahai khamah mih pren kowi aia nakowpawla enni kown. Now nakowi kowh klangiungma mih hai aiuk aiukma mih marow dow aia nape enni kown; naiawngün marow dow enni thawpah mih nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11-12" />Aiung aiungma mih uanh atekma mih kim maten dow aia nape enni kown; naiawngün uanh dow enni kramah mih nadowi chekhai. Now tuikuam maten aia nape enni kown; naiawngün tuikuam dow enni thaiah mih nadowi chekhai. Now grep krum hai kanrawn khang maten paw aia nape enni kown; naiawngün dow enni matia changah mih nadowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw enni chak du mih khin khe kaneu büah. Nadowi now Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang lawtla enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowi enni natamata kown chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 6:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni ringkawah kown, now aia kowi chowtaih enni nachupiia kown. Now enni takham sawi mih khin khe paw aia ming hown chowtaih enni nakham sawi kown. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Enni riaret kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi enni nachupiia kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowila enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow khowrbown dawma; aia klen kowi akeng mih thurai kowi cham chupiia kown mih mapaw aia nau dowi chekhai. Akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi che enni cham chupiia khai hanow aia dow maih lün pluplup mih iawng lainowmma nakunmarau enni kown, now aia dow lusa hownia napiakta enni kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Masa pami arah kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni chaingah iawng hangkow chaingah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih ana pek, rirow hai alow pek maten dow enni nachünah ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />CHAKRAMANG mik kowi anama mih hai aiungma mih chang büa diah. Nahanow enni naiung kown, now enni pipu-uüa kowi aia napeah kown pahai aia khamah mih pren dow enni naka powng kown. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />Now CHAKRAMANG tekta khowk iawng dow enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi enni pur hownia enni naia prütta kown.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“‘Maiawngün ana pek, rirow hai alow pek maten CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pe a-i mih auan tawng chow?’ padow pur prakowi enni kowh chauüa nalünta enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Aigupta pren kowi kowh <char style="w">Faraw</char> nar kowi anging uowi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw nami hownia CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kür akraingma mih hown uang lawtla anging khai. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Faraw luk kowi, aia kimchakuüa luk kowi hai Aigupta prenchak luk kowi awdara lup hai kramra uowima mih amatra lup CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih dow anging khi khai. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Aia dow nami pren hownia uang lawtla anging khai. Nami dow a-i kowh pipu-uüa kowi peah kown pahai aia khamah mih pren kowi uang pawla anging now nape anging kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Now maiawngün rirow nachün kown mih hai CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown nakramah kown mih CHAKRAMANG pe a-i ana khai. Nahanow ani kowh a-i iung iawng a-i naiung reng kown, now a-i nasing uowi reng kown. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowh ana pek maten aia tek iawng a-i che chün khai hanow aia dow nasak-ih a-i kown,’ napape kown.<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchapuüa kowi prütta kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi nakowpawla enni kown. Now aia dow enni pur hownia chenchap ahuma kowi naprütta kown. Naiawngün chenchapuüa dow Hituüa, Girgasuüa, Amawruüa, Kananuüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa chekhai. Naiawngün ranit chenchap kowi kowh maru iun dow enni lak-e lang kawm chekhai, now kür paw lang kür chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG naapta enni kown, now amatni kowi dow enni nanowngta kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi dow asaima enni napiakta kown takla. Amatni hown dow tawng iawng mih sangbowk laitawm paw enni natow kown nadowi, now sana paw enni nasanaah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Amatni hown dow mapaw enni naia <char style="w">tachawng</char> talang kown nadowi. Enni kowh chamauüa kowi paw amatni kowh chapauüa hown enni nape tachawngah kown nadowi, now enni nachangla iaumow kownkow amatni kowh chamauüa kowi paw enni napaw kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowi enni kowh chapauüa chupiia reng mih hownia naiawngün chamauüa dow amatni kowh thuraiuüa prakowi nacham pawla kown chekhai, now enni kowh chapauüa dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi natawi chupiia kown chekhai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow maih lün pluplup mih iawng lainowmma nakunmarau enni kown, now alenma napiakta enni kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Naiawng rakowi naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh <char style="w">phuchuara</char> ün enni napiakta pe kown. Amatni phuchuaah mih chüng-ün enni nadita pe nak kown, now Asera limpu ün paw enni nakripta pe kown. Now amatni kowh arup maten dow maih kowi enni natikta pe kown.<verse eid="DEU 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />“Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi kowh lang kloah mih chenchap chekhai. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow aia kowh asung uowima mih dawngthawnguan nachangla enni kownkow palusama kowi kowh chenchap hownia lang klo enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />CHAKRAMANG sakrau enni mih hai lang klo enni mih dow akeng chenchapuüa lak-e enni kowh maru iun lang kawm kowh nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow palusama kowi kowh chenchap lak-e maru iun lang e chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Aia lang klo enni mih dow aia sakrau enni kowh chekhai, now enni pipu-uüa tut-e aia kowh khamta mih lai natownla reng kownkow chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh kür akraingma mih hown Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang lawtla enni khai. Aia dow Faraw rut hownia uang lawtla enni khai. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow Thurai ching pami tukah büa diah. Aia dow kaah sakowm mih Thurai chekhai; aia kowi sakrauah mih hai aia kowh ana pek chün miuüa kowi dow athawng aiawng chowng mowr aia town pe sangbowk laitawm reng chekhai, now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura paw aia tüng pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowi kowh sui miuüa kowi dow aia mata kown mih kra dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Naiawng rakowi ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek, rirow hai alow pek maten kaneuma enni nachünah kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chün lai rakowi ka prasi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Maiawngün rirow dow towsakma hai kaneuma chünah büa diah. Nahanow enni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh aia khamta mih iawng enni hown kowh aia towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai natown enni reng kown, now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura aia natüng enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Aia dow nasakrau enni kown, nape enni prasi kown, now nape prung enni kown. Enni pipu-uüa kowi peah kown pahai aia khamah mih pren kowi dow aia nape enni prasi kown. Nahanow chauüa, luprak, grep tui, kanrawn sau hai tawncher ahuma enni naka kown. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Akeng mih chenchapuüa lak-e enni nalang ka prasi kown. Enni pungmadawng kowi dow ka chah dowi mih amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi, now enni kowh tawncher hawmh paw pen chah dowi mih nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow rawka maten hownia nalawng enni kown. Now Aigupta pren kowi kowh enni khi-ah mih rawka ngak maten dow aia nauang pawla enni kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw enni kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi dow nami rawka aia nauang pawla pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai apta enni mih chenchapuüa kowi dow enni napiakta bowk kown takla. Amatni kowi dow enni nasanaah kown nadowi, now amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi paw enni natawi chupiia kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow enni vüi leng kowi tasowk khe kowh iawng naown kown chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Sakdawng kowi maiawng enni naka tuak chepaw naia kown, ‘Maiawngün chenchapuüa dow a-i lak-e maru iun lang kawm; amatni kowi dow tawng iawng chow a-i naia prütah kown?’ napa kown. <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow hangkow kram büa diah. Faraw hai Aigupta prenchakuüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tawng chow changah mih tukah büah reng diah. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow kramra uowima mih chaingra hown, awdara lup hown, amatra hown, aia kowh akürma mih kraingra hown aia uang lawtla enni mih enni khi khowk chekhai. Kawmat kowh enni kramah mih chenchapuüa luk kowi paw CHAKRAMANG dow naiawng nachangah kown.<verse eid="DEU 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />“Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing miuüa hai cham tapet miuüa luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih nauang krawi chin pe takrow takraira kown, now amatni dow napiak bowk kown. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Amatni kowi dow hangkow kram büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow tawi uowila enni reng chekhai. Aia dow akri akraingma hai kramra uowima mih Thurai chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow amatni kowi salow salowchow enni pur hownia naprütta kown. Amatni bowkbowk kowi dow amaisang enni naprütta kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng che enni chang hanow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh nahu lai kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow enni rut kowi naapta enni kown. Amatni kowi dow enni piakta bowk dowi mowr takrow takraima hown aia natowah kown. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Now amatni kowh manguüa kowi paw aia dow naapta enni kown. Naiawngün manguüa kowh ming dow lusa hownia enni namata kown. Amatni bowkbowk kowi enni nowng piakta dowi mowr mia iawng mih paw naia enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Amatni kowh thurai rup ün dow maih kowi enni natikta pe bowk kown. Now sowla arup mih kuh hai tai dow hang ir büa diah, now enni matia vüi paw hang paw büa diah. Enni che ir hai pawta khai hanow leng kowi tasowk mih iawng enni naown kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e suiiai kaniaima mih uanh chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih uanh dow kim kowi enni nauang pawla kown nadowi. Enni che uang pawla khai hanow CHAKRAMANG napiakta enni kown chekhai. Naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih uanh dow lainowmma enni nasuiah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün uanh dow napiakta kown mih CHAKRAMANG nau chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh lup sak kowi towah kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek maten dow kaneuma chünah büa diah. Nahanow enni nasing kown, now enni naprung kown. Enni pipu-uüa kowi napeah kown pahai CHAKRAMANG khamah mih pren kowi dow kowkupah hanow enni naka powng kown. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Mami 40 ning mowr süngrüp süngkangma iawng tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai uang pawla enni mih tuakah büah reng diah. Enni sak kowi tawng chow uowi mih natukla kownkow, aia kowh ana pek enni chün tak chünchü pami natukla kownkow hai enni kowh bawrira napiakta enni kownkow kawmkrat hown aia chaing enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Aia dow enni kowh bawrira napiakta enni kownkow pe enni sakkraira hanow <char style="w">manna kawm</char> pe cha enni khai. Nami manna kawm dow enni pipu-uüa khowm padow katpaw khi dowi chekhai. Nami hownia aia tüngsang enni kown nau mih dow — kawm hown krowngchow nadowi maru sing, Thurai nawr hownia kowh uang lawt mih laiklow maten hown chowtaih maru sing — pami chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Mami 40 ning kowi enni kowh tawnguat paw piak dowi chekhai, now enni kowh khawk paw bau dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Achauüa kowi a-pa hawiah iawng dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai paw hawi enni reng pami sak kowi towah büa diah.<verse eid="DEU 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh ana pek enni nachün kown takla, aia tiama kowi enni namang kown takla, now aia kowi enni ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow aiungma mih pren kowi nakowpawla enni kown chowbowt. Nakowi dow hungh hai lawngrawi hownia kowh uang hawr mih aw ün, awchawng ün hai krawng dawng tui ün uowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8-9" />Nami pren kowi kowh hungh kowi dow thaiah hanow enni naka kri kown, now nakowi kowh hua kowi dow bawpah hanow enni naka lawngha kown. Nakowi dow ahuma enni naka chakkham kown; tawng chap paw enni nakhawr kown nadowi. Nakowi dow püm ün, iakmow ün, grep ün, uidut singh ün, <char style="w">dalim</char> singh ün, kanrawn singh ün hai kuai tui ün ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 8:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Nakowi dow enni nau mowr enni naka cha kown. Now pren aiungma mih pe enni khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni natek pe awmrawm lai kown.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi tamata dowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />“Nachenganchepaw kaneu büa diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi hangkow tamata büa diah. Ani kowh ang pe enni mih aia kowh ana pek hai rirow maten dow chünah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Pur prakowi du pat enni naka cha kown, now kim klangiung klangiungma mih thawp hanow enni nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />Now enni kowh chia hawmh, rua hawmh hai ruapur hawmh dow naprung kown. Enni kowh kuh, tai hai dawngthawnguan dow nahu kown. <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng uang phaw mih khin khe dow hang chang bawri büa diah. Nadowi now Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang klanla enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni tamata kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Aia dow aphiama mih hai kramra uowima mih süngrüp süngkangma hownia uang pawla enni khai. Nakowi dow akru uowima mih rua hai krawng dak rowp ün ahuma uowi khai. Nakowi dow krawng kangkhawngma, tui paw uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow singku huamang hownia pe enni tui khai. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Aia dow naiawng mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi pe cha enni manna kawm khai. Nami manna kawm dow enni kowh pipu-uüa khowm padow katpaw khi dowi chekhai. Aia dow enni kowh bawrira napiakta enni hanow achur kowi nape enni iungra kownkow kawmkrat hown aia chaing enni khai. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Kaneu büah, ‘Maiawngün dawngthawnguan dow ang matia kür hown, ang matia rut hown ang changah kowh ang kaah mih chowtaih,’ pahai sakdawng kowi enni naia tuak kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi hangkow tamata büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dawngthawnguan nakala kown mih kür pe enni mih dow aia chowtaih. Aia pe enni kür mih dow enni kowh pipu-uüa tut-e aia towah mih sangbowk laitawm nape tachiah kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi dow katpaw hangkow tamata büa diah. Now akeng mih thuraiuüa kung kowi dow hang cham krawi büa diah. Naiawngün thuraiuüa kowi dow chup paw hangkow chup büa diah. Enni che chup khai hanow enni napiak ngengche kown pami ani ang tek enni khowk chaw. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow enni chün dowi hanow enni pur kowi kowh chenchapuüa kowi aia piakah iawng enni kowi paw aia napiak enni kown.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Israeluüa ka pren mih tachi tanawm rakowi nadowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Israeluüa low, sünta büa diah! Ani dow enni napown Jawrdan aw kown chowbowt. Now enni lak-e kowh maru iun lang kawm mih hai lang kür mih chenchapuüa kowh pren dow enni nakowpowngta pe kown chowbowt. Amatni kowh marow dow aiukma kangowh chekhai, now marow tapat lut kowi kowh tap paw akro kuang dawnglang mowr chi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Nami pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Anakuüa chekhai. Amatni dow akroma hai akürma kangowh chekhai. Amatni kowh lawnguan dow enni tuk khowk. Amatni kowi dow miapaw nowng senah dowi pami maru-uüa tek mih paw enni ta khowk chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Nachenganchepaw ani mih enni haipown Jawrdan aw khe CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow kam iawmlawm mih maih iawng enni pur kowi narik mang kown pami sak kowi towah büa diah. Aia dow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi enni tut-e nape sumah kown, now aia napiakta bowk kown. Enni tut-e CHAKRAMANG khamta iawng naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow enni naprütta kown, now alenma enni napiakta kown.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai prütta enni kung kowi dow, ‘Ang dow <char style="w">achinawmma</char> chekhai rakowi mami pren nape powng ang kownkow makowi CHAKRAMANG uang pawla ang mih chekhai’ pami sakdawng kowi hangkow tuak büa diah. Naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG naprütta kown mih dow amatni kowh angak rakowi chowtaih; nami dow enni achinawmma mih rakowi nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi aia naprütta enni kown mih dow amatni kowh ngak rakowi chowtaih. Nami dow enni achinawmma mih hai anowmma mih rakowi nadowi chekhai. Nami dow enni kowh pipu Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah tut-e aia khamah mih nape tachi-ah kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Enni achinawmma mih rakowi mami klangiungma mih pren CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe powng enni mih nadowi pami tukah büah reng diah. Enni dow laiüama mih chenchap chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuh hown kowh chia chah rup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Süngrüp süngkangma kowi enni uowi reng tak khe tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG kowi enni pe kunmarauah mih tuakah büah reng diah. Nami dow katpaw hangkow tamata büa diah. Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt mih ni hownia mami arah kowi uang ting mowr pat CHAKRAMANG kowi enni hing kingküata hüah chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Sinai hungh kowi khowm padow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma enni towkah kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow napiakta enni kown chowdiah. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />CHAKRAMANG mih enni hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm ruila mih huapher pre buk nakowpaw kownkow hungh luk kowi ang kowpün khai. Nami khin khe hungh luk kowi 40 ni hai 40 uar mowr ang uowila khai. Nami 40 ni hai 40 uar mowr mih tawngpaw cha paw ang cha dowi, now kham paw ang kham dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Nami ni khe CHAKRAMANG pur kowi enni bowkbowk uang takua talawm khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow hungh luk kowi maih hownia uang pe enni ana khai. Naiawngün ana pek maten dow nami huapher pre buk mih kowi aia rut hown aia ruiah khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Now 40 ni 40 uar kowi kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih nami sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk mih pe ang khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Nami kung kowi dow aia tek ang mih, ‘Alenma hungh hownia iu dowm diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia kowh en uang lawtla mih maru-uüa piak bowk khowk. Amatni dow ang kowh ana pek nawngchow sang nuata khai bowt. Amatni dow amatni vüi kuh klaiah hanow thawp arup lowk khowk,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“CHAKRAMANG plan tek ang mih, ‘Maiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow ang müah reng. Amatni dow laiüama mih chenchap pami ang tuk. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Hauang hang ang diah. Amatni kowi dow ang napiakta bowk kown, now lusa hownia amatni kowh ming dow ang namata kown. Nami kung kowi en hownia dow amatni lak-e lang kür hai lang kawm mih chenchap ang nathawpah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Nami kung kowi dow sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk mih dowkla now hungh hownia ang uang dowm khai. Nami khin khe paw hungh kowi dow maih lün reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Now CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai luk kowi enni chang angak mih ang khi khai. Enni dow naphuchuaah kownkow kuh chawrah hanow enni thawp chia chah rup khai. CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih ana pek maten dow alenma enni nuata khai bowt. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Naiawng rakowi ang rut kowi kowh huapher pre buk mih dow ang iu theuta khai. Nami huapher pre buk mih dow enni pur kowi teu khai.<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />“Nami kung kowi paw CHAKRAMANG pur kowi 40 ni 40 uar ang kowtabawk khai iawk. Nami khin khe paw tawng chap paw ang cha ang kham dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow angak changra hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi pe kunmarauah khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow lainowmma ang kram khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow napiakta enni kownkow kamrütta khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow nami leng paw plan sünta ang laiklow khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Aia dow Arawn kowi paw kunmarau lai rakowi napiakta kownkow kamrütta khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Arawn vüi ang kowlü pe lawt hanow aia dow plan sünta ang khai iawk. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Enni thawp chia chah rup mih hownia enni chang angak khai. Naiawng rakowi nami chia chah rup dow maih kowi ang tikta enni khai. Nami kung kowi nami chia chah rup dow dinchow iawng adima ang changah hanow hungh hownia kowh uang hawr mih aw tui kowi kowh tuilowng kowi ang kuakah khai.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Now Tebera, Masa hai Kibrawt-Hattava kowi paw CHAKRAMANG kowi enni pe kunmarauah khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Kades-Barnea hownia enni uang lawt mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek enni mih, ‘Ang pe enni mih pren kowi kowkowiah now kowpowng büa diah,’ pakhai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni kingküaah khai. Aia kowi dow enni owmah dowi chekhai, now aia laiklow paw enni sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Ang uown tuk enni hownia enni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi hing kingküata hüah chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“CHAKRAMANG napiakta enni kown pahai aia tek mih rakowi 40 ni 40 uar mowr CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ang kowtabawk khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Aia tut-e dow maiawng hai ang awr lü khai, ‘Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh maru-uüa kowi hangkow mata diah. Amatni dow en kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai. Amatni kowi dow en kowh kür akraingma mih hai en kowh rut akürma mih hown Aigupta pren hownia en uang lawtla khai. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />En kowh nar Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah tut-e kowh en khamah mih laiklow tuakah diah. Maiawngün maru-uüa kowh Lai üara, angak changra hai angak dow hangkow mü pe diah. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Naiawng che en mata khai hanow Aigupta prenchakuüa natek kown mih, “Amatni kowi napeah kownkow aia khamah mih pren kowi CHAKRAMANG kownowng pawla dowi chekhai. Now amatni kowi aia suiah khai rakowi nakowngta kownkow mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi aia uang pawla mih chekhai,” napa büah kown. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Nachenganchepaw en dow amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Amatni dow en kowh maru hai en kowh asung uowima mih dawngthawnguan chowtaih. Amatni kowi dow en kowh kür akraingma mih hai en kowh rut akürma mih hown Aigupta pren hownia en uang lawtla mih chekhai,’ ang pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Huapher sar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Auown khe kowh huapher pre buk mih iawng plan thawp huapher sar pre buk iawk diah. Now huapher towk rah paw singh hown thawpla <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</char> lowk diah. Nami kung kowi dow hungh luk kowi ang tut-e uang awr pün diah. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Nami huapher sar pre buk mih kowi dow en kuakta mih huapher kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow maten ang naplan rui en iawk kown. Nami kung kowi nami huapher pre buk mih dow nami tawkpla kowi en natowah kown,’ pah ang khai.<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Naiawng rakowi ri singh hown ang thawp sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lowk khai. Now auown khe kowh huapher pre buk mih iawng ang plan thawp huapher pre buk khai. Nami kung kowi dow nami huapher pre buk mih dowkla hanow hungh luk kowi ang awr pün khai. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow auown khe kowh huapher pre buk mih kowi kowh laiklow maten nami huapher sar pre buk mih kowi ruiah hanow pe ang khai. Nami huapher kowi kowh laiklow maten dow hamüt chap mih ana pek chekhai. Nami dow aia kua enni mih ni khe kowh hungh luk kowi kowh maih dawng hownia aia uang phuang enni mih ana chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Nami kung kowi dow hungh hownia ang uang dowm khai bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng nami huapher pre buk mih dow ang thawpah mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi ang towah khai. Naiawngün dow kawmat paw sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />“(Nami kung kowi Israeluüa dow Bane-Jakan hownia lawt büah hanow Mosera kowi kowtowm büah khai. Nakowi dow Arawn kowng khai, now aia kowi dow dupah khai. Now Arawn kowh <char style="w">uamow</char> lang kri mih arah dow achapa Eleazar ta paw khai. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Nami kung kowi dow Gudgoda kowi kowuowi büah khai. Now Gudgoda hownia lawt hanow Jawtbatha kowi kowuowi büah khai. Nakowi dow aw ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow aiamat kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nakawtla kownkow, aia pur kowi naia chang lup kownkow hai aia ming hown maru-uüa kowi napela prasi kownkow Leviuüa kowi aia lang kloah khai. Leviuüa dow kawmat paw naiawngün lup chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa dow amatni kowh tainau Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawng iawng mih dawngthawnguan bak paw tawi ka powng büah dowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai tekta iawng amatni kowh dawngthawnguan dow CHAKRAMANG towbowt).<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />“Auown khe kowh iawng nami leng paw 40 ni 40 uar hungh luk kowi ang kowuowi khai. Nami leng paw CHAKRAMANG sünta ang laiklow khai. Now aia dow mata enni dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Rü now maru kawmuüa kowi kruila diah. Nahanow amatni pipu-uüa kowi napeah kownkow ang khamah mih pren kowi kowkup now nami pren mih amatni naia powng kown towbowt,’ pah ang khai.<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek nachün kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Israeluüa low, CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih tawng chow enni nachang kown mih nau enni? Aia nau enni mih dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown mih, aia tiama kowi namang kown mih, aia kowi nasakrauah kown mih, enni kowh sak maiow hai singra maiow hown aia kowh lup enni nachang kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />Now ani kowh ang pe enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek maten hai ari arow maten enni nachün kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow enni iung müa vüi ang pe enni mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />“Sünta büah, mukuang hai mukuang luk kowi kowh uowi mih maten, now lusa hai lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh sakraura nakala kownkow aia dow enni kowh pipu-uüa kowi lang kloah khai. Aia dow akeng mih chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia lang klo enni khai. Now enni dow kawmat paw aia lang kloah mih chenchap chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow chün büah bowt; hang lai üa büah tham bowt. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow thuraiuüa maten luk kowi kowh Thurai chekhai, now aia dow <char style="w">chakramang</char> maten luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Aia dow akri akraingma, akürma hai kramra uowima mih Thurai chekhai. Aia dow amia iawng mih pra paw lang tangi dowi chekhai. Now aia dow cha büm cha sua dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Aia dow saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm reng chekhai. Now enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa kowi paw aia dow sakrauah reng chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow chakkham hai khupdip tawngklai aia peah reng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Naiawng rakowi enni paw prenlang maru-uüa kowi sakrauah büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni paw prenlang maru iawng Aigupta pren kowi uowila akat chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown. Now aia kowh lup chowtaih enni nachang kown. Aia kaah sakowm iawng enni nauowi kown takla, now enni takham mih khin khe paw aia ming hown chowtaih enni natakham kown. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Aia kowi chowtaih enni nakiowah kown; aia dow enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Enni vüi kowi kowh kri kraingra hai awdara uowima mih lup maten aia chang mih enni khi khowk chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Aigupta pren kowi enni kowh pipu-uüa kowkowi mih khin khe dow amatni mih 70 iachow taih chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow kuang kowi kowh krek nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng maru iun akawmma CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chang enni khai.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni nasakrauah kown, now aia nau iawng enni nauowi kown. Now aia kowh rirow, ana pek hai alow pek maten dow atungma enni nachünah kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Maiawngün ang tekah mih laiklow dow enni chauüa tut-e nadowi pami ani mih sak kowi towah büa diah. Maiawngün dow enni tut-e kowh ang tekah mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh chauüa dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh ripra lawnguan kowi tuk paw tuk dowi, now khi paw khi dowi tak chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra hai kür khi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />Now Aigupta pren kowi kowh Faraw hai aia prenchakuüa luk kowi aia chang pe mih awdara lup maten paw amatni tawi khi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Now Aigupta siphai hawmh, amatni kowh kawrnga hai <char style="w">kawrnga kari</char> luk kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG changah mih amatni khi dowi chekhai; Aigupta maru-uüa uang kawikrawi enni mih khin khe tawng iawng chow sata Rik kowi aia pe tamirah mih hai asaima aia piakah mih tawi khi büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Mami arah kowi enni uang ting dowi mowr süngrüp süngkangma kowi enni vüi CHAKRAMANG changah mih srui paw enni kowh chauüa tawi khi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Now Reuben krungchak kowi kowh Eliab chapa Dathan hai Abiram iüah luk kowi CHAKRAMANG changah mih paw tawi khi büah dowi chekhai. Amatchi hailawm amatchi kowh kimchakuüa, amatchi kowh tangbung hai amatchi kowh tawncher maten kowi amatchi iowngra re-e krawng awr talak phak hanow iawnta bowk mih paw enni kowh chauüa tawi khi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Nachenganchepaw enni dow naiawngün akraingma mih lup CHAKRAMANG chang mih enni matia mik hown enni khi khowk chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khamah mih pren kowi kowh prasira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Naiawng rakowi ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek maten dow enni nachünah kown takla. Nahanow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh pren nakowpowng kown mih kür enni kowh nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />Now nami pren kowi dow chowngdawng sakklangma enni nasing kown. Nami pren dow enni kowh pipu-uüa kowi hai amatni kowh krungchakuüa kowi napeah kownkow CHAKRAMANG khamah mih chekhai. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Nami enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren dow enni uang lawtla mih Aigupta pren iawng nadowi. Aigupta pren kowi dow enni sawt liu hanow tui paw enni athut takla reng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Nachenganchepaw Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi kowh hungh hai lawngrawi dow ka uang tui reng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Nami pren dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mingkhetah reng chekhai. Nami pren kowi dow ning uown hownia ning chur pat aia müah reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13-14" />“Enni che ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana maten kaneuma chünah khai, CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni sakrauah khai, now enni kowh sak maiow hown aia kowh lup enni chang pe khai hanow aia dow akhin khe nape enni uang kown. Nahanow luprak ün, grep tui sar ün hai kanrawn sau ün ahuma enni naka kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Now enni kowh tawncher hawmh vüi paw aia dow dowm kowi bawrchak nape awmah kown. Now enni paw du pat naka cha kown.<verse eid="DEU 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chün lai kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />“Nachenganchepaw kaneuma uowiah büa diah. Naiawng nadowi now puanra kowi enni nacham kla hanow CHAKRAMANG hownia enni natala kown chekhai. Nahanow akeng thuraiuüa kowh lup enni nacham chang ün tarawng, now akeng thuraiuüa kowi enni nacham chupiia kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Naiawng che enni chang khai hanow CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma nakunmarau enni kown. Aia dow nataingta enni uang hanow enni kowh üa hai laih kowi dow luprak naphaw kown nadowi bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih klangiungma mih pren kowi alenma enni napiak kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Naiawng rakowi maiawngün ang kowh ana pek maten dow sak kowi towah now ka tuakah büah reng diah. Maiawngün ana pek dow ruiah hanow bawng kowi hai kaubeng kowi sükah büah reng diah. Nami dow ana pek enni naia ka tuakla reng kown mih amat müa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Maiawngün ana pek maten dow enni kowh chauüa kowi plan plan tüngsangah büa diah. Kim kowi uowi khe, cham mang cham kat khe, tanai khe, now chang lup khe maiawngün lawnguan dow lawp pe büah reng diah. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Now enni kowh kimplawt mawm kowi hai marow tapplawt kowi naiawngün ana pek dow enni naruiah kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni pipu-uüa kowi napeah kownkow CHAKRAMANG takhamta khowk mih pren kowi dow enni hai enni kowh chauüa mih chowngdawng sakklangma nasing kown. Nami pren kowi dow krawng hai mukuang uowi mowr enni nasing kown.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi nasakrau kown mih, aia tiama kowi namang kown mih hai aia kowi naowmah kown mih ana ang pe enni khowk. Naiawngün ana maten dow enni nachünah kaneu kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Nahanow akeng chenchapuüa kowi dow enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG naprütta enni kown. Now enni lak-e kowh maru iun lang kawm mih hai lang kür mih chenchapuüa kowh pren dow enni napowngta pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Enni krawi chawpah mih arah maten dow enni kowh pren nachowng kown. Enni kowh pren sünghi dow mrawkphak prakowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma hownia tawngphak prakowi kowh Lebanawn hungh mowr, now satlawt prakowi kowh Iufratis aw hownia satkup prakowi kowh Mediteranean sata mowr naown kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Enni kowi dow amiapaw naia enni kown nadowi. Enni krawi kowiah mih pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi dow enni lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih kramra hai takrow takraira napeah kown. Naiawng aia nachang kown mih dow aia khamta lai mih rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Sünta büah, ani mih enni pur kowi prasira hai <char style="w">piati</char> ang towta enni khowk. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Ani kowh ang pe enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh ana pek maten enni che chün khai hanow prasira enni naka kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ana pek enni che chün dowi, ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek iawng enni mang dowi, now katpaw enni tukah dowi mih thuraiuüa kowi enni cham chupiia khai hanow piatira dow enni luk kowi nauang kla kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Enni napowngah kownkow enni kowkupah kown mih pren kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nakowpawla enni kown. Nami khin khe dow Gerizim hungh hownia prasira laiklow enni naphuang kown, now Ebal hungh hownia dow piati laiklow enni naphuang kown. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Nami pre buk mih hungh dow Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi kowh Kananuüa uowiah mih Jawrdan lawngrawi kowi chekhai. Nami dow Gilgal marow re-e kowh Mawre kowh chimsaima mih singh hown atawnchow chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31-32" />Enni dow Jawrdan aw haipown hanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren nakowpowng kown chowbowt. Nakowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe dow ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek hai rirow maten enni nachünah ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 11:31-32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Thurai lang kloah mih chupiia rah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Enni nakowpowngah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren kowi dow maiawngün rirow hai ana pek maten enni nachünah kaneu kown takla. Maiawngün dow enni sing uowi mowr kaneuma enni nachünah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Nami prenchak maru-uüa dow aiuk aiukma mih hungh kowi ün, asowmchow mih hungh kowi ün hai aram chakma mih singh klim towng kowi ün cham chupiia amatni kowh thuraiuüa reng chekhai. Now nami pren enni kowpowng mih khin khe dow naiawngün amatni thuraiuüa kowh chupiia rah maten enni napiakta pe kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Amatni kowh <char style="w">phuchuara</char> ün enni napiakta pe kown. Amatni chupiiaah mih hua ün enni nadita pe nak kown, now amatni phuchuaah mih Asera limpu ün paw enni natikta pe kown. Now amatni kowh akeng mih rup maten paw enni napiakta pe kown. Naiawng hai amatni kowh thuraiuüa ming dow naiawngün arah hownia enni namata pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi amatni chupiiaah iawng CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni natawi chupiia kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Tawkchedow aia kowi nachupiiala kownkow aia lang kloah kown mih arah kowi aia kowi enni nakowchup kown takla. Nami arah dow enni kowh krungchak maten kowi aia pe enni mih arah maten hownia aia nalang kloah parah kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Nami arah kowi dow tikah mih uanap, akeng mih tawncher uanap, hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanap, amülüngma mih uanap, takhamta khowk mih rakowi kowh <char style="w">uanap</char> hai enni sak nau hown kowh uanap enni nakowpawla kown. Nami klen kowi chia, rua hai ruapur kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah maten paw enni nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Naiawngün dow Thurai prasira hownia kowh enni kaah mih luprak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün luprak dow aia lang kloah mih arah kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni hai enni kowh chauüa hailawm enni nachaah kown, now enni napiaw kown.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8-10" />“Thaulangma enni nauowila kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren kowi kawmat paw enni ting dowi tak chekhai. Nakowi enni kowting khe dow enni riaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa hown tasen mih hownia CHAKRAMANG nape tanai enni bowt kown, now nakowi dow athaulangma enni nauowi bowt kown. Nakhowk khe dow kowmatia sak nau hown kawmat kowh a-i chupiiaah iawng CHAKRAMANG kowi enni nachupiiaah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 12:8-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />“Nakhowk khe dow aia kowi nachupiiala kown mih arah kowi ang kowh ana pek iawng uanh maten enni nauang pawla kown. Nakowi dow tikah mih uanap, akeng mih tawncher uanap, hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanap, amülüngma mih uanap hai takhamta khowk mih rakowi kowh uanap enni nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Nami arah kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni, enni kowh chauüa, enni kowh narma narlauüa hai Leviuüa hown enni napiaw kown. Enni kowh kua hai marow kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Leviuüa kowh dow krawng bawn hai dawngthawnguan uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />“Tawkche tikah mih uanap dow enni nau rah kowi enni naia chang kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Tikah mih uanap dow enni krungchak kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih arah hownia kowh aia lang kloah mih arah kowi chowtaih enni nachangah kown. Nakowi dow ang ana pek maten iawng enni nachang kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Nachenganchepaw Thurai prasi hownia kowh prung mih tawncher maten dow lowra kua hai marow kowi enni naia ngen kown, now nau iawng enni naia chaah kown. Naiawngün chaknga dow cha ngahiu nga hai cha naki nga khe kowh iawng sürlawkma mih hai sürlawk dowi mih maru maten naia cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Tawkche avi tarapdow enni naia cha kown nadowi. Avi dow tui iawng krawng kowi enni nakhükta kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Nami klen kowi enni kowh luprak sar, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau hamüt bak kowi pabak chi, chia, ruapur, rua kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah, enni takhamta mih uanap, enni sak nau hown kowh uanap hai amülüngma mih uanap dow kua hai marow kowi enni naia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Naiawngün uanap dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih arah kowi aia pur kowi enni nachaah kown takla. Naiawngün enni kawmah mih luprak hownia kowh uanap dow enni, enni kowh chauüa, enni kowh narma narlauüa hai Leviuüa hown enni nachaah kown, now enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni napiaw kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Enni pren kowi enni uowi mowr dow Leviuüa kowi enni nakhetla reng kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20-21" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow aia takhamta mih iawng naphia enni pren sünghi kown. Nami khin khe dow aia kowi nachupiiala kown mih arah enni hown alakma chepaw naia kown. Naiawng rakowi enni prüa chaknga towng dow nami arah kowi enni kownowng kowi dowi chepaw naia kown. Naiawng alakma kowi enni uowi miuüa dow ang kowh ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih chia, ruapur hai rua mih enni kowh kua hai marow kowi enni naia ngen kown, now enni sak nau iawng enni naia cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Naiawngün chaknga dow cha naki nga hai cha ngahiu nga khe kowh iawng asürlawkma mih hai sürlawk dowi mih maru-uüa naia cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Nachenganchepaw kaneu büa diah! Vi dow enni nacha kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow vi dow sing müa chekhai; chaknga dow avi hailawm enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Vi dow enni nacha kown nadowi; nami dow tui iawng krawng kowi enni nakhükta kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Enni hai enni kowh chauüa nakala iungra kownkow vi mih enni nacha kown nadowi. Enni cha vi dowi mih dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi iung iawng enni chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />“CHAKRAMANG lang khowmah mih arah kowi dow enni kowh chimsaima mih uanap hai takhamta mih rakowi kowh uanap mih enni nakowpawla kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Enni kowh tikah mih uanap kowi kowh tawncher nga hai avi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh phuchuara kowi enni natikta bowk kown takla. Now taking tasangra uanap kowi kowh tawncher vi dow phuchuara kowi enni nakhükta kown takla. Nachenganchepaw anga dow enni naia cha kown taih. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Enni hai enni kowh chauüa nakala iungra kownkow maiawngün ang pe enni mih ana pek maten dow kaneuma enni nachünah kown. Ang kowh ana pek enni chün mih dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi iung iawng enni chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi dow enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih nahing mata kown. Now nami pren dow enni powngah hanow nakowi enni nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi mata mih kung kowi dow amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng enni natawi uowila dowi kownkow kaneuma uowiah büa diah. Amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng enni che tawi uowi khai hanow leng kowi tasowk khe kowh iawng enni naown kown. Now tawng iawng chow amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi naiawngün chenchapuüa chupiia mih lawnguan paw enni nakrawi lünta kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi amatni chupiiaah iawng CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi mapaw enni natawi chupiia kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün maru-uüa dow chupiia amatni kowh thuraiuüa mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG suiah mih iawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang büah reng chekhai. Amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi khowm padow maih kowi nawmah hanow amatni kowh thuraiuüa vüi kowi phuchuala büah khai.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Ang pe enni mih ana pek maten dow kaneuma enni nachünah kown; nami ana kowi dow tawngpaw enni nachütla kown nadowi, now tawngpaw enni nabatla kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s">Arup kowi nachupiia dowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1-2" />“Enni pungmadawng kowi <char style="w">risi</char> hai nowng phuang mang mih maru uowi chepaw naia kown. Amatni dow awdara lup hai awdara uowima mih amatra lawnguanün uang tek enni chepaw naia kown. Now naiawngün dow aia tekah iawng uang phaw khai chepaw naia kown. Now aia dow katpaw enni tukah dowi mih thuraiuüa lawnguan kowi, ‘Chu, akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi a-i cham chupiia lah,’ padow natek enni chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="DEU 13:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />Naiawng che tek enni khai hanow nami maru kowh laiklow dow hangkow sünta büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni kowh sak maiow hown enni sakrauah chünchü mih natukla kownkow aia chaing enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow iawng enni namang kown, now aia kowi enni naring nakawah kown. Aia kowh ana pek enni nachün kown, now aia tek iawng enni nachang kown. Aia kowh lup enni nachang kown, now aia kowi akhawtma enni naowmah kown. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Risi lah, nowng phuang mang mih maru lah, naiawng mih maru kowi dow enni nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami maru dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang lawtla enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi nakingküaah kownkow chawktowk mih chekhai. Nami maru dow CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih ana pek iawng enni nachowm nauowi dowi kownkow sangkrang mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni namata kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6-7" />“Enni kowh tainau lah, enni kowh chauüa lah, enni sakrauah mih masi lah, enni kowh auiua sinma mih lah kukpa nape enni prengia chepaw naia kown. Aia dow, ‘Chu, akeng thuraiuüa kowi achi cham chupiia lah,’ padow natek enni chepaw naia kown. Naiawngün dow enni hai enni pipu-uüa tukah dowi mih akeng thuraiuüa chekhai; naiawngün dow enni riaret kowi kowh maru-uüa hai alakma kowi kowh maru-uüa chupiiaah mih thuraiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 13:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />Akeng thuraiuüa lawnguan kowi che naiawng uang tek enni khai hanow nami maru kowh laiklow dow enni nauta pe kown nadowi, now enni nasünta pe kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow enni nasanaah kown nadowi, enni nalawtah kown nadowi, now lawng paw enni nalawngah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Aia kowi dow enni nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Aia kowi nakowngta kown mih lup dow en narik uown kown. Nami kung kowi dow bowkbowk maru nauang tawi tabawng kown. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Aia kowi dow kowng pat huaklu hown enni nakuakah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang lawtla enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai hownia akeng prakowi cham pawla enni kown mih aia dow nau khai. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Nahanow enni Israeluüa bowkbowk dow nami satang ta hanow nakram kown. Now enni pungmadawng kowi dow naiawng mih angak miapaw nachang iawk kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12-13" />“Enni nauowiah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih marow kowi kowh maru-uüa lawnguan kowi maiawng enni nata chepaw naia kown: Nami marow kowi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia anowm nadowi mih maru-uüa uowi chekhai. Amatni dow nami marowchakuüa kowi Thurai hownia akeng prakowi cham pawla reng chekhai. Amatni dow, ‘Chu, akeng thuraiuüa kowi a-i cham chupiia lah,’ padow maru-uüa kowi tek pe büah reng khai. Naiawngün dow katpaw enni tukah dowi mih thuraiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 13:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Naiawng che enni ta khai hanow nami lawnguan kowi enni nakrawi paw pe satang kaneu kown takla. Enni nakrawi chetah kown, now enni nakrawi lüntaah kaneu kown takla. Naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup che enni pungmadawng kowi phaw nowm khai hanow <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />nami marowchakuüa maten kowi dow enni nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Now amatni kowh tawncher hawmh kowi paw saidawng hown enni nasaita pe bowk kown takla. Nami marow dow asaima enni napiakta kown. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Nami marow kowi kowh enni kaah mih uanh maten dow nami marow dawnglang kowi enni nakowpawla kown. Nahanow naiawngün uanh hailawm marow dow asaima natowkta kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi kowh maih kowi tikah mih uanap iawng chekhai. Nami maih kamah mih marow dow chowngchowng saksakma apiaknama pacham uowi reng lah; nami dow naplan thawpah iawk kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Nami marow kowi kowh uanh maten dow enni matia vüi mapaw enni natowah kown nadowi. Nahanow enni luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow narim kown, enni kowh pipu-uüa tut-e aia khamta khowk iawng dow aia nasaksing sana enni kown, now nape prung enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow enni nachün kown takla. Aia kowh ana pek hai ari aiang dow ani mih ang pe enni khowk. Naiawngün dow enni nachünah ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Nauowila uiting uangtak dowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Enni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh chauüa chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kowng miuüa vüi enni <char style="w">uowila uiting uangtak</char> khe kowmatia buk kowi enni natata tangen kown nadowi, now kau kowi kowh sam paw enni nakhai kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi chimsaima mih chenchap chekhai. Aia dow aiamat kowh asung uowima mih dawngthawnguan nachowngla kownkow lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten pungmadawng hownia lang klo enni mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sürlawk dowi mih hai sürlawkma mih asadua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Suiiai kaniaima mih chap dow enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4-5" />Enni naiung cha kown mih dow chia, ruapur, rua, ngaia hai kaurawng ruapur, ngahiu hai naki chap maten chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 14:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Asadua maten kowi tai penchow mih hai akeh talak mih chap maten dow enni naiung cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Tawkchedow tai penchow chepaw akeh talak dowi mih asadua chap dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Ut, ngaiung kaw hai ngaiung rik dow tai penchow chepaw akeh talak dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün dow enni vüi asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Pak kowh dow akeh talak chowdiah. Tawkchedow tai penchow dowi rakowi nami paw enni vüi asür alawkma chekhai. Naiawngün nga dow enni nacha kown nadowi, now auak paw enni nakak kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Tui kowi kowh dam chap maten kowi angap uowi mih hai alip uowi mih chowtaih enni naiung cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Tawkchedow angap hai alip pre chap trui uowi dowi mih chap maten dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow enni vüi asür alawkma naown kown.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Uakling uaber chap kowi kowh chimsaima mih maten dow enni naiung cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12-18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12-18" />Tawkchedow murangma, mukaichow, kürngang, uakuh, bungku, tingtut, langta, uaak, uasur, uatawr, tuipai, kurak, uateu, bawngthapmow, laiiowu, taklalama, uachowlaingak, kirchow hai mailap ün dow asür alawkma chekhai. Naiawngün nga dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 14:12-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />“Plawng hawmh iawng iow mih chap maten dow enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow enni vüi asür alawkma naown kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nachenganchepaw alap uowi mih chimsaima mih chap maten dow enni naiung cha kown taih.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Iawngpa kowng mih asadua dow enni nacha kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi kowh lang kraah mih chenchap chekhai. Nami kowng mih uak dow enni kowh marow kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa kowi pe chepaw enni naia peah kown, now sum chepaw enni naia sum pe kown. Amatni dow naiawngün naia cha kown taih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Rua chah nga dow a-u iawn tui hown enni naengah kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanh pek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Ning towng üa hai laih hownia kowh enni kaah mih luprak dow hamüt bak kowi pabak mih enni nalang kraah ngengche kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Enni kowh luprak, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau kowi kowh hamüt bak kowi pabak mih, now chia, ruapur hai rua kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah dow aia kowi nachupiiala kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih arah kowi enni nakowpawla kown. Now naiawngün dow nami arah kowi enni nachaah kown. Nami hownia dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi atungma enni naringkawah reng kown pami enni naka tuak kown.<verse eid="DEU 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />“Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih arah dow enni hownia alakma chepaw naia kown. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG prasira hownia kowh enni kaah mih luprak hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak mih nami rah kowi enni kowia pawla dowi tham. Naiawng chekhai hanow <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />naiawngün uanh dow enni nasumah hanow tangka dow nami arah kowi enni nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Nami tangka hown dow enni nau mih — chia, ruapur, rua, grep tui, arak hai akeng mih chakkham — enni naran kown. Now enni hai enni kowh kimchakuüa hown dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni nacha nakham kown, now enni napiaw kown. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Nami khin khe dow enni marow kowi kowh uowi mih Leviuüa kowi enni nahawla kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow krawng bawn hai dawngthawnguan tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />“Sum ning chur towng dow nami ning kowi kowh luprak hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak mih marow kowi enni nauang pawla kown, now anungra kowi enni nakrümah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Naiawngün chakkham dow Leviuüa, prenlang maru-uüa, mamaimowuüa hai saratchowuüa vüi chekhai. (Leviuüa dow krawng bawn hai dawngthawnguan tawi ka powng dowi chekhai). Amatni dow anungra kowi nauangah hanow amatni nau mih napawla kown. Naiawng che enni chang khai hanow enni kowh lup srui kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Tanai ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Ranit ning chur towng dow enni cham nau kaah kown mih lowi enni nalawtta ngengche kown. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Nami lowi dow mami rirow iawng enni nalawtah kown: Enni Israeluüa kowi kowh enni peah mih lowi dow enni nalawtta pe ngengche kown. Amatni kowi dow enni nalü pe lowi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nalawt lowi kown mih khin dow CHAKRAMANG phuangta khowk chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Akeng chenchapuüa hownia dow enni kowh lowi enni naia lü kown taih. Nachenganchepaw enni Israeluüa kowh lowi dow enni nalawtta pe kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4-5" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow hai ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek maten che enni chün khai hanow enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw nangarai kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren kowi ahuma aia nape enni prasi kown. <verse eid="DEU 15:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laikham iawng aia dow nape enni prasi kown. Nahanow enni dow chenchap ahuma kowi naia pe lowi kown. Tawkche enni dow mia iawng mih tut-e paw lowi pawk natakla kown nadowi. Enni dow chenchap ahuma kowi naia kruitown kown. Nachenganchepaw enni kowi dow amiapaw nakruitown enni kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Tawkche CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren kowi enni uowi mih khin khe enni pungmadawng kowi che ngaraima mih uowi khai hanow amatni kowi dow enni namüta hüah kown nadowi. Amatni kowi dow enni nakhowngah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Amatni kowi dow kawklawma hai enni napeah kown; amatni lakke mih srui enni nape khawiah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Kaneu büa diah. ‘Lowi lawt ning dow uang towm khai bowt. Ang cham pe lowi e ang ka plan dowk tham,’ pami angakma mih saktuak enni sak kowi hangkow towah büa diah. Amatni kowi dow khowngah dowi kowi hangkow müta hüah diah. Enni che khowngah dowi hanow ngarai miuüa dow nakingküala enni kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e naawr kar kown chekhai. Now nami ngak rakowi enni naka <char style="w">aprek</char> kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Amatni kowi dow saktuak iungma hai kawklawma hown enni napeah kown takla. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni changah mih lup maten kowi nape enni prasi kown. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Enni pren kowi ngarai miuüa nauowi ngengche kown. Naiawng rakowi enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ngarai miuüa hai enni pren kowi kowh ngarai miuüa kowi kawklawma hai nakhowngah kown mih ana ani ang pe enni khowk.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Narma narlauüa kowi nalawtah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Hebrai chenchap maru-uüa che kachakuüa chepaw, masiuüa chepaw enni tut-e tawi chang nar kownkow uang tasum khai hanow taruk ning mowr nami nar mih enni nimkrüa kowi nachang lup kown. Nachenganchepaw ranit ning mih ning khe dow enni nalawtta kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Aia kowi enni lawtah mih khin khe dow akhawma enni nalawtah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Aia kowi dow enni kowh tawncher tawn hownia rua hai ruapur ün, luprak hai grep tui ün enni nakrawi peah kown. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni prasi iawng enni kowh nar kowi paw enni napeah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Aigupta pren kowi enni paw uowila nar akat chekhai, now nami hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow uang klanla enni khai pami sak kowi towah büa diah. Naiawng rakowi mami ana ani ang pe enni khowk.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Nachenganchepaw nami nar che enni hai enni kowh kimchakuüa kowi sakraula khai, now enni kowi towla now powt kown nau dowi pami achima aia tek khai hanow <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />enni kowh kimplawt mawm kowi nami nar kowi nanüa pe param hanow chukchem hown enni narui pe kown. Nami hownia now aia dow achowngma enni kowh nar nachowng kown towbowt. Enni kowh narmauüa kowi paw naiawng enni nachang pe kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />“Enni tawnah mih narma narlauüa kowi enni lawtta mih khin khe hangkow sak nga büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami taruk ning aia tawi chang enni lup mih dow enni nga sukkri pre ia mih hown tale chekhai. Amatni kowi che enni lawtah khai hanow enni changah mih lup maten kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Enni kowh tawncher pungmadawng kowi chia chepaw, ruapur chepaw, rua chepaw rik pen mih ala chah maten dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi enni nalang kraah kown. Rik pen mih chiala chah kowi dow enni nape changah lup kown nadowi. Now rik pen mih ruala chah hai ruapurla chah kowi paw enni nakep pe pawi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Naiawngün tawncher dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih arah kowi ning towng enni nakowpawla kown. Nakowi dow enni kowh kimchakuüa hailawm CHAKRAMANG pur kowi enni nachaah kown. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Nachenganchepaw tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala chah che khawk baima, mik duma hai buk kowi ün ma uowi khai hanow nami aser auowk uowi mih tawncher dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni naphuchuaah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Nami tawncher dow enni uowi rah kowi enni nachaah kown. Nami chaknga dow cha ngaia nga hai cha naki nga khe kowh iawng asürlawkma mih hai sürlawk dowi miuüa naia cha kown. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Nachenganchepaw avi dow enni nacha kown nadowi; nami dow tui iawng krawng kowi enni nakhükta kown.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Takat Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Abib la kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi Takat Pawi enni nasun kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla enni mih dow Abib la kowi kowh uar-e khe chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Aia kowi maru kawmuüa nachupiiala kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih aiamat uowi rah nakloah parah kown. Nami arah kowi dow enni kowh tawncher hawmh hownia chia chepaw, rua chepaw, ruapur chepaw enni nauang pawla kown. Nami tawncher dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nachangla Takat Pawi kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Naiawng enni phuchuala CHAKRAMANG mih tawncher nga dow the pe <char style="w">tuah</char> dowi mih kawm hown enni nachaah kown. Aigupta pren hownia sakkrowng sakkrangma enni lawt kown chowbowt khe kowh enni chala kawm iawng nami the pe tuah dowi mih kawm dow ranit ni mowr enni nacha kown. Nami kawm dow ngare kham kawm pahai enni natuakah kown. Nami kawm enni nacha kown mih dow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt khe kowh lawnguan chowngchowng saksakma enni natukla reng kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Nami ranit ni lak kowi dow enni pren kowi mia kim kowi paw the pe tuah mih tawng chap paw naia uowi kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi pawi uown ni sat kup khe kowh enni changla <char style="w">phuchua</char> mih tawncher nga paw auai rau mowr enni naia towah kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih marow pungmadawng hownia lowra mih marow kowi Takat Pawi kowi kowh tawncher dow enni naia phuchua kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />Takat Pawi vüi kowi kowh tawncher hown kowh phuchua dow aia kowi maru kawmuüa nachupiiala kownkow CHAKRAMANG aiamat lang kloah mih arah kowi chowtaih enni nachang kown. Ning towng nami pawi dow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt mih ni kowi sat kup khe enni nasunah kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Takat Pawi kowi kowh changla phuchua mih chaknga dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kloah mih arah kowi enni naengah hanow nachaah kown. Now auai rau dow enni matia tangbung kowi enni naia powt kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Taruk ni mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown. Now ranit ni mih ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi takua kri enni nasunah kown; nami ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni naia chang kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bowthowk Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Ning towng enni uown kua luprak mih ni hownia ranit sapta mowr enni naklowkah kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi natüngla ringkawra kownkow Bowthowk Pawi enni nasun kown. Nami pawi kowi dow nami ning kowi kowh Thurai prasira hown enni kaah mih luprak hownia enni ia mowr chi enni nauang pawla uanap kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Nami pawi khe dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi nachupiiala kownkow aiamat kloah mih aia uowi rah kowi enni napiaw kown. Nakowi dow enni bowkbowk enni matia hai enni kowh chauüa, enni kowh naruüa, enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Leviuüa, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa, siring saratchowuüa, mamaimowuüa CHAKRAMANG pur kowi napiaw kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Aigupta pren kowi enni paw uowila nar akat mih tuakah now mami rirow maten dow enni nachünah kaneu kown.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Enni ki ngenta luprak hai ki küata grep bowk kung kowi dow ranit ni mowr enni nachang <char style="w">Te Pawi</char> kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Nami pawi kowi dow enni bowkbowk enni matia hai enni kowh chauüa, enni kowh narma narlauüa, enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Leviuüa, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa, siring saratchowuüa, mamaimowuüa CHAKRAMANG pur kowi napiaw kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Enni kowh luprak maten luk kowi hai enni changah mih lup maten kowi CHAKRAMANG dow pe enni prasi khai. Naiawng aia pe enni prasi mih dow enni kowh awmrawmra pacham taküm lah pakowh chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih arah kowi aiamat vüi ranit ni mowr nami pawi dow enni nasun kown.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kloah mih aiamat uowi rah kowi dow paning kowi sum kat chi enni nachang pawi kown. Nami pawi dow Takat Pawi, Bowthowk Pawi hai Te Pawi chekhai. Naiawngün pawi chang mih khin khe dow enni kachakuüa maten mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowkowi kown takla. Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi rut khawma miapaw naia kowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Nami pawi khe dow nami ning kowi kowh Thurai prasi hown enni kaah mih luprak hownia enni ia mowr chi enni nauang ap kown.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tara chet miuüa hai kruitown miuüa kowh lup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih marow maten kowi dow chowlowkkow krungchakuüa vüi tara chet miuüa hai kruitown miuüa enni natowah kown. Nami enni towah mih maru-uüa dow maru kawmuüa kowi tara nowm nachet pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Tara nowm nadowi mih enni nachet kown nadowi, now mia pra paw enni naia tangi kown nadowi. <char style="w">Bümsua</char> paw enni naia paw kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow paw bümsua mih maru dow chanlaima chepaw mik duma iawng chekhai, now achi anawmma chepaw angakma mih maru iawng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Naiawng rakowi anowmma enni nauowi kown takla. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren dow enni naia powng kown, now nakowi dow chowngdawng sakklangma enni naia uowi kown.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG suiah mih chap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21-22" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi enni nathawp pe phuchuara kown mih re-e Asera limpu hai akeng thuraiuüa vüi changla phuchua mih hua enni naia chowk kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow naiawngün kowi sui chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 16:21-22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Chia chepaw, rua chepaw, ruapur chepaw aser auowk uowi mih tawncher dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi enni naap kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aser auowk uowi mih dow CHAKRAMANG suiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih marow kowi dow enni pungmadawng hownia kachakuüa lah, masiuüa lah CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e suiiai kaniaima mih lup changta khai chepaw naia kown. Naiawng chang mih dow enni hown kowh Thurai towah mih sangbowk laitawm chün dowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />Nami maru dow akeng thuraiuüa kowh lup cham tawi chang chepaw naia kown; aia dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi, sat kowi, lama kowi hai krek kowi ün cham tawi chupiia chepaw naia kown. Naiawng hai ang pe enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek dow nami maru chün dowi chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Naiawng mih satang che enni ta khai hanow nami lawnguan kowi enni nakrawi paw pe satang kaneu kown takla. Naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup che enni pungmadawng kowi phaw khai nowm hanow <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />kachakuüa chepaw, masiuüa chepaw naiawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang mih maru kowi dow enni naripah ngengche kown. Aia kowi dow marow tapplawt re-e nacham pawla hanow kowng pat huaklu hown enni nakuakah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Naiawng chang mih maru luk kowi thuak saksi mih che uowi pre sum ia hanow nami maru kowi dow enni naia kowngta kown. Tawkchedow thuak saksi mih che lowk iachow taih hanow naiawng chang mih maru kowi enni naia kowngta kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Aia kowi nakowngta kownkow thuak saksi miuüa huaklu hown narik kuakah kown. Nami kung kowi dow bowkbowk maru natawi kuakah kown. Naiawng hai enni pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni namata kown.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akratma mih tara chet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Enni kowh tara chetra kowi dow enni tut-e tara chet akratma mih uowi chepaw naia kown. Nami dow kowmatia sak nau hown kowh saita mih hai bawpta mih chünchü, now rut tawi khawk tawi kowh saita mih hai bawpta mih chünchü tukah dowi chepaw naia kown. Nami klen kowi dawngthawnguan rakowi takhowk taran kowh tara chet akratma chepaw naia kown. Naiawng mih che uowi khai hanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih arah kowi enni nakowkowi kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Now nami khin khe kowh tara chet miia hai Levi chenchap uamowuüa tut-e enni nakowkowi kown. Amatni kowi dow enni nakowlawp pe kaneu kown. Now tawng chow chang takla mih amatni natek enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />CHAKRAMANG lang kloah mih arah kowi kowh amatni tek enni mih iawng dow enni nachang kown. Amatni tekah mih rowprowp dow enni nachang ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Ari aiang lawnguan kowi kowh amatni tüngsang enni mih hai tara chet lawnguan kowi amatni tek enni mih iawng enni nachang kown. Amatni tek iawng rowprowp enni nachang kown; mapaw enni naia klowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Bawri rakowi nami tara chet miia hai CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lup chang mih uamowuüa kowh laiklow chün kown nau dowi mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Naiawng hai enni Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni namata kown. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Nahanow maru maten dow naiawng mih ripra lawnguan nata hanow nakram kown. Now amatni dow naiawng mih bawrira nauam chang kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang kowh chowm krang uowi krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren dow enni nakowpowng kown, now nakowi dow enni nakowuowi kown. Nakhowk khe enni natek kown mih, ‘A-i luk kowi nachang alow kownkow a-i riaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa iawng a-i paw tow mang lowk ia diah sik,’ napa kown. <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Nami khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kloah mih kowi chowtaih enni naia pe chowmah mang kown. Nami dow enni Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia naown kown takla. Akeng chenchap hownia kowh maru kowi dow enni naia towah mang kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Nami mang dow aia vüi ahuma naia kram kawrnga kown nadowi. Now Aigupta pren kowi nakowran kawrnga kownkow aia dow Israeluüa kowi naia chinah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tek enni mih, ‘Aigupta pren kowi katpaw hangkow plan kowi büah tham bowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Nami mang dow akawmma naia paw masi kown nadowi. Naiawng che paw khai hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi aia chupiia mih hownia akeng prakowi amasiuüa mih nacham pawla kown chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia dow aia vüi arawn amatma naia kram kuh hai tai kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />“Aia uown chowm mang khe aia dow Levi chenchap uamowuüa pur kowi nami <char style="w">charam tua</char> kowi kowh arui uowi mih ari aiang maten charam tua kowi naplan ruila kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Nami charam tua dow aia tut-e aia natowah reng kown. Now aia sing uowi mowr naphatah reng kown takla. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi ringkaw krang aia natuk kown, ari aiang hai rirow laiklow maten aia nachün kown, <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />ari aiang hownia ditchow paw aia nasüt kown nadowi bowt, now akeng mih Israeluüa lak-e aia lang iuk pami saktuak nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Nahanow aia hai aia krungchakuüa dow ning kawmma Israeluüa luk kowi naia chowm mang kown.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh vüi bak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Levi krungchakuüa dow uamowuüa hailawm akeng mih Israeluüa iawng natawi ka dawngthawnguan bak kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG vüi maih kowi kowh tikah kown mih chakkham uanap maru uang pawla mih hai CHAKRAMANG kowi kowh maru uang ap-ah mih chap chowtaih amatni nacha kown. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Amatni dow amatni kowh tainau Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi tawng iawng mih krawng bawn paw natawi ka kown nadowi. CHAKRAMANG khamta khowk iawng CHAKRAMANG chowtaih amatni kowh dawngthawnguan naown kown.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Chia, rua hai ruapur hown enni chang phuchua mih khin khe apang nga, awmthur nga hai amuma ün dow uamowuüa kowi enni napeah kown. Naiawngün dow uamowuüa kowh vüi bak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Enni rik kuaah mih luprak, grep tui sar hai kanrawn sau, now rua hai ruapur hownia kowh rik kepah mih pawi uamowuüa kowi enni napeah kown. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni Israel krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia Levi krungchakuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih chekhai. Amatni kowi dow atungma CHAKRAMANG kowi naia chupiia kownkow aia lang kloah mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Israel pren kowi Leviuüa nau khai mih dow aia uowi rah hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiiala kownkow CHAKRAMANG lang kloah mih arah kowi naia powt kown. <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />Nakowi dow hawt iawng uowi mih akeng mih Leviuüa iawng aia paw CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai lup natawi ia chang kown. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Now kimchak hownia uang krawi sa pe uanh chepaw nakowi kowh maru uang changla phuchua mih hai uang ap-ah mih chakkham srui dow aia paw arisang natawi ka kown.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chimsaima nauowi kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape powng enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi khe nakowi kowh chenchapuüa chang iawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup dow enni natawi tasang kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10-11" />Nami pren kowi dow enni pungmadawng hownia kowmatia chah kowi maih kowi nawmah now enni natawi changla phuchua kown nadowi. Now hawra mük mih, mantan chang mih, plang kuak mih, maiaklese tüng mih, püi howng mih, süngnam hai lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih, now kowng mih maru-uüa kowh lümla hown taklawp taiua mih maru dow naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 18:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Naiawng chang mih maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e suiiai kaniaima chekhai. Enni nakowuowiah kown mih prenchakuüa maten kowi enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai naprütta kown mih dow naiawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang büah rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Enni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi achinawmma nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow mantan chang miuüa hai hawra sarauüa kowh laiklow chün reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw enni kowi dow naiawng mih lup CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe chang enni dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa hownia risi awr phaw lowk ia kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni vüi ang iawng mih risi nathawp enni lowk ia kown. Nami risi laiklow iawng enni nauowi kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami risi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e kowh enni lüah mih chekhai. Sinai hungh re-e enni bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG pur kowi takua talawm mih ni khe enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai laiklow ta kown anging nau dowi bowt, now mami hungh kowi kowh akraingma mih maih paw khi kown anging nau dowi bowt; khi now anging nakowng kown chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />“Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Kowbüah tek mih lainowmma iung. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Amatni Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia amatni vüi en iawng mih risi ang nathawp pe lowk ia kown. Nami risi nawr hown ang kowh laiklow dow ang natekah kown. Nami risi dow ang pe tekah iawng amatni kowi natek pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Nami risi tekah mih ang kowh laiklow nau sünta dowi mih maru-uüa kowi dow ang matia ngengche naripah kown. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Nachenganchepaw ang peah ana dowi matchang ang ming hown krawi tek lai mih risi kowi dow enni nakowngta kown, now akeng thuraiuüa ming hown krawi tek lai mih risiuüa kowi paw enni nakowngta kown takla,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nachenganchepaw naiawng risiuüa uang krawi tek lai mih khin khe, ‘CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh laiklow ching bow tawng iawng chow anging natukah kown?’ padow enni naka tuak chepaw naia. <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Nakhowk khe maiawng enni natukah kown: CHAKRAMANG ming hown che risi uang krawi tek lai khai, now nami risi tekah iawng uang tachi dowi hanow nami dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh uang chinah mih nadowi pami tukah büa diah. Nami dow aia saktuak hown kowh uang krawi tekah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow enni nakramah kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Tatung tanimra marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi kowh chenchapuüa kowi dow enni pur hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih namata kown. Now amatni kowh marow hai kim kowi dow enni nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2-3" />Nami khin khe dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren enni nachangah sum bak kown. Naiawngün arah towng dow enni nakhowm nabowk pe tatung tanimra marow lowk chi kown. Now nami marow prakowi mangla mih tiama enni nachang pe kown, nahanow saita maru mih dow aiachow hown naiawngün marow kowi naia powt kown.<verse eid="DEU 19:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />“Mami dow cham saita maru khe kowh rirow chekhai. Kowngta kown mih tuak uowi dowi kowi cham saita maru khai hanow nami maru dow tatung tanimra marow kowi naia powt kown. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Laiuan kowi, maru pre ia dow cham taiua tu singh kownkow kaurawng kowi cham kowi khai. Now tu singh mih khin khe lowk mih maru kowh marek dow taplet kowh alowk mih maru kowi kowkak khai. Now nami maru dow kowng khai. Naiawng phaw khai hanow marek taplet mih maru dow aia hown atawnchow mih tatung tanimra marow kowi naia powt kown. Nahanow aia dow naia plai kown. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nachenganchepaw tatung tanimra marow che nami maru hownia alakma chekhai hanow nakowi aia kowtowm dowi rawn napaw lu klai kown mih maru dow naka khümta chepaw naia. Now lu klai pawk mih maru kunmarau lai rakowi aia kowi dow nakowngta chepaw naia; tawkchedow kowngla pat mih ripra dow nami maru kak tataing dowi chowdiah. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Naiawng rakowi enni vüi nalang khowmta bowkta tatung tanimra marow sum buk kown mih ana ang pe enni khai.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8-9" />“Ani mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi nasakrauah kown mih hai aia laiklow iawng nauowi kown mih ana ang pe enni khowk. Nami ana pek che enni chün khai hanow enni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh khamta mih iawng CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih naphia enni pren sünghi kown. Nami khin khe dow enni vüi enni nalang khowmta bowkta tatung tanimra marow sum buk iawk kown. <verse eid="DEU 19:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren kowi angak uowi dowi mih maru-uüa nakowng kown nadowi bowt, now naiawngün kowng mih rakowi enni naka aprek kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Nachenganchepaw kowmatia kimping namkhet kowi naukhi-ah dowi rakowi saiah kownkow hawt pawm hüah mih maru uowi chepaw naia kown, now aia kowi bawpah kowh kowngta khai chepaw naia kown. Nakhowk khe abawp miia mih naiawngün tatung tanimra marow kowi kowpowt khai hanow <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />nami tatung tanimra marow hownia sai maru mih kowi dow nauang pawla kownkow aia uowiah mih marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa nakowchin maru kown. Now nami maru kowi nakowngta kownkow lu klai pawk mih maru rut kowi amatni naapta kown. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Aia kowi dow mapaw enni nasanaah kown nadowi. Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia achinawmma mih maru kowi sai miia kowi dow enni nakowngta ngengche kown takla. Nahanow enni naiung kown.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Süng rihi nasütsowi dowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Enni napowngah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni pren kown chowbowt. Nami pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni kowh pipu-uüa naretla enni süng kown. Enni kowh pipu-uüa kowng kung kowi paw enni kowh süng rihi dow mapaw enni naia sütsowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saksi thuak lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Lowra mih maru kowi nachetah kownkow tara chetra kowi uang pawla mih khin khe saksi thuak mih lowk iachow taih hanow tawng iawng mih maru kowi paw enni naia tang pe aprek kown nadowi; saksi thuak mih pre sum ia khü chiang enni naia tang pe aprek kown.<verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />“Maru lowk ia kowi piakah kown nau kowh thuak dai lai saksi mih uowi khai hanow <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />dai lai saksi thuak mih hai bekah angak mih maru hailawm amatchi pre ia trui kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowpawla kown takla. Now nami khin khe kowh uamow hai tara chet miuüa dow nachet pe tara kown. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Nami lawnguan kowi tara chet miuüa dow nakrawi paw pe satang kaneu kown. Now nami maru dow thuak dai lai saksi mih chowtaih pahai tukta khai hanow <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />aia thuak pe dai lai saksi mih maru kowi nau peah kown mih ripra dow nami maru kowi napeah ngengche kown. Naiawng hai enni pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni namata kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Nahanow enni Israeluüa bowkbowk dow nami lawnguan ta hanow nakram kown. Now enni pungmadawng kowi dow naiawng mih angak miapaw nachang kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Thuak dai lai saksi mih maru kowi dow mapaw enni nasanaah kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow sak kowh sak klai, mik kowh mik klai, iüng kowh iüng klai, rut kowh rut klai, khawk kowh khawk klai enni napaw pe kown.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Tasen khe kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Cham dowk tasen khe enni kowh lak-e ransu-uüa kowh kawrnga, <char style="w">kawrnga kari</char> hai siphaiuüa lang hu khai chepaw hangkow kram büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow natawi uowila enni kown taih. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2-3" />Enni dowk tasen kown chowbowt khe uamow nauangah hanow siphaiuüa kowi natek pe kown mih, ‘Israel siphaiuüa low, sünta büah. Ani mih ransu-uüa hown enni nadowk tasen kown chowbowt. Sakkraingma uowi büa diah; tawngpaw hangkow kram büah. Ransu-uüa kowi khita now hang chür büah. <verse eid="DEU 20:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi natawi sen enni kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih enni hown natawi kown. Aia dow nape awng enni kown taih,’ napape kown.<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Nami kung kowi dow siphai aluchowuüa natek pe siphai hawmh kown mih, ‘Enni pungmadawng kowi changta kim sar hüah kowh Thurai tut-e apla dowi tak mih uowi ne bow? Uowi khai hanow nami maru dow aia kim kowi pacham plan lah. Tawi tarü tasen kowh tasen rah kowi cham kowng khai hanow aia kowh kim chang ia dow akeng mih maru nata apta pe ün tarawng. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Changla grep krum hüah kowh ka chala auih dowi tak mih maru uowi ne bow? Uowi khai hanow nami maru paw kim kowi pacham plan lah. Tawi tarü tasen kowh tasen rah kowi cham kowng khai hanow aia kowh grep krum chang ia dow akeng mih maru nata powngta pe ün tarawng. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Cham khamla masi hüah mih maru uowi ne bow? Uowi khai hanow nami maru paw aia kim kowi pacham plan lah. Tawi tarü tasen kowh tasen rah kowi cham kowng khai hanow aia kowh masi kham dow akeng mih maru nata chawngta pe ün tarawng. <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Nami klen kowi enni pungmadawng hownia sakkraing dowi, krampuma mih maru uowi ne bow? Uowi khai hanow nami maru paw kim kowi pacham plan lah. Naiawng nadowi hanow enni rakowi akeng miuüa paw natawi sak nen ün tarawng,’ napape kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Naiawngün laiklow ki tek pe kung kowi dow siphai aluchowuüa mih siphaiuüa thum towng krawi tow pe aluchow lowk ia chi kown.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Enni krawi sen marow dowi rawn khe nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi enni narik phowng pe satang kown. Dowkah tasen dowi kowi nakowi kowh maru-uüa mih enni krüa kowi nauowi kown mih nauta chünchü mih enni nakowrik tek pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Naiawng enni tek pe mih che nauta kowh amatni kowh tapplawt uow enni khai hanow nakowi kowh maru maten kowi dow enni nachangla nar kown, now amatni dow khawlawt dowi kowi nachang enni lup kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng enni tek pe kowh nauta dowi kowi hawt dowk enni tasen khai hanow amatni kowi dow enni nasenah kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Nami marow mih CHAKRAMANG pe powngta enni kung kowi ta sing uowi mih kachakuüa maten kowi enni nasaita kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Tawkchedow masiuüa, ngeu-uüa, tawncher hawmh hai nakowi kowh uowi mih chap srui dow enni matia vüi enni naia towah kown. Enni kowh ransu-uüa pren hownia CHAKRAMANG pe powng enni mih uanh maten dow enni naia tawngah kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Naiawng enni nachang kown mih dow enni hown alakma mih marow kowi chowtaih; enni hown atawnchow mih chenchapuüa kowh marow kowi nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Tawkchedow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG nape powng enni kown mih marow kowi kowh maru maten kowi dow enni nasaita bowk kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ana pek iawng Hituüa, Amawruüa, Kananuüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa kowi dow asaima enni nachumta kown. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Naiawng che asaima enni chumta dowi hanow chup arup büah khe kowh suiiai kaniaima amatni changah mih lup dow enni natawi tasang kown chekhai. Now naiawng chang mih hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni kingküa kown chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Enni napowngah kown mih marow kowi maru naia kup naia lawtla dowi kownkow marow mih akrama enni rumta hüa mih khin paw nauowi kown. Naiawng enni rumta hüa khe nakowi kowh singh uih dow enni naia cha kown. Tawkche naiawngün singh dow hangkow kripla büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün singh dow enni kowh ransu nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Nachenganchepaw chaah uih mih singh nadowi pami enni tukah mih dow enni naia krip kown taih. Naiawngün singh dow tasen müa enni naia tawngah kown.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Sai maru miia kowi tukah dowi khe kowh tara chet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Enni napowngah kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren kowi kowh dowm kowi dow maru saita mih uak enni cham khi chepaw naia. Nachenganchepaw sai sak miia kowi dow enni tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />Naiawng che enni cham khi khai hanow enni kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hai tara chet miuüa dow nami uak uowi rah re-e nakowkowi kown. Nami hownia tawng mih marow chow lang tatawn mih amatni nakhaiah kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Now nami uak uowi rah hownia kowh lang tatawn nowm nowm mih marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa dow nauang pawla chia iia apum kown takla. Nami chia iia dow katpaw changla lup dowi tak mih hai katpaw tang pe laithawn tim dowi tak mih naown kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Now nami chia iia kowi dow katpaw lupah dowi mih lawngrawi kowi nacham pawla kown. Nami lawngrawi kowi dow tui hawr reng mih aw nauowi kown takla. Now nakowi mih nami chia iia kowi naklowkta pe angawng büah kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Nakowi dow uamowuüa paw nakowtawi kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uamowuüa kowi dow aia pur kowi nachang lup kownkow hai aia ming hown maru kawmuüa kowi nape prasi kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lang kloah mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi maru takhowk taran khe hai tabawp tatep mih khin khe nachet pe tara kown mih paw amatni chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Now uak uowi rah hownia kowh lang tatawn nowm nowm mih marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa dow klowkta pe angawng mih chia iia luk kowi nasau rut kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni natek kown mih, ‘Mami maru kowi dow anging saiah mih nadowi, now asai miia kowi paw anging khi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en uang klanla mih Israeluüa kowi lawtta diah. Mami angak uowi dowi mih maru kowng mih aprek dow en kowh maru-uüa luk kowi hangkow tang pe diah,’ napa kown. Nahanow nami maru kowng mih aprek dow CHAKRAMANG nalawtta enni kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG mik kowi iung iawng enni nachang kown. Nahanow angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi saita mih aprek hownia enni naka lawtra kown towbowt.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uang khümla mih masiuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Enni kowh ransu-uüa hown enni cham dowk tasen mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow ransu-uüa kowi enni tut-e nape sumah kown. Now amatni kowi dow enni nauang khümla kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />Naiawngün enni uang khümla mih pungmadawng kowi enni naukhi-ah mih klangiungma mih masiuüa uowi ne hanow amatni kowi dow enni naia chawng kown taih. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Aia kowi dow enni kim kowi enni napawla kown. Now aia kowi dow enni nape khaiah sam kown, now rutmi khawkmi paw enni nape kretah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />Now aia kowi uang khümla khe kowh aia üla mih tawnguat ün dow naklüpta hanow aia nakhup tawnguat sar kown. Now nami masiuüa dow a-u a-pa vüi kowi ala mowr nauowi uiting uangtak kown. Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa kowi enni naia chawngah kown towbowt. Now nami masiuüa kowi chawngah mih kachakuüa dow nami masiuüa kowh hua nachowng kown towbowt. Nahanow nami masiuüa paw nami kachakuüa kowh masi nachowng kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Akung kowi nami masiuüa luk kowi che enni sak-ih dowi hanow enni naia khuata kown. Aia kowi dow aia nau mih re-e enni nape powtah kown takla. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow enni naia sumah kown nadowi, now nachangla nar kownkow enni naia towah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow masi iawng hai aia kowi dow enni phua iuaah khowk chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapa ta kowh vüi bak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Laiuan kowi, maru lowk ia kowh dow masi uowi pre ma. Now lowk mih kowi dow lainowmma aia sakrauah khai. Nachenganchepaw alowk mih kowi dow aia sakrauah marai dowi chekhai. Amasi pre ma trui dow pen chapa khai. Tawkchedow aia sakrauah marai dowi mih masi kowh chapa dow uang rik dia khai. <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />Now achapa pre ia kowi aia bak pe dawngthawnguan mih khin khe dow aia sakrauah marai dowi mih masi kowh chapa kowi aia napeah chapa ta kakbak kown takla. Nami chapa takcha kowi aia lang sakrauah mih masi kowh chapa kowi aia naia peah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh chapa ta ching dow aia sakrauah marai dowi mih masi kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Aia kowh chapa ta kowi dow aia kowh akeng mih chapauüa kowi lak-e pre phow aia nalang chüt peah dawngthawnguan kown takla. Chapa ta kowi dow aia sakrauah dowi mih masi hown kowh chepaw aia nalang chüt peah dawngthawnguan kown takla. Chapa ta dow kala chah kown mih kür mat müa chekhai. Chapa ta rah dow nami chapa kowh vüi bak chowtaih.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laiüama mih chapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Laiuan kowi, maru lowk ia kowh dow laiüama mih hai kingküa dawma mih chapa uowi lowk ia. Nami chapa dow mapaw sünta u-pa laiklow dowi, now u-pa kowh pringhawi laiklow paw chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />Naiawng chekhai hanow nami chapa kowi dow marow tapplawt re-e lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e a-u a-pa nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Amatchi dow naiawngün lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi natek pe kown mih, ‘Angching kowh chapa lainowmma lai üa, now kingküa dawma chekhai; aia dow angching kowh laiklow mapaw chün dowi chekhai. Aia dow kham iu kham rak ün, now iawm pawisa tangka plawtlawt chekhai,’ napa kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Now nami marow kowi kowh kachakuüa maten dow huaklu hown kowng pat aia kowi nakuakah kown takla. Naiawng hai enni pungmadawng hownia dow naiawng mih angak enni namata kown takla. Now Israeluüa bowkbowk dow nami lawnguan ta hanow nakram kown.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka ripra miuüa kowh uak tarta hüah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Changta angak kowh kowngla pat mih ripra kak taing mih maru paw nauowi kown. Naiawng mih maru kowi dow kowngta hanow auak mih singh kowi natarta hüah kown. <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />Tawkchedow nami uak mih uar prowt singh kowi enni naia tarta hüah kown nadowi. Nami uak dow enni tarah mih ni khe enni nadupta kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng singh kowi enni tarta hüah hanow Thurai kowh piatira enni pren kowi nauang kla kown chekhai. Enni dupta hanow enni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren dow natasürlawk kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="s">Akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi mia iawng mih kowh chünchü chia chepaw, ruapur chepaw cham takuowng kowh akeng prakowi cham mang mih enni khi hanow enni namüta hüah kown nadowi. Nami tawncher kowi dow aiah tut-e enni nakowpawla ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nami tawncher iah che enni re-e kowh maru nadowi, now aiah kowi tuk paw enni tuk dowi hanow nami tawncher dow enni tut-e enni napawla kown. Aiah uang krawi cham dowi mowr nami tawncher dow enni matia tut-e enni natowla kown. Tawncher iah uang krawi chet mih khin khe nami tawncher dow aiah kowi enni nahawt peah kown. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Enni tainau-uüa kowh tama mih kawrngaramchük chepaw, dawnguan chepaw, akeng mih uanh chepaw enni khi hanow nakhe paw enni namüta hüah kown nadowi. Naiawngün uanh dow ka aiah dowi mowr enni tut-e enni natowla kown, now uanh iah uang krawi chet mih khin khe naiawngün uanh dow enni nahawt peah kown.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Enni tainau-uüa kowh kawrngaramchük chepaw, chia chepaw tiama kowi tim mih che enni khi hanow enni namüta hüah kown nadowi. Nami tawncher dow naia rüla kownkow enni natawi khowngah ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Mia iawng mih masiuüa paw kachakuüa tawnguat naia tawng kown nadowi, now kachakuüa paw masiuüa tawnguat naia tawng kown nadowi. Naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai sui chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Enni cham mang cham kat khe tia keng kowi kowh singh kowi lah, krawng kowi lah enni cham khi uakling bai chepaw naia kown. Nami uakling bai kowi dow adui luk kowi lah, achah luk kowi lah a-u awp phülü chepaw naia kown. Naiawng che enni khi khai hanow nami uakling dow tawm u tawm chah enni naia pawla kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Achah dow enni naia paw kown taih. Tawkche a-u kowi dow enni nalawtta kown takla. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni naiung kown, now chowngdawng sakklangma enni nasing kown.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Enni chang chawkku kim mih khin khe kimluk kowi tavir lut akro sangrumchow enni napingah kown. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni kowh kimluk hownia maru uang dowh kowh kowng khai chepaw nami aprek dow enni nakur kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Grep krum kowi dow akeng mih chap enni naia sawtla kown nadowi; enni che sawtla khai hanow nami uih hai grep uih paw enni naiung cha kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Chiala hai kawrngaramchük hown patim sang changah now enni nathawn laih kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Tawncher pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih tawnguat dow enni nakhup kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Enni kowh uanchow kowi anui towng enni nachawp pe amawm lowk chi kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tachawng talang rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13-14" />“Paw masi kowh taphua taiuala kung kowi amasi kowi nauah dowi bowt mih maru uowi chepaw naia. Aia dow amasi kowi napeah ming ngak kownkow maiawng natek kown, ‘Mami masiuüa kowi ang chawng nowm chowdiah. Tawkchedow aia mih kachakuüa hown taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa pami amatra ang khi pe dowi,’ napa kown. <verse eid="DEU 22:13-14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15-16" />Nami kachakuüa che naiawng chang khai hanow masiuüa u-pa mih achama cham taphua taiua dowi tak pami amatra napawah kown. Now nami dow marow tapplawt kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e masiuüa u-pa nakowpawla kown. Now masiuüa pa natek pe kown mih, ‘Mami kachakuüa hown ang chama kowi ang pe tachawngah chowdiah. Tawkchedow mami kachakuüa mih ang chama kowi nauah dowi bowt. <verse eid="DEU 22:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Kawmat dow ang chama kowi peah ming ngak kown nau kowh mawkchow tek mih, “Ang masi cham taphua taiua dowi tak pami amatra ang khi dowi,” pakhai. Tawkchedow mow, mü büah madiah; ang chama cham taphua taiua dowi tak pami amatra,’ panow masiuüa u-pa mih amawkchow hai achama iüah tapaw mih iak khe kowh mawkla mih uan naawr phat pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Nakhowk khe che naiawng ia tüng pe amatra khai hanow nami masiuüa hua kowi kowkhümah now lawngtang aluchowuüa mih lengker hown nabawpah kown. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Now nami maru kowi dow lawngtang aluchowuüa mih tai 100 iun napaw pe iawk hanow masiuüa pa kowi napeah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Israel chenchap taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa kowi piak pe ming mih chekhai. Now nami masiuüa dow aia masi nachowng iawk kown. Nami masiuüa kowi dow chownglawng kowi sing uowi mowr mih katpaw aia naia khua kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20-21" />“Tawkchedow nami kachakuüa tekah iawng amasi che cham taphua taiua khai bowt nowm hanow nami masiuüa kowi a-pa kimplawt re-e nakowpawla kown takla. Nami masiuüa kowi dow a-pa kimplawt re-e kowng pat huaklu hown nakowi kowh kachakuüa hawmh nakuakah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow u-pa kim kowi uowi khe chang iang khai. U-pa kim kowi chang iang mih dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup chekhai. Naiawng hai enni pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni nachurta kown.<verse eid="DEU 22:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chang iang mih kowi naripah kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Lowra mih kachakuüa kowi maru masi hown taphua taiua mih che ka khüm khai hanow nakowngta kown takla; naiawng chang mih kachakuüa hailawm masiuüa kowi paw nakowngta kown takla. Naiawng hai Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni nachurta kown.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23-24" />“Hua kham uowi khowk mih malauüa kowi marow kowi kür hown maru phua iuaah khai hanow nami kachakuüa hailawm nami malauüa kowi dow nakowngta kown takla. Amatchi pre ia trui kowi nakowi kowh tapplawt re-e kowng pat hua hown maru nakuakah kown. Nami malauüa kowi kowngla kown takla mih auan dow maru phua iuaah mih khin khe maru nauang khowngah kownkow hek dowi pla dowi rakowi chekhai. Now kachakuüa kowi kowngta kown mih auan dow maru masi kham kowi krawi piak rakowi chekhai. Naiawng hai enni pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni nachurta kown.<verse eid="DEU 22:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Tawkche hua kham uowi khowk mih malauüa kowi kaurawng kowi aia malowkchow khe che kür hown maru phua iuaah khai hanow naiawng krawi chang mih kachakuüa kowi chowtaih enni nakowngta kown. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Tawkche masiuüa kowi dow tawngpaw enni nachangah kown nadowi; masiuüa kowh dow nakowngla pat mih aprek uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng mih lup dow lowkkowlowk kowi tasai mih iawng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami malauüa kowi dow kaurawng kowi uowi khe kowh townah mih chekhai. Nami khin khe nauang khowngah kown mih maru uowi dowi smü dow nami malauüa mih hek khowk chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28-29" />“Now hua kham uowi dowi tak mih taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa kowi kür hown krawi taphua taiua mih kachakuüa paw nauowi kown. Naiawng krawi chang mih kachakuüa kowi dow ka khüm hanow napaw pe aiawk kown. Nami kachakuüa mih masiuüa pa kowi napeah tai 50 iun kown. Now nami malauüa kowi paw aia piakta pe siri khai bowt rakowi aia nachawngah kown takla. Nami malauüa kowi dow aia sing uowi mowr naia khua kown nadowk.<verse eid="DEU 22:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“U-uai hown miapaw naia tachawng kown nadowi; tachawng mih maru dow piak pe apa kowh siri mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Tawi ia takua talawm dowi miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Hangdui teuma miuüa hai khampha uanh hiama miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi natawi ia kowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Iang chah dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi natawi ia kowi kown nadowi. Aia kowh krungchakuüa khowm padow hamüt chowng mowr chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi natawi ia kowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Amawnuüa hai Moabuüa dow mia iawng mih paw CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi natawi ia kowi kown nadowi. Amatni kowh krungchakuüa khowm padow hamüt chowng mowr chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi mapaw natawi ia kowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt mih khin khe amatni dow chakkham hai tui ün hawt pe enni dowi chekhai. Naiawngün hawt pe enni lak dow nape enni piati kownkow Beur kowh chapa Balam kowi tangka hown uang ngala büah khai. Balam dow Aram-Naharaim pren kowi kowh Pethawr marowchak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow Balam kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi. Aia dow sakrau enni khai rakowi Balam kowh piati mih enni vüi prasira pe chowngah khai. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Amawnuüa hai Moabuüa kowi dow enni sing uowi mowr mapaw enni nakhowngah kown nadowi, now napeah iungra kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Nachenganchepaw Edawmuüa kowi dow enni nasuiah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow enni kowh tasin taken miuüa chekhai. Now Aiguptauüa kowi paw enni nasuiah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni pren kowi dow prenlang maru iawng hai enni uowila akat chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Edawmuüa hai Aiguptauüa dow amatni kowh krungchakuüa sum chowng hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi natawi ia kowi kown taih.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siphai hawmh kowh tangbung khup rah chimsaima natowah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Ransu-uüa hown nadowk tasen kownkow enni cham khup tangbung mih khin khe asürlawkma mih sia hownia enni nalang tahen kown.<verse eid="DEU 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />“Iak-e müi khe enni kowh che khampha uanh tui chawn khai hanow enni dow natasürlawk kown. Naiawng asürlawkma mih maru dow nami ni ni chut tangbung khup rah uat kowi nacham lang uowi kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Now nami ni sat kowi khe dow aia nalu tui kown takla. Now sat kup khe dow tangbung khup rah kowi aia uang ia kup kown towbowt.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Enni kowh uatra dow tangbung khup rah uat kowi enni nakhowm bowkah parah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Now enni kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng pungmadawng kowi dow enni natowla parpa lowk kown takla. Enni uat rau khowk hanow nami arah kowi enni nathai kuam kown, now ki uat khe dow enni naplan thiala iawk kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Enni kowh tangbung khup rah dow chimsaima enni natowah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow nalawng enni kownkow hai enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi enni rut kowi nape sumah kownkow enni kowh tangbung khup rah kowi tawi uowila enni reng chekhai. Enni pungmadawng kowi che suiiai kaniaima mih sia aia khi khai hanow aia dow napowtta enni kown.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Lowra nar che aia kim iah hownia powt kowh enni tut-e uang tatung tanim khai hanow nami nar kowi dow kim iah tut-e enni nakowplan saah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Aia kowi dow enni pungmadawng kowi aia nau mih marow kowi enni nape uowiah kown. Aia kowi dow enni nachangah naklak kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi dow kachakuüa chepaw, masiuüa chepaw CHAKRAMANG kim kowi naia chang <char style="w">chawkkrawma</char> lup kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw takhamta mih rakowi uang pawla uanap mih khin khe chawkkrawma lup changra hownia kowh kaah mih tangka dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chup kim kowi nauang ia pawla kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng chang chawkkrawma lup mih kachakuüa hai masiuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG suiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Tangka chepaw, chakkham chepaw, akeng mih chap chepaw enni Israeluüa kowi enni pe khawiah khai hanow amatni kowi dow enni napaw pe achüt kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Akeng chenchapuüa hownia dow enni naia paw pe achüt kown taih. Nachenganchepaw enni Israeluüa hownia dow enni naia paw achüt kown nadowi. Nahanow enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni changah mih lup maten kowi nape enni prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi pe kown mih enni takhamta khai hanow kra dowi kowi lüa peta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni takhamah mih uanh nakük enni kown. Enni takhamah mih che enni pe dowi hanow enni vüi angak nachowng kown. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Nachenganchepaw enni takham dowi hanow enni tut-e angak nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi enni takhamta khai hanow enni nape ngengche kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi enni takham mih dow enni matia sak nau hown kowh chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Enni kowh kimping namkhetuüa kowh grep krum kowi enni cham kowi mih khin khe enni nau mowr enni naia cha grep uih kown. Nachenganchepaw apawk müa dow lowkchow khowm padow em kowi enni naia phangla kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Enni kowh kimping namkhetuüa kowh üa hai laih kowi enni cham kowi mih khin khe rut hown klowkah hanow enni nau mowr enni naia cha luprak kown taih. Nachenganchepaw tangchen hown dow mapaw enni nangen luprak kown nadowi, now kim kowi enni naia pawla kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Takhua talan khe kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Tachawng kung kowi amasi luk kowi sak-ihah dowi mih lup ahua khi pe chepaw naia kown. Naiawng sak-ihah dowi mih chap che uowi khai hanow amasi vüi takhua talan cha ahua naia rui kown, now nami cha mih amasi kowi ahua naap pe hanow naia khuata kown. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2-3" />Now nami masiuüa mih ahua kim hownia lan hanow akeng mih kachakuüa tut-e cham plan mang chepaw naia. Tawkchedow aia cham rik mang rah kowi kowh hua iawng nami kachakuüa paw sak-ihah dowi kowh khuata chepaw naia kown, nadowi now ahua kowng khai chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="DEU 24:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />Naiawng mih masiuüa kowi dow ahua chük naplan ia chawngah iawk kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng mih masiuüa dow asür alawkma khowk chekhai. Naiawng mih tachawng talang dow CHAKRAMANG sui chekhai. Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe naiawng mih lup ngak dow enni naia chang kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paw masi thowi khe kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Paw masi thowi mih maru kowi dow tasenra kowi lah, pren lup chang rah kowi lah enni nacham ia chinah kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow paning mowr amasi hown kim kowi apiawma enni nape uowiah tak kown takla.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lowi pek mih maru kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Enni peah lowi mih maru kowi dow apawng iawng hai mi küa müa lah, mi küa müa luk kowi kowh hua lah enni naia pawta pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow nami hown kowh sing mih chekhai. Nami uanh pawta pe mih dow aia kowi rupta pe chakkham mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku maru mih kowi naripah kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Enni Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia krawi ku maru kowh cham changla nar mih paw nauowi kown, now cham sumah mih paw nauowi kown. Naiawng krawi kuh maru mih kowi dow enni nakowngta kown takla. Naiawng hai enni pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih angak dow enni namata kown.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Par rawka phaw khe kowh nachünah kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Par rawka phaw mih che enni khi hanow uamowuüa nape enni kown mih ana klangiungma enni nachün kown takla. Uamowuüa kowi kowh ang peah mih ana iawng kaneuma enni nachün kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt kung kowi tiama rawng kowi Miriam par phaw khe kowh CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih hangkow tamata büa diah.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakra kowi kowh uanh pawk rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Lowra maru kowi enni cham pe lowi chepaw naia kown. Tawkchedow nami lowi rakowi apawng iawng hai napaw pe uanh kownkow enni peah lowi mih maru kim kowi dow enni naia kup kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Nakhowk khe prang kowi enni nauowi kown, now aia dow nami uanh mih prang kowi nauang pawla enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Now aia ngarai lai kowh tawngpaw pe kown uowi dowi rakowi aia kowh müi müa uan apawng iawng hai uang pe enni chepaw naia kown. Naiawng mih uanh pawng dow uar-e hangkow towla büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Nami uan dow aia müi müa chekhai rakowi aia nanowng müila kownkow ni towng iak pra khe kutplan sa pe büa diah. Naiawng che enni chang hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e aia mih nalü enni iungra kown. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih enni luk kowi nasak-ih kown towbowt.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sukkri kha lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Enni Israel chenchap kowi lah, enni pren kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa kowi lah — ngarai miuüa hai akhawr a-awng hown uowi miuüa kowi dow enni ngaah hanow hangkow kuanah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Amatni kowh sukkri kha dow sat kup dowi rawn enni napeta kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ngaraima chekhai; amatni dow nami sukkri kha luk kowi kowh neplawng nesak mih chekhai. Ni towng sat kup dowi rawn enni che peah sukkri kha dowi hanow amatni dow enni vüi nachet tara kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e nanguk nakar chepaw naia kown, now nami angak prek dow enni nakur kown chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kowmatia angak rakowi kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Chauüa changta angak rakowi u-pa kowi naia kowngta kown nadowi, now u-pa changta angak rakowi chauüa kowi paw naia kowngta kown nadowi. Kowmatia angak rakowi chowtaih nakowng ngengche kown.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tara nowm chet lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Prenlang maru-uüa kowi lah, siring saratchowuüa kowi lah anowm nadowi mih tara enni nachet pe kown nadowi. Now lowra mih mamaimowuüa kowi apawng iawng hai aia kowh mamaimow tawnguat mih enni naia pawta pe kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Aigupta pren kowi enni paw uowila nar akat chekhai, now nami pren hownia dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai uang lawt enni khai pami sak kowi towah büa reng diah. Nami sak kowi enni natowah kown mih dow anowm nadowi mih tara enni hang pacham chet lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luprak kua lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Üa kowi lah, laih kowi lah enni ki kua luprak mih khin khe enni ta lawtta mih luprak dow hangkow krawi plan paw büah tham bowt. Enni tama pawla khowk mih dow prenlang maru-uüa, siring saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa vüi ta towla pe büa diah. Nahanow enni changah mih lup srui kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih nape enni prasi kown towbowt.<verse eid="DEU 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20-21" />“Enni klek kanrawn uih hai grep uih mih khin khe paw pamiachow mih hownia pre kat enni naia klek kown nadowi. Klekta akat kung kowi kowh ta uowi mih dow prenlang maru-uüa, siring saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa vüi tow pe büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 24:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Aigupta pren kowi enni uowila nar akat mih hangkow tamata büa diah. Naiawng enni nachang kown mih ana ang pe enni mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="s">Taran khe kowh rip krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Takhowk taran rakowi tara chet takla khai hanow amatchi pre ia mih tara chet rah kowi nakowkowi kown, now tara chet miuüa nachet pe tara nowm kown. Tara chet rah kowi dow atawi uowi mih maru kowi atawi uowi pahai tara chet miuüa naphuangah kown, now atawi uowi dowi mih maru kowi dow atawi uowi dowi pahai tara chet miuüa naphuangah kown. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Now atawi uowi mih maru kowi natepah kown mih che tara chet miia lawt ana khai hanow nami maru kowi dow krawng kowi nape takhumah kown. Now aia pur kowi dow aia khowm pe bowk pe khowt nami maru kowi lengker hown nabawpah kown. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Tawkchedow likawm müa klen kowi enni naia tepah kown nadowi. Likawm müa klen kowi che enni tepah khai hanow enni matia tainau kowi enni ringkawah dowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Chiala hown enni thua cha mih khin khe nawrbawng kruk müa hown enni nakruk pe nawrbawng kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hua kowng mih masiuüa vüi rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Taichow nauchow pakimsang taiua uowi reng tak khe ataimow paw masi kowh kala chah dowi kowi kowng khai mih paw naia uowi kown. Nahanow nami kowng mih kowh masi mih akeng kimchak kachakuüa hown nacham ia tachawng kown nadowi. Nami masiuüa mih ahua kowh naumow hown nata tachawng kown, now aia luk kowi achang takla iawng ahua kowh naumow nachang pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Now amatchi rik kaah mih kachakuüa chah dow ataimow kowng khowk mih kowh chah iawng hai nadowkah kown. Nahanow ataimow kowh ming mih Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia natama kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Nachenganchepaw anaumow che ataimow masi kowi ta chawng kown nau dowi hanow nami masiuüa mih marow tapplawt re-e lawngtang aluchowuüa tut-e nakowkowi kown. Now aia natek pe kown mih, ‘Ang hua kowh naumow mih ataimow kowh ming Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi nata town pe kown mih nauta dowi. Ang luk kowi kowh aia nachang kown mih alow uowi iawng chang kown nau dowi,’ napape kown. <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Nakhowk khe nami maru kowi mih nakowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa nahawah hanow natek pe kaneu kown. Naiawng tek pe kung kowi paw nami maru che ataimow masi kowi nata chawng kown nauta dowi hanow <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />nami masiuüa dow lawngtang aluchowuüa pur kowi nami kachakuüa re-e nakowkowi kown. Now nami masiuüa mih nami kachakuüa khawk kowi kowh phanaikhawk naklüpta pe papra hanow lumowr kowi nathawkah kown. Now natek pe kown mih, ‘Kowmatia taimow kowh krungchak ta town kown nau dowi mih kowi dow maiawng chaw changah reng!’ napape kown. <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi naiawng mih maru kowh krungchakuüa kowi dow ‘Klüpta pe phanaikhawk mih krungchak’ pahai nahawah kown.<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akeng mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Maru pre ia takhüm khe alowk mih kowh masi che ahua kowi tawi khowngah kownkow alowk mih kachakuüa kowh khampha uanh kowi uang dowkta pe chen khai hanow <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />nami masiuüa kowh rut dow enni nadungta pe kown takla. Aia kowi dow mapaw enni nasanaah kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13-14" />“Nakuanla maru kownkow uanh khai müa hua pre buk chi enni naia tawng kown nadowi. Enni ran uanh khe ahuma kala kown mih müa lowk, now enni sum uanh khe a-echow pela kown mih müa lowk enni naia tawng kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 25:13-14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15-16" />Kuan maru mih kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai sui chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi khe athikma hai achima mih akhai müa enni natawng kown takla. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma enni naia uowi kown.<verse eid="DEU 25:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amalekuüa kowi namitta kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt kung kowi tiama rawng kowi tawng iawng chow Amalekuüa chang enni mih hangkow tamata büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Enni bowm hai kawm mih khin khe amatni dow uang dowk enni tasen khai. Now kung pra kowh ta lawt miuüa kowi dow kowngta büah bowk khai. Amatni dow Thurai kowi kram büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Naiawng rakowi enni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren kowi enni kowuowi khe aria aret kowi kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia dow enni rut kowi nape sumah kown. Nami khin khe dow Amalekuüa kowi lusa hownia asaima enni nahing mitta kown. Mami laiklow hangkow tamata büa diah.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Rik kuaah mih luprak naap kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren dow enni nakowpowngah now nakowuowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />Nami khin khe nami pren kowi kowh krawng kowi dow enni nachang üa nachang laih kown. Nami üa hai laih hownia kowh enni rik kaah mih luprak dow kharang kowi enni natowah ne kown. Now aia kowi maru kawmuüa nachupiiala kownkow aia nalang kloah kown mih aia uowi rah kowi naiawngün luprak dow enni nakowpawla kown. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Nakhowk khe nakowi kowh hawt uowi mih uamow kowi enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Mami pren napeah kownkow alai kowh anging pipu-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG khamah khai. Now nami laikham powm iawng ani dow mami pren kowi ang uang uowi khai bowt. CHAKRAMANG vüi mami <char style="w">awmrawm sung</char> ang uang pawla mih nami laikham uang tachih rakowi chekhai,’ napape kown. <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Nakhowk khe enni kowh rut hownia nami kharang dow uamow pawah kown, now CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh phuchuara ria kowi aia natowah kown.<verse eid="DEU 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />“Nami kung kowi dow enni bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi natek kown mih, ‘Ang kowh pu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Jakawb kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</char></note> dow Aramean maru; aia dow cham mang panglang mih maru chekhai. Aia dow maru iun a-echow hown Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi hanow kowuowi khai. Now Aigupta pren kowi uowi mih khin khe aia hownia dow chenchap aiukma hai akürma uang phaw khai; amatni dow maru iun akawmma uang uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Nachenganchepaw Aigupta maru-uüa mih king anging dowi chekhai. Amatni dow towk anging ngare khai; amatni dow tow anging nar hanow lup akratma mih pe chang anging khai. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG anging pipu-uüa kowh Thurai tut-e anging awr kar khai. Now CHAKRAMANG dow anging kowh kar klow ta khai. Aia dow anging ngare mih hai anging lup chang kawm mih khi khai. Nami klen kowi tawng iawng chow Aiguptauüa chang anging nowng mih paw aia dow khi khai. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh rut akürma mih hown kramra uowima mih lup, awdara uowima mih amatra hai awdara lup chang pe hanow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla anging khai. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Aia dow makowi uang pawla anging khai, now iawn tui hai kuai tui atekma mih pren dow pe anging khai. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, en pe anging mih krawng hownia kowh rik kaah mih luprak en tut-e ang uang pawla khai,’ napa kown. Naiawng enni ki tek hanow enni uang pawla mih kharang dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni natowah kown, now tabawkah krawm se aia kowi enni nachupiiaah kown. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Akung kowi enni hai enni kowh kimchakuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih prasira aiungma mih srui hown enni napiaw kown. Now Leviuüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa kowi paw enni hown enni nape piawla kown.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamüt bak kowi pabak naap kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Enni kowh luprak hownia ning towng hamüt bak kowi pabak chi CHAKRAMANG kowi enni peah khai. Nachenganchepaw sum ning kowi pakat chi hamüt bak kowi pabak dow Leviuüa, prenlang maru-uüa, <char style="w">saratchow</char> chah hai mamaimowuüa kowi enni napeah kown. Naiawng che enni chang hanow naiawngün maru-uüa paw enni pren kowi chakkham aduma natawi ka kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni natek pe kown mih, ‘En kowh ana pek iawng ang kaah mih luprak hownia en vüi kowi kowh ang lang towah mih srui dow ang uang pawla bowk khowk. Naiawngün luprak dow Leviuüa, prenlang maru-uüa, saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa kowi ang peta khowk. En kowh ana pek ang üa dowi, now tama paw ang tamata dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Kowng miuüa vüi uowila uiting uangtak khe paw en vüi kowi kowh lang towta mih dow tawng chap paw ang cha dowi chekhai, now ang cham tasür talawk khe paw naiawngün dow kim hownia ang cham lawtla dowi. Nami klen kowi naiawngün dow kowng miuüa vüi kowi kowh pawi kowi paw ang cham pe dowi chekhai. Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow en kowh laiklow iawng ang chang reng chekhai. En kowh ana pek maten iawng ang chün reng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh uowi rah chimsaima mih mukuang pren hownia uang iu mü diah, now en kowh maru Israeluüa kowi uang iu peah prasi diah. Anging kowh pipu-uüa tut-e en takhamta iawng iawn tui hai kuai tui atekma mih pren dow en pe anging khai; nami pren kowi paw uang iu peah prasi diah,’ napa kown.<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG aiamat kowh maru Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Ani mih maiawngün ari arow hai ari aiang nachün kownkow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni ana khai. Maiawngün dow enni kowh saktuak maten hown nachünah kaneu kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh Thurai pami ani mih enni taphuang khai. Now aia tiama kowi namang kown mih enni taphuang khai; aia kowh ari aiang, aia kowh rirow, aia kowh ana pek hai aia laiklow nachün kown mih paw enni taphuang khai. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Now CHAKRAMANG paw aia takhamta iawng enni mih aia maru hai aia matia kowh dawngthawnguan nachowng kown mih ani uang phuang enni khowk. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh ana pek maten enni nachün kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Chenchap maten dow CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih chekhai. Tawkchedow enni kowh rowsira, ming iungra hai kraingra mih akeng chenchapuüa luk kowi natow enni kownkow aia phuangla khai. Nami klen kowi aia laikham powm iawng aiamat vüi kowi kowh aia lang kraah mih chenchap enni nachowng kown mih paw aia phuangla khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ebal hungh kowi nathawp phuchuara kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa hown taiua iowngah hanow maru kawmuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek maten dow enni nachünah kown. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2-4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2-4" />Enni dow napown Jawrdan aw kown chowbowt. Now CHAKRAMANG enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kham enni mih pren kowi enni nakowkup kown chowbowt. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi chekhai. Nakowi enni kowting mih ni khe dow Ebal hungh kowi aiuk aiukma mih hua enni nachowk sangrum kown, now naiawngün hua luk kowi dow enni namia pe thundi kown. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün hua luk kowi maiawngün ari aiang maten mih enni naruiah kown. <verse eid="DEU 27:2-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Now nami hungh kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi hua hown enni nathawp phuchuara lowk kown. Tawkche naiawngün hua dow enni kowh rutchün khawkleng hown enni naia bawpah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi kowi kowh nami phuchuara dow hua hown enni nathawpah kown. Tawkchedow naiawngün hua mih enni nabawpah kown nadowi. Nami phuchuara luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi tikah mih uanap pawi enni nachang pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Now nami re-e dow taking tasangra uanap pawi paw enni nachangla kown. Nami uanap pawi kowi kowh chakkham dow enni nacha nakham hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi enni napiaw kown. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Enni chowkah mih hua luk kowi dow maiawngün ari aiang laiklow maten mih achimma enni naruiah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebal hungh hownia phuang piati lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Nami kung kowi uamowuüa hown taiua iowngah hanow Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Aw Israeluüa, ririmma sünta büa diah. Ani dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai aiamat kowh maru enni chowng khai bowt. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Naiawng rakowi aia tek mih srui enni nachün kown. Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek hai rirow maten dow enni nachünah ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Nami ni khe maru kawmuüa kowi Mosi peah ana mih, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Enni pown Jawrdan aw kung kowi Simiawn krungchakuüa, Levi krungchakuüa, Juda krungchakuüa, Isakar krungchakuüa, Josef krungchakuüa hai Benjamin krungchakuüa dow Gerizim hungh kowi nakowiowng kown. Now naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh prasi lai naphuang pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Now Reuben krungchakuüa, Gad krungchakuüa, Aser krungchakuüa, Zebulun krungchakuüa, Dan krungchakuüa hai Naptali krungchakuüa dow Ebal hungh kowi nakowiowng kown. Now naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh piati lai naphuang pe kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />“Nami khin khe Leviuüa dow hek se mami laiklow mih Israeluüa maten pur kowi natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“Amatni natek kown mih, ‘Thawp arup mih hai kukpa chup rup mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah. Singh hown thawpah mih chepaw, hua hown thawpah mih chepaw, lowra mih uanh hown thawpah mih chepaw naiawngün arup dow uanh thawp sarauüa thawpah mih chowtaih. Naiawngün arup dow CHAKRAMANG suiah mih chekhai,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“‘U-pa kowi ringkaw dowi mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“‘Kowmatia klowkchakuüa kowh rihi matra krawi sütsowi mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“‘Mik duma mih kowi tiama tawima mih prakowi pawla mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“‘Prenlang maru-uüa kowi, saratchow chauüa kowi, mamaimowuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm dowi mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“‘U-uai hown kowh taphua taiua mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng mih maru dow a-pa kowi ringkaw dowi mih chekhai,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“‘Tawncher hown kowh taphua taiua mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“‘Pa-uai hown kowh chama chepaw, u-uai hown kowh chama chepaw kowmatia tuamow hown kowh taphua taiua mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“‘Api hown kowh taphua taiua mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“‘Kukpa sai maru mih dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“‘Angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi saita kownkow paw bümsua mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown.<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“‘Mami ari aiang laiklow chün kown nau dowi mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah,’ napa büah kown. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Amen,’ pahai natek kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Lai chünra hownia prasira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow achima chünah büa diah. Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana maten kaneuma chünah büa diah. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih palusama kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa luk kowi natow enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow che enni chün khai hanow maiawngün prasi enni naka reng kown:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Enni kowh marow kowi kowh lup changra kowi enni naka prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:3">now üa hai laih kowi kowh lup changra kowi paw enni naka prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Enni kowh chauüa nakawmla kownkow enni naka prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:4">üa hai laih kowi luprak naphawla kownkow enni naka prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:4">chia, rua hai ruapur naprungla kownkow enni naka prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Enni kowh chapam hai kawmdi towk rah kawng ün naka prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Ni towng kowh enni changah mih lup maten kowi paw enni naka prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Kingküa enni mih ransu-uüa kowi dow enni tut-e sum pat CHAKRAMANG nachangah kown. Amatni dow patiachow hown nauang sen enni kown. Tawkchedow ranit tia hown amatni napowt kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Enni kowh cha bawk luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh prasira nauowi kown, now enni changah mih lup maten kowi paw aia dow nape enni prasi kown. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih aia pe enni mih pren kowi nape enni prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün hai aia tiama kowi enni namang kown takla. Nahanow aia dow aia takhamta iawng aia lang kraah mih chenchap nachangla enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Nakhowk khe dow palusama kowi kowh chenchapuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowh maru pami natuk enni bowt kown. Nahanow amatni dow nakram enni kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Nape enni kown pahai enni pipu-uüa tut-e CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai khamah mih pren kowi ahuma aia nape enni prasi kown. Aia dow enni kowh kimchakuüa kowi hai enni kowh tawncher kowi ahuma nape kaah chah kown, now enni kowh üa hai laih kowi paw luprak ahuma nape phawah kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />“Enni kowh pren kowi akhin towng nape enni uang hanow enni changah mih lup maten kowi nape enni prasi kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih mukuang kimplawt nauow enni kown. Nahanow chenchap ahuma kowi enni nanowng pe lowi kown. Nachenganchepaw enni dow mia hownia paw lowi pawk natakla kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13-14" />Akeng chenchapuüa maten luk kowi enni nauowi reng kownkow CHAKRAMANG nachang enni kown. Tawkchedow ani kowh ang pe enni mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ana pek prakowi pe ching hai enni nachün kaneu kown takla. Naiawngün ana maten hownia enni nacham ia süt kown nadowi. Akeng thuraiuüa kung enni cham ia krawi kown nadowi, now amatni kowi dow chup paw enni nacham ia chup kown nadowi. Nahanow maru maten luk kowi enni nauowi kown towbowt.<verse eid="DEU 28:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lai üara hownia piatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Nachenganchepaw enni che CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lai chün dowi, now ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana hai ari arow chünah kaneu dowi hanow maiawngün piati maten enni luk kowi nauang kla kown:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Enni kowh marow kowi kowh lup changra kowi enni naka piati kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:16">now üa hai laih kowi kowh lup changra kowi paw enni naka piati kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Enni kowh chapam hai kawmdi towk rah kawng ün naka piati kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Enni kowh chauüa na-ela kownkow enni naka piati kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:18">üa hai laih kowi kowh luprak na-ela kownkow enni naka piati kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:18">chia, rua hai ruapur na-ela kownkow enni naka piati kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Ni towng kowh enni changah mih lup maten dow naka piati kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 28:19">naiawngün dow enni chang chepaw naphaw kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Lup ngak chang hai CHAKRAMANG kowi enni nuata mih rakowi enni changah mih lup maten kowi aia mih nape enni piati kown, now krat pusara hai takrow takraira nauang pawla enni kown. Nahanow alenma enni napiak kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih enni pungmadawng kowi natow enni makowng hawi kown. Enni piak bowk dowi mowr nami makowng hawi dow nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />CHAKRAMANG mih amin uowi mih ma, krau ngak hai ting rawka aia nauang pawla enni kown, now <char style="w">khown</char> hai adenma mih li hown enni kowh luprak napiakta enni kown. Now enni chum bowk dowi mowr aia mih natowk enni ngare kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Enni luk kowi kowh mukuang dow kri iawng, now krawng dow lawngha iawng akhawtma aia nachang enni kown. Aia dow mapaw nape enni uang kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />CHAKRAMANG mih enni pren kowi uang takcha mukuang hownia se hai dinchow nauang pe klaah kown. Naiawngün dow enni chum bowk dowi mowr aia nauang pe klaah kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“CHAKRAMANG mih enni kowh ransu-uüa tut-e enni sum pat nachang enni kown. Patiachow hown enni kowsenah chepaw ransu-uüa pur hownia ranit tia hown enni napowt kown. Nami khin khe dow lusa kowi kowh akeng prenchakuüa maten khi enni hanow natakrowla enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Nami khin khe enni kowh uak dow uakling uaber hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh chakkham nachowng kown. Naiawngün uakling uaber hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi naprüt kown mih miapaw nauang kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh rawka nauang pawla enni kown. Aia dow pawibau, tui sing ma, pik bawr hai prak ün nauang pawla enni kown. Naiawngün rawka dow miapaw nanowng iung enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Aia dow thula mih rawka ün, mikdula mih rawka ün hai sangching takümla dowi mih rawka ün nauang pawla enni kown. Aia dow naiawngün rawka hown nape ngare enni ngamlam kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Mikdu mih iawng enni paw sowp rutrut se ni-e enni namang kown, now tawng lup paw enni naka arak kown nadowi. Atungma maru nachang enni anowng apowng kown, now nauang khün enni uanh kown; nami hownia nalawng enni kownkow miapaw nauang kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Enni kowh masi kham nauowi kown; tawkchedow nami masiuüa kowi maru napiakta pe siri kown. Enni nachang kim kown; tawkchedow nami kim kowi enni naka uowi kown nadowi. Enni nachang grep krum kown; tawkchedow enni naka cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Enni pur kowi enni kowh chia dow maru nangen enni kown; tawkchedow nami chia nga asekchow paw enni natawi ka cha kown nadowi. Enni kowh kawrngaramchük kowi kür hown maru napawla enni kown; tawkchedow nami kawrngaramchük mih nauang plan sa enni kown nadowi bowt. Enni kowh ruapur mih enni kowh ransu-uüa rut kowi nacham ting kown. Naiawngün phih hownia nauang lawng enni kownkow miapaw nauang kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 28:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />“Enni kowh chu-uüa chauüa mih akeng chenchap rut kowi nacham ting kown. Ni towng iak towng naiawngün chauüa nauang mang kown mih kowi enni hawt mü kangowh enni kowh mik nari kown. Tawkchedow <char style="w">nowng changra</char> kür tawngpaw enni kowh nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Enni kowh üa hai laih kowi kowh uih-ak hai enni kowh kawm rak dow enni tukah dowi mih chenchapuüa nachata enni kown. Enni sing uowi mowr dow nowng chang powng changra hai angak kangowh enni nahing khamta hüah kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Naiawngün piakra maten enni khita now enni nathu kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />CHAKRAMANG dow enni kowh kungh kowi hai khawk kowi amin uowi mih bau hown natowk enni ngare kown; nami dow katpaw naiung kown nadowi. Nami bau dow enni kowh lunui hownia khawkpha mowr nakrawi uowi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Enni kowh mang hailawm nakhümla enni hanow akeng chenchapuüa pren kowi CHAKRAMANG natow enni nar kown. Nami chenchap kowi dow enni hai enni pipu-uüa khowm padow tukah dowi chekhai. Nakowi dow singh hai hua hown kowh thawpah mih arup kowi enni nacham chupiia kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />CHAKRAMANG nacham krawi uet enni kown mih rah kowi kowh chenchap maten dow khi enni hanow lainowmma natakrowla enni kown. Amatni dow naprawng naren enni kown, now nachangla enni rensi kau kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />“Aliu dow ahuma enni nasawt kown. Tawkche luprak dow a-echow taih enni naka kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh luprak dow plawng hawmh nachata bowk kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Enni nachang grep krum kown, now khet paw enni naming nakhetah kown. Tawkchedow enni naka cha kown nadowi; atui paw enni naka kham kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow grep uih kowi dow dung nakrawi awt kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Enni kowh pren paprenma kowi kanrawn singh nauowi kown. Tawkchedow kanrawn uih mih naprua bowk kown chekhai rakowi kanrawn sau mih enni naka tawng kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Enni nakaah kown mih chauüa maten enni tut-e naka uowi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün ngeuüa hawmh kowi dow enni kowh ransu-uüa nakhümla now nachangla nar kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Aphawm aphawmma plawng hawmh nauangah hanow enni kowh pren kowi kowh singh kau hai uih-ien pantawn nachata enni bowk kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa dow nauang kureng ngamlam kown, now kür paw nakür ngamlam kown. Nachenganchepaw enni dow nangarai ngamlam kown, now kür paw nakhowk ngamlam kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Amatni dow nape enni lowi kown. Tawkche enni dow amatni kowi nanowng pe lowi kown nadowi. Amatni dow enni luk kowi nauowi kown, now enni dow amatni nimkrüa kowi nauowi kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai rirow hai ana pek enni chün dowi rakowi maiawngün piati maten enni luk kowi nauang kla kown, now enni luk kowi nahing uowi hüah kown. Maiawngün piati hown dow enni nachum kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Maiawngün piati dow awdara uowima mih amatra hai tarip müa amatra iawng enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa tut-e chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47-48" />Aiungma enni uowi mih khin khe awmrawmma hai apiawma hown CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh lup enni chang dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG nauang chin enni kown mih ransu-uüa kowi akhawr a-awng hai tui sakkrai hawm sakkrai hown enni nachang pe lup kown. CHAKRAMANG dow enni tapiak dowi mowr akratma mih nar lup chang hown natowk enni ngare kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:47-48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />“Nakingküala enni kownkow prenchur nammowt hownia CHAKRAMANG nauang pawla enni chenchap lowk kown. Nami chenchap kowh lai dow enni tukta kown nadowi. Nami chenchap dow uamu cham dowk ua khe kowh iawng enni tut-e nauang ting kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Naiawngün chenchap dow apowm mük khowm uowiah pakram mih maru naown kown. Amatni dow lawngtang matanguüa kowi nanü naklowk kown nadowi, now ngeuüa hawmh kowi paw nasaksing sana kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Amatni dow enni kowh tawncher chauüa hai uih-ien pantawn nachata enni bowk kown. Amatni dow enni kowh uih-ien pantawn, grep tui sar, kanrawn sau, chia hai ruapur chah tawngpaw natow enni kown nadowi. Amatni rakowi enni khowm padow achur kowi natapiak bowk kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni kown mih pren kowi kowh marow maten naumta enni lut kown. Now amatni dow enni lang sakowmah mih enni kowh akroma hai akhawtma mih tap ün napiakta enni kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Ransu-uüa umta enni lut khe dow sakkraira hown enni nangare kown. Nami khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pe enni mih enni kowh chauüa nga enni nacha kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Nakhowk khe dow enni pungmadawng kowi kowh maru lang iung hai lang kawklaw mih khowm padow lainowmma kunma ngak hai nasip kown. Aia dow aia kowh tainau chepaw, aia lang sakrauah mih masi chepaw, aia kowh sing uowi reng tak mih chauüa kowi chepaw nasaksing sana kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Aia chaah mih chah nga aia dow mia kowi paw naretla pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ransu-uüa umta enni hüah khe nami chah nga klen kowi dow tawng chakkham paw nauowi kown nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kurengma mih masiuüa katpaw chawp krawng dowi mih paw nauowi kown, now aia dow maru kowi paw lainowmma sakrau chepaw naia kown. Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe dow naiawng mih masiuüa khowm padow aia lang sakrauah mih hua hai chauüa kowi mapaw nasaksing sana kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />Aia penah mih chah hai bai dow kukpa aia nachaah kown; mia kowi paw napela kown nadowi. Naiawng enni nachang kown mih dow ransu-uüa umta enni hüah mih khin khe chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Mami rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih maten enni chünah kaneu kown takla. Now rowsira hai kramra uowima mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ming ringkawma hown enni nakramah kown takla. <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />Naiawng nadowi hanow CHAKRAMANG mih enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa luk kowi akraingma hai awdara uowima mih hawi ün, lainowmma ngarela mih rawka ün nauang pawla enni kown. Naiawngün hawi hai rawka dow enni tut-e akrama nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh enni kramah mih rawka enni luk kowi aia nauang pawla enni kown. Nami rawka dow naplawt enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Nami klen kowi mami rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi dowi mih hawi hai rawka chap maten paw CHAKRAMANG mih nauang pawla enni kown, now achur kowi dow enni napiak bowk kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Pakat khe dow enni kowh maru iun mih mukuang kowi kowh krek nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh lai enni chün dowi hanow pre sum iachow taih enni nata sing kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Pe enni iungra khe hai pe prung enni khe kowh aia awmrawm iawng CHAKRAMANG mih piak enni khe paw naawmrawm kown. Enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren hownia aia dow aprün hailawm nachawita enni hanow nakuakta enni kown.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />“Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih prenchur nammowt mowr chenchap maten tut-e nakrawi uet enni kown. Nakowi dow enni hai enni kowh pipu-uüa tukah dowi mih singh hai hua hown kowh thawpah mih arup kowi enni nacham chupiia kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Naiawngün chenchap tut-e enni uowi mih khin khe enni dow naka thaulangra kown nadowi. Now enni natanaila kown mih arah paw enni naka kown nadowi. Nakowi enni uowi khe CHAKRAMANG dow nape enni tuak kawm tuak kratra kown, owmsakma hown enni hawt müla mih mik paw narita enni kown, now enni kowh sak dow süngürra uowi dowi iawng nachang enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Tawng chow own kown mih hai tawng chow own dowi kown mih tuak kangowh hown enni nauowi kown. Ni chut uar prowt kramring tahowrma hown sing chü, kowng chü pami tuak kangowh hown enni nauowi kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Rau-e khe dow enni natek kown mih, ‘Uar iiu bowt panü,’ napa kown. Now uariiu khe dow enni natek kown mih, ‘Uar thowi bowt panü,’ napa kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow kramra atekma hown nauowi kown, now mik hown paw enni nakhi sowlow kown. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Aigupta pren kowi katpaw enni nakowkowi kown nadowi bowt padow ang tek enni khai. Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih <char style="w">chawnlawng</char> kowi nachua enni hanow Aigupta pren kowi nasa enni kown. Nakowi dow natawi uowi nar kownkow ransu-uüa tut-e enni matia kowi enni natasum kown mih enni nanau kown. Tawkchedow miapaw naran enni kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Moab pren kowi uowi khe kowh Mosi phuangah mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow Sinai hungh kowi Israeluüa vüi Mosi kowi peah sangbowk laitawm akat khowk chekhai. Now mami sangbowk laitawm laiklow dow Moab pren kowi amatni uowi reng tak khe Israeluüa kowi natek pe kownkow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG ta plan bawng pe mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Mosi dow Israeluüa maten kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowh Faraw luk kowi, aia kowh maru iukuüa luk kowi hai aia pren luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG changah mih maten enni khi khowk chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Amatni luk kowi kowh ngare towk rah, amatra hai awdara kraingma CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih dow enni khi bowk khowk. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün enni khi-ah mih hai enni taah mih auan dow kawmat mowr kowi CHAKRAMANG pe tuk enni dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng 40 ning mowr uang pawla enni khai. Nami likawm ning takra kowi enni kowh tawnguat hai phanaikhawk dow piak dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Kawm ün, grep tui hai arak ün tawngpaw enni ka cha ka kham dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw enni lakke mih srui dow CHAKRAMANG pe enni reng chekhai. Naiawng aia chang enni mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh Thurai pami enni natukla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />“Mami arah kowi a-i uang ting mih khin khe Hisbawn marow mang Sihun hai Basan pren mang Awk dow uang dowk a-i tasen khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow a-i nowngta khai. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Now amatni kowh pren dow a-i powngta pe khai. Naiawngün pren dow nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Reuben krungchak maten, Gad krungchak maten, now Manase krungchak dawnglang kowi a-i peah khai. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Naiawng rakowi mami sangbowk laitawm kowi kowh ana pek maten dow kaneuma chünah büa diah. Nahanow enni changah mih lup srui dow naiung kown.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Ani dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi enni bowkbowk mih uang iowng khai. Enni Israeluüa maten dow enni krungchakuüa kowh aluchow, enni kowh maru iukuüa hai enni kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hown uang iowng khai. <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />Now enni kowh chauüa hai enni kowh masi hawmh paw enni hown uang tawi khowk. Nami klen kowi enni kowh singh tuk miuüa hai tui towng miuüa paw tawi uowi khowk; naiawngün maru-uüa dow enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow ani mih enni hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Nami sangbowk laitawm nachünla kownkow mami re-e enni uang iowng mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />Ani kowh mami sangbowk laitawm hownia enni dow aia kowh maru chowng khai bowt, now aia dow enni kowh Thurai na khai bowt. Nami dow enni kowh pipu Abraham, Isak, Jakawb hai enni tut-e kowh aia takhamta mih iawng aia chang mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14-15" />Mami sangbowk laitawm dow ani kowh CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pur kowi kowh uang iowng miuüa vüi krowngchow nadowi. Mami dow kawmat kowh uang dia dowi tak mih a-i kowh chuprek chaprekuüa vüi paw na chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 29:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Aigupta pren kowi tawng iawng chow a-i uowi mih enni tuk khowk chekhai. Now akeng pren iawng cham mangla hanow mami pren kowi tawng iawng chow a-i uang ting mih paw enni tuk chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Naiawngün prenchakuüa pungmadawng kowi dow suiiai kaniaima mih arup ün enni khi khowk chekhai. Naiawngün dow singh hown, hua hown, kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih arup chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Ani kowh mami re-e enni uowi mih pungmadawng kowi kachakuüa chepaw, masiuüa chepaw, lowra mih chenchap chepaw, lowra mih krungchakuüa chepaw CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai hownia miapaw naia powt kown nadowi, now akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi natawi chupiia kown nadowi. Naiawng akeng thuraiuüa kowi tawi chupiia mih maru dow akhakma hai akru uowima mih uih thawp mih singh prün iawng naphaw kown. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Naiawng mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow ta khowk hanow kowmatia kowi maiawng natape sak khawt kown. Aia natuak kown mih, ‘Ang nau iawng ang uowi chepaw aiungma ang nauowi kown taih,’ napa kown. Naiawng mih maru dow enni Israeluüa pachenma luk kowi nauang pawla piakra kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20-21" />Naiawng mih maru kowi dow mapaw CHAKRAMANG nalawtah kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow lainowmma CHAKRAMANG nakunmarauah kown, now aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nalang krata kown. Mami rirow bowih kowi kowh piati laiklow arui uowi mih maten dow aia luk kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang pe klaah kown, now aia kowh ming dow lusa hownia CHAKRAMANG namata kown.<verse eid="DEU 29:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Naiawng hai nami pren kowi dow ngare towk rah maten hai rawka maiow CHAKRAMANG nauang pawla kown. Naiawngün lawnguan kowi enni kowh krungchakuüa hai alakma hownia kowh uang mih prenlang maru-uüa dow maiawng nakhi kown: <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Paprenma kowi kowh krawng bawn dow awisa hai napawksi hown piak bowk khai. Nakowi dow tawng liu paw sawt dowi bowt, ru paw ru dowi bowt, bawrchak paw awm dowi bowt, now pram mung paw uowi dowi bowt. Nami pren dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup mih hown kowh piakta mih iawng chekhai. Nami pren dow CHAKRAMANG piakta mih Sawdawm, Gawmawra, Adma hai Zebawim marow iawng chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Nami khita hanow akeng chenchapuüa nalünta kown mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow mami pren kowi maiawng CHAKRAMANG tuk changah khai? Tawng rakowi chow naiawng khowt pat CHAKRAMANG tuk kunmarau khai?’ napa büah kown.<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />“Nakhowk khe maru natek kown mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla kung kowi CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai dow amatni hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow naiawngün sangbowk laitawm mih nuata büah khai. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Amatni kowi dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG pe chupiiaah dowi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi towta hanow katpaw amatni tukah dowi mih thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia büah khai, now naiawngün thuraiuüa pur kowi cham tabawk büah khai. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup mih dow mami pren luk kowi uang kla mih chekhai. Mami chabowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih piati maten dow mami pren luk kowi uang pe klaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kunmaraura akraingma mih hai kramra uowima mih kunmaraura hown Israeluüa kowi kunmarauah khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi dow amatni pren hownia akeng pren kowi aia prütah khai. Amatni dow kawmat pat paw akeng pren kowi uowi reng tak chekhai,’ napa büah kown.<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Tawngbak mih lawnguan dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai pe tuk a-i dowi. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh rirow dow aia phuang a-i khai. Naiawngün rirow laiklow dow a-i hai a-i kowh chu chauüa mih chowngchowng saksakma nachünah kown takla,” pakhai. Naiawngün laiklow maten dow Mosi tekah mih chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang plan mih sung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek mih, “Prasira hai piati laiklow ang tek enni mih dow enni tut-e nauang towm kown. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai cham uet enni mih chenchap tut-e enni uowi mih khin khe maiawngün laiklow dow enni naka tuak kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Nami khin khe dow enni hai enni kowh chu chauüa mih CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e enni nauang plan kown, now ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana maten plawng hown sak hown enni chün hanow aia naukrang iawng enni nauowi bowt kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow enni cham <char style="w">takhangra</char> hownia nauang lawtla enni kown. Aia dow nasana enni bowt kown, now aia cham set enni mih rah hownia nauang kuala enni iawk kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Prenchur nammowt kowi cham kuakta enni khowk chepaw nami hownia CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih nauang kuala enni iawk kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />Enni kowh pipu-uüa pren kowi aia dow nauang plan pawla enni iawk kown, now nami pren dow enni napowngta iawk kown. Aia dow enni pipu-uüa lak-e nalang pe phaw enni kown, now enni pipu-uüa lak-e maru iun ahuma nachang enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Aia kowi mih sak maiow hai singra maiow hown enni nanowng sakraula reng kownkow aia dow enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa kowi lai chünma mih saktuak napeah kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Naiawngün piati maten dow sui enni mih, chang enni nowng miuüa hai enni kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih napeah kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Nakhowk khe dow ani kowh ang pe enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh ana maten enni nachün iawk kown.<verse eid="DEU 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />“Nakhowk khe dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai mih lowra sia kowi nape enni iungra kown. Aia dow enni changah mih lup maten kowi nape enni prasi kown. Aia dow ahuma nape ka enni chah kown, now tawncher kowi paw ahuma nape kaah chah kown. Nami klen kowi enni kowh luprak kowi paw ahuma aia nape enni prasi kown. Enni kowh pipu-uüa luk kowi aia awmrawm iawng enni luk kowi paw naawmrawm enni iawk kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai lai chün hai mami rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih aia kowh ana pek hai rirow enni chün khü chiang, now sak maiow hai singra maiow hown CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai prakowi enni uang plan khü chiang naiawngün iungra hai prasira enni naka kown.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Singra hai kowngra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek nachün kown mih akratma nadowi chekhai, now tukta kratma mih paw nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />‘Nami ana pek a-i ta hanow nachünah kownkow mukuang kowi kowkowiah now mia chow nauang pawla a-i kown?’ pami enni naia tek kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ana pek dow mukuang kowi kowh towta hüah mih uanh nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Now ‘Nami ana pek a-i ta hanow nachünah kownkow sata paipra pown kowi kowkowiah now mia chow nauang pawla a-i kown?’ pami paw enni naia tek kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ana pek dow sata paipra pown kowi kowh uanh paw nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow enni tut-e uowi reng chekhai. Nami ana pek dow enni naia chünah kownkow enni nawr kowi hai enni sak kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Sünta, ani mih enni pur kowi singra hai iungra, now kowngra hai piakra ang tow enni khowk. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Ani kowh enni tut-e ang kowh ana pek dow maiawng: CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni nasakrauah kown, aia kowh tiama kowi enni namang kown, now aia kowh ana pek, aia kowh ari aiang hai rirow enni nachün kown. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni nasing kown, now prung paw enni naprung kown. Now enni nakowpowngah kownkow enni tarüah mih pren kowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai nape enni prasi kown.<verse eid="DEU 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />“Tawkchedow enni sak mih aia hownia tala chepaw naia kown. Now aia laiklow chün dowi kowi akeng thuraiuüa kowi cham chup kown enni nau chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />Naiawng che enni chang khai hanow enni napiak ngengche kown pami kawmat ang tek enni khowk chekhai. Jawrdan aw haipown hanow enni nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi akrama enni nasing kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19-20" />“Enni vüi ani mih mukuang hai krawng kowi towngla se ang tek khowk, enni pur kowi singra hai kowngra, now prasira hai piatira ang towta enni hüah khowk. Enni hai enni kowh chauüa nasingla reng kownkow singra phai rui büa diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi sakrauah büa diah, now aia laiklow chün büa diah. Aia kowi dow dowkta chen büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh singra uowi mih dow aia tut-e chekhai. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni kowh pipu Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah tut-e aia khamah mih pren kowi enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa chowngdawng sakklangma naia uowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 30:19-20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Mosi kowh arah Josua kowi ap pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Israeluüa maten kowi Mosi plan tek pe mih, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />“Ang dow 120 ning khowk. Enni kowi dow ang nowng mingkhet enni dowi bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG paw tek ang mih, ‘En natawi ka pown Jawrdan aw kown nadowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni pur kowi narik mang kown taih, now aia dow nami pren kowi kowh uowi mih chenchapuüa kowi namata kown. Nahanow amatni kowh pren dow enni napowngta pe kown. CHAKRAMANG tekta khowk iawng Josua dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi napawla enni kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun hai Awk hown amatchi kowh pren kowi CHAKRAMANG maah iawng dow naiawngün chenchap maten kowi paw aia namata kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi dow enni rut kowi CHAKRAMANG nape sumah kown. Now ang tek enni iawng amatni kowi enni nachangah kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Enni mih sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah büa diah. Amatni kowi dow hangkow kram büa diah, now chür paw hangkow chür büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai dow enni hown tawi uowi reng chekhai. Aia dow katpaw napowtta enni kown nadowi, now nua paw nanuata enni kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Nami kung kowi Mosi dow Josua kowi hawah khai. Now Israeluüa bowkbowk pur kowi Mosi tek pe Josua mih, “Sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai khamla mih pren kowi en nakowpawla kown takla. Now nami pren dow amatni nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow amatni kowi en naret pe kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow en pur kowi narik mang kown taih. Aia dow natawi uowila en reng kown taih; aia dow napowtta en kown nadowi, now nua paw nanuata en kown nadowi. Naiawng rakowi en mih hangkow sak nen diah, now kram paw hangkow kram diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naphat ari aiang kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Now Mosi dow maiawngün rirow maten ruiah hanow uamowuüa hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi peah khai. Naiawngün uamowuüa dow Levi chenchapuüa chekhai, now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10-11" />Aluchowuüa hai uamowuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Ranit ning towng ning chur kowi nasun Te Pawi kownkow CHAKRAMANG lang kloah mih arah kowi enni nakowkowi kown. Nami khin khe Israeluüa maten pur kowi mami ari aiang mih enni naphat pe kown. Nami ning dow lowi lawt napeta kown mih ning chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 31:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Nami khin khe maiawngün ari aiang laiklow amatni natawi ta kownkow, CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkaw krang natawi tuk büah kownkow hai mami ari aiang laiklow maten kaneuma natawi chün büah kownkow maru kawmuüa maten kowi enni nakua nalawmah kown. Naiawng enni nakua nalawmah kown miuüa dow kachakuüa, masiuüa, ngeuüa hai enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh nakowpowngah kown mih pren kowi enni sing uowi mowr dow takua talawm hanow maiawngün ari aiang mih maru kawmuüa kowi enni naphat pe kown. Naiawng hai maiawngün ari aiang laiklow tawi tuk dowi tak mih amatni kowh chauüa paw natawi ta kown towbowt. Now CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi ringkaw krang paw amatni natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa nakingküa Thurai kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En kowh dow kowng khin uang na iawlaw khowk. Naiawng rakowi Josua kowi hawla now <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> kowi kowkowi diah. Nakowi dow Josua kowi ang napeah kurdik kown,” pakhai. Now Mosi hai Josua iüah dow taklowp taklangra te kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="DEU 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih iawng hai taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e uang iowng khai. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En dow nakowng hanow en kowh pipu-uüa tut-e nakowtanai kown chowbowt. Nachenganchepaw en kowng kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih ang kaah sakowm dowi mih iawng nauowi kown. Amatni hown kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow amatni napiakta kown. Amatni dow nanuata ang kown, now amatni kowkupah mih pren kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi nacham tawi chupiia büah kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Naiawng amatni chang khe dow amatni kowi lainowmma ang nakunmarauah kown, now amatni kowi ang nanuata kown. Amatni kowi dow ang nakhowngah kown nadowi, now amatni dow napiak kown. Now amatni luk kowi dow phih maiow hai ngare towk rah maiow ang nauang pawla pe kown. Nami khin khe amatni natek kown mih, ‘Maiawngün piakra a-i luk kowi uang ting mih dow a-i tut-e CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai tawi uowi dowi rakowi chekhai,’ napa büah kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Amatni dow nachang lup ngak kown, now akeng thuraiuüa kowi nacham chupiia büah kown. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang natawi khowngah kown nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Mosi hai Josua, enchi mih mami meng dow ruiah iüa diah. Mami meng dow Israeluüa kowi sangah iüa diah. Mami meng che amatni tuk hanow amatni chang ngak khe mami meng mih amatni kowi nathuak pe saksi kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Amatni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh ang khamah mih pren kowi dow amatni kowi ang nakowpawla kown. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi chekhai. Nakowi dow amatni nauah mih chakkham amatni naka cha naka kham kown, now nakau hanow asowrma nauowi büah kown. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow ang hownia napowt büah kown, now akeng thuraiuüa kowi nacham chupiia büah kown. Amatni dow nanuata ang kown, now amatni hown kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow napiakta büah kown. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi phih maiow hai ngare towk rah maiow ang nauang pawla pe kown. Nami khin khe amatni dow mami meng natamata kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami meng dow amatni vüi saksi iawng nachowng kown. Napeah kownkow ang khamah mih pren kowi dow kawmat paw amatni kowi ang kowpawla dowi tak. Nachenganchepaw nakowi amatni kowting kung kowi tawng chow nakowchang kownkow tuak mih ang aiawng tuk,” pape khai. <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Naiawng rakowi nami ni khe nami meng dow Mosi ruiah hanow Israeluüa kowi sangah khai.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Nami kung kowi Nun kowh chapa Josua kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah. Israeluüa kowi napeah kownkow ang khamah mih pren kowi amatni kowi dow en nakowpawla kown. Ang matia ngengche natawi uowila en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Maiawngün ari aiang maten dow auown hownia chur pat lowkchow mih chabowih kowi Mosi ruiah kaneu khai. <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm kawt mih Leviuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Mami dow rirow bowih chekhai. Mami bowih dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ria kowi kowtowah büa diah. Nahanow mami bowih mih enni Israeluüa vüi kingküa mih saksi iawng nauowi kown towbowt. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Enni dow laiüama hai kingküa dawma pami ang aiawng tuk. Ang sing uowi reng tak khe ngam dow CHAKRAMANG kowi enni kingküaah khai. Ang kowng kung kowi ngam dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma enni nakingküaah kown chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Enni krungchak kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hai maru iukuüa maten kowi ang pur kowi uang kua uang lawmla diah. Natawi thuak saksi kownkow mukuang hai krawng kowi towngla se maiawngün laiklow amatni kowi tekla pe kown ang nau. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Ang tuk, ang kowng kung kowi dow lainowmma enni nata piak kown. Enni nachünah kownkow ang pe enni mih ana pek dow enni nanuata kown. Now CHAKRAMANG naukhi-ah dowi mih lup dow enni nachang kown; enni dow nathawp arup kown. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow nakunmarau enni kown, now aia dow enni luk kowi nauang pawla enni piakra kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Nami kung kowi Mosi dow auown hownia chur pat mami meng mih Israeluüa kowi tek pe khai:<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="s">Mosi kowh meng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Aw mukuang, ang kowh lai sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">aw lusa, ang nawr hownia kowh lai sünta diah.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Ang kowh tüngsangra dow uang iawng pacham uang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">ang kowh laiklow dow <char style="w">nang</char> iawng pacham kla lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Pram pawi luk kowi kowh uang sirinchow uang iawng pacham uang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">singh kau luk kowi uangchak mang uang iawng pacham uang lah.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />“Ang dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ming ang naphuang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">enni dow a-i kowh Thurai kraingra meng tek büa diah.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Aia dow Singku Huamang chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">aia kowh lup dow atawi uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">aia kowh tiama maten dow anowm kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Aia dow kaah sakowm mih Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">aia dow tawng nam khe paw chang angak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">aia dow achinawmma hai anowm chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />“Nachenganchepaw aia luk kowi aia maru-uüa dow changah naklak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">amatni dow sangching uowi dowi rakowi aia chauüa nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:5">Kawmat chowng kowi kowh maru dow kaah sakowm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">amatni kowh saktuak dow aprawngma nadowi.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Aw bualama hai prengia uowi dowi mih chenchapuüa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Enni kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi naiawng bow enni sat pe klai kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Aia dow enni kowh pa hai thawp enni miia nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Chenchap iawng hai thawp enni mih aia chowtaih nadowi bow?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />“Kung prakowi kowh chownglawng sam paw tuak büah madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">enni dowi rawn kowh pipu-uüa laiklow sam tuak büah madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Kung prakowi kowh laiklow enni kowh pauüa tut-e sam lünta büah madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">amatni dow natek enni kown taih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Lawngtang matanguüa kowi sam lünta büah madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">amatni dow nachia enni kown taih.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow maru maten kowi chenchap alang alangma changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">aia dow chenchap maten kowi bak pe dawngthawnguan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">Amatni chowlowkkow kowh dow thuraiuüa uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">naiawngün thuraiuüa aklowk uowi khowt amatni kowi dow thik pe sünghi khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh kakbak dow aia kowh maru Israeluüa chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">aia kowh dawngthawnguan kakbak dow Jakawb chuprek chaprekuüa chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Amatni kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi aia kaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">amatni kowi dow rarim raramma mih rah kowi aia kaah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Amatni kowi dow aia mingah khetah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">amatni kowi dow aia lang sakrauah mih maru kowi iawng chawngah khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Amatni kowi dow abai kowi kowh chah kowi uamu khetah iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">achauüa luk kowi asachow asachow uamu iow reng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">achauüa dowh khe nakrawi dowkah kownkow a-u rowng lap iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">achauüa kowi aia luk kowi tangla now a-u cham iowla iawng,<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia malowkchow Israeluüa kowi uang kruila khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">aia hown dow tawng iawng mih thuraiuüa paw tawi uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />“Amatni kowi dow hungma mawngma süng aia pe powngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">Amatni kowi dow üa hai laih kowi kowh luprak aia pe chaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Huamang hownia kowh kuai tui amatni kowi dow aia pe chaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">hualipchow hownia kowh kanrawn sau amatni kowi aia pe chaah khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Aia dow amatni kowi chia iawn tui bawi pe chaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">rua iawn tui hai ruapur iawn tui paw aia pe khamah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Aia dow kow iungma mih ruapur chah nga pe chaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">Basan pren kowi kowh ruala hai ruapurla nga paw aia pe chaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Aia dow püm aiungma mih amatni kowi pe chaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">lang iung mih grep tui paw amatni kowi aia pe khamah khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Aw Israeluüa, enni dow uang kureng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">chak du lai bowt kowh lainowmma enni kau khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Nachenganchepaw thawp enni miia Thurai kowi enni nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">enni kowh tatung tanimra hungh kowi enni nüah klowkah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Akeng thuraiuüa kowi hai arup aren kowi enni cham chup cham iia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">
    <char style="w">khowrbown dawma</char> mih Thurai kowi dow enni towkah kunmarau khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Lümla ngakuüa vüi tawncher hown enni cham chang phuchua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">thurai saruüa vüi enni chang pe phuchua pawi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">Enni pipu-uüa kramah dowi mih thuraiuüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">Thurai nadowi mih kowi enni cham phuchua khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Enni kowh Singku Huamang kowi enni towah sak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">pe enni singra mih Thurai kowi enni tamata khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Enni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chauüa chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:19">Tawkchedow aia kowi enni towkah kunmarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">aia kowi enni powtta mih dow aia khi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:19">Naiawng rakowi aia dow cham dangta enni khai bowt.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Aia tek mih, ‘Amatni kowi dow ang nacham dangta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">achur kowi tawng chow naown büah kown mih ang sam müah matak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow laiüama mih chenchap chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">amatni dow kaah sakowm dowi mih chauüa chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Thurai ching nadowi mih thuraiuüa kowi amatni dow cham chup hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">khowrbown dawma mih Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi cham chup büah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">ang kowh kunmaraura dow pe hu ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Naiawng rakowi asung uowi dowi mih chenchapuüa kowi ang nauang pawla pe hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">amatni kowi paw ang nakhowr nabownah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Bualama mih chenchap rut kowi ang naap-ah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">amatni kowi paw ang nape kunmarauah kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Ang kowh kunmaraura dow maih iawng nalün hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">nami maih dow krawng dak kowi pat nakrawi lün kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Nami dow dowm kowi kowh luprak maten nakamta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">now hungh tut maten paw nakrawi kamta bowk kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“‘Phih maten mih amatni luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">ang kowh <char style="w">leba</char> sek maten khowk pat amatni kowi ang naapla kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Amatni dow hawm sakkrai kan sakkrai hown nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">amatni dow kramra uowima mih rawka hown nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Amatni kowi dow ang nauang chin pe kaurawng uaramchak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">amatni tut-e dow akru uowima mih rua ang nauang chin pe kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Tiama kowi dow saidawng rut kowi nakowng büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">kim lak kowi dow kramring tahowrma hown nauowi büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Amatni kowh malauüa klanguüa dow nakowng bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">amatni kowh lawngtanguüa hai ngeuüa nakowng bowk kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Amatni kowi dow ang nachumta bowk kown chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">amatni kowi dow maru tukah dowi bowt iawng ang changah kown chowdiah.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Nachenganchepaw naiawng ang chang now ransu-uüa nachang bawri kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">amatni dow ang kowh lup uan natuk kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">Amatni natek kown mih, “A-i awng mih chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pe sumah mih nadowi,” napa kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“‘Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi prengia iung pek mih uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">amatni kowh dow aiung angak tukla mih prengia mapaw uowi dowi.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Prengia che uowi panü dow maiawngün laiklow natukta büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">achur kowi tawng chow naown büah kown mih natuk büah kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Tawng iawng chow maru lowk iachow hown 1,000 ia maru kowi nowng sen?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Tawngplawng kowchow maru pre iachow kowi khita now 10,000 ia maru powt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Israeluüa kowh Singku Huamang amatni kowi pe sumah kowh nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Ransu-uüa rut kowi amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah kowh nadowi bow?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />A-i kowh ransu-uüa kowh singku huamang dow a-i kowh Singku Huamang iawng nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">amatni kowh thuraiuüa dow a-i kowh Thurai iawng kür dowi pami amatni paw tuk chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />“‘Ransu-uüa dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra maru-uüa iawng suiiai kaniaima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">amatni dow akhakma hai akru uowima mih grep uih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Amatni dow rua kru uowima mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">amatni dow kramra uowima mih chiarua kru iawng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Amatni kowh angak dow ang tuk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">amatni kowi naripah kownkow ang chawng pe akhin reng tak.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Napaw angak klai kown mih alow ang kowh uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">maru maten kowi amatni kowh lup sung ang napeah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Akhin uang ting now ransu-uüa dow natatheu kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">amatni kowh piak khin dow uang tawn khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Amatni kowh piakra ni ang khowm bowkta pe khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Nami dow amatni luk kowi nauang lüa kla kown chowbowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />“Aia maru-uüa kowh kür khowk mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi natawi tangila kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">Nar lah, nar nadowi mih lah mia kowh paw kür uowi dowk khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi nasaksing sanaah bowt kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />“Nakhowk khe dow Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG natek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">‘Kawmat dow kowbüah kowh thuraiuüa tawng kowi chow cham uowi bowk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">Amatni tatung tanimla reng mih singku huamang tawng kowi chow cham uowi khai?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Amatni changla phuchua mih tawncher sau chak mih thuraiuüa tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Amatni kowh khamah mih uanap kowi kowh grep tui kham mih thuraiuüa tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Kawmat dow naiawngün thuraiuüa mih pauang khowng enni lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">kawmat dow naiawngün thuraiuüa mih pauang pe enni tatung tanimra lah.<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Ang chowtaih Thurai pami kawmat dow enni natuk bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ang klen kowi dow akeng mih thurai uowi dowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Kowngra hai singra dow ang rut kowi chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ang nau now ang piakah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ang nau now ang iungah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Ang rut hownia nowng plai mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Chawk rut khükhü takham se ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">ang matia ming lüklaula se ang takham khowk:<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Ang kowh tawk pliplip mih saidawng ang nasükah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ang kowh tara chet müa kowi ang tawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">Ang ransu-uüa kowi ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">sui ang miuüa kowi amatni kowh kakbak ang napeah kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Ang kowh leba sek maten dow amatni kowh vi hown naring kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">Ang kowh saidawng dow amatni kowi nasaiah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">Ang uang khümla miuüa kowi dow ang nakowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">amatni kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowh lu ang nadungta pe kown.<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“‘Aw kuang maten, CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa hown piaw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">akeng mih thuraiuüa low, Thurai pur kowi uang tabawk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia naruüa kowh vi klai napaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">aia dow aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Aia maru-uüa kowh pren dow aia nachimsaita pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">aia maru-uüa kowh angak dow aia nalawtta pe kown,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Now Mosi hai Nun kowh chapa Josua iüah mami meng kowi kowh laiklow maten maru kawmuüa kowi kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45-46" />Nami meng laiklow maten ki tek pe kung kowi Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Ani kowh ang pe enni mih ana pek maten sak kowi towah kaneu büa diah. Now enni matia kowh chauüa paw kaneuma naia chünla kownkow tüngsangah büa diah. <verse eid="DEU 32:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Maiawngün laiklow enni vüi alowlowma nadowi; maiawngün laiklow dow enni vüi sing müa chekhai. Maiawngün laiklow enni chün hanow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh enni nakowpowngah kown chowbowt mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma enni nasing kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi kowng kown mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Nami ni khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai hownia Abarim hungh kowi kowkowi diah, now Nebo hungh kowi kowh lang kro mih chut kowi kowpün diah. Nami chut dow Jeriko marow hown tatang dowk chekhai. Nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Israeluüa kowi ang napeah kown mih Kanan pren dow nami chut hownia kowmüla akat diah. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />En taimow Arawn dow Hawr hungh kowi kowng khai; aia dow aia pipu-uüa tut-e mang khai bowt. Nami iawng dow en paw Nebo chut kowi nakowng kown, now en pipu-uüa tut-e en natawi uowi bowt kown. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Zin pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Kades marow re-e ang kaah sakowm dowi mih lup enchi chang khai. Nakowi kowh Meriba tuikuam re-e ang chimsaima pami Israeluüa pur kowi enchi tüng dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi ang peah kown chowbowt mih pren dow alakma hownia chowtaih en nakhila kown. Tawkchedow nakowi en naka kup kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Mosi kowh achur prasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Mosi dow Thurai maru chekhai. Aia dow kowng dowi tak khe maiawng hai Israeluüa kowi pela prasi khai:<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />“CHAKRAMANG dow Sinai hungh hownia uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">aia dow Seir hungh kowi sat iawng uang lawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">aia dow Paran hungh hownia aia maru-uüa luk kowi krawi sawt anowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Aia hown dow athawng aiawng kramamu-uüa uang tawi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">aia hawmlawm rut kowi dow maih lün pluplup chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi sakrauah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi lawngah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Aia maru-uüa dow aia kowh laiklow chün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">now amatni dow aia kowi chupiiaah reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Mosi dow pe a-i ari aiang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">nami ari aiang dow Jakawb krungchakuüa vüi asung uowima chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Israel aluchowuüa hai amatni kowh krungchakuüa dow arasang uang takua talawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG dow Israel pren mang chowng khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Israel laipre krungchakuüa kowh prasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Reuben krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:6">“Reuben dow pacham sing uowi reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">aia dow hang pacham kowng lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">nachenganchepaw aia krungchak dow hang pacham prung lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Juda krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, Juda awr lüah mih sünta pe diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">aia kowi dow akeng krungchakuüa hown kuaah lawmah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Aia kowi dow peah kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi en tawi sen pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Levi krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“Levi krungchak dow en kaah sakowm mih nar chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">amatni tut-e dow en kowh Thumim hai Urim uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Masa pami arah kowi amatni kowi dow en chaingah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Meriba tuikuam re-e amatni hown dow en tanang khai.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Amatni dow en kowh ana pek chün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">amatni dow en tow pe mih sangbowk laitawm iawng chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Naiawngün rirow dow amatni tut-e apankrima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">naiawngün dow amatni kowh upa-uüa lak-e asung lang uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">amatni kowh tainau-uüa hai chauüa lak-e paw asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Amatni dow Jakawb kowi en kowh ana pek sangah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">Israel kowi dow en kowh ari aiang sangah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Amatni dow en pur kowi nam iungma mih maikhük towk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">en kowh phuchuara luk kowi dow tikah mih uanap chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni kowh dawngthawnguan kowi peah prasi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">amatni changah mih lup srui dow en tawi awmrawm pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi piakta pe bowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">nahanow ransu-uüa dow amatni kowi nauang senah kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Benjamin krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“CHAKRAMANG dow Benjamin krungchak kowi sakrauah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">amatni dow aia tut-e aiungma uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Amatni kowi dow atungma aia lawngah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">amatni pren kowi dow CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Josef krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“Josef krungchak kowh pren kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pacham peah prasi lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">aia dow kuang hownia uang tui pacham peah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">aia dow krawng dak hownia paw krawng dawng tui pacham peah lah.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Sat den hanow uih-ak dow aiungma pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">khin towng uih-ak dow aiungma pacham phaw lah.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Alai chowng khe kowh hungh hownia dow luprak aiungma pacham ka lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">Chowngchowng saksakma mih hungma mawngma süng hownia luprak ahuma pacham ka lah.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />CHAKRAMANG dow singh plum dawng kowi kowh maih lün pluplup mih kowi uang tatüng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">nami CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi pacham peah prasi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">aia pren kowi dow lusa kowi kowh lang iung mih luprak pacham phaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Maiawngün prasi dow Josef krungchak luk kowi pacham kla lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow atainau-uüa pungmadawng kowi aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Josef dow chiala iawng akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">aia kowh dow chiarowngla kowh iawng anang uowi pre buk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">aia kowh nang dow achapa Efraim hai Manase iüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Efraim krungchak kowh siphai hawmh dow lakh lakh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Manase krungchak kowh siphai hawmh dow athawng aiawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Naiawngün siphai hawmh hown dow palusama kowi kowh chenchap kowi aia nakrawi senah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">aia dow prenchur nammowt kowi kowh chenchapuüa kowi pat nasenla bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Zebulun hai Isakar krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Zebulun krungchak dow sata kowi kowh kun changra hownia pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Isakar krungchak dow kim arasang hownia pacham phaw lah.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Amatni dow hungh kowi maru-uüa kowi nahawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">now nakowi dow achinawmma mih phuchua nachang büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow sata hownia naka dawngthawnguan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">sephung kowi dupta hüah mih dawngthawnguan naka büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Gad krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">aia dow Gad krungchak kowi pren sünghi naphia pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">Gad krungchak dow ransu-uüa kowi krangsi iawng nahawt chawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">amatni dow amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi nasenah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">now ransu-uüa kowi nadita nak büah kown.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Israel chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa dow takua talawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">amatni dow arah lang iung mih Gad krungchak kowi khowm pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">amatni kowi dow aluchowuüa kak tataing mih arah pe pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Gad krungchak dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">amatni dow Israel vüi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih rirow paw chün khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Dan krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dan krungchak dow krangsila powrchow iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">amatni dow Basan pami arah hownia uang iowr khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">now amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi uang senah büah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Naptali krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:23" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Naptali krungchak luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh saksing sanara atekma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">CHAKRAMANG kowh prasira dow amatni luk kowi atekma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">amatni kowh pren sünghi aphiama chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">Nami dow Galili sata hownia mrawkphak pra kowh pren mowr chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Aser krungchak lawnguan kowi Mosi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 33:24" />
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Aser krungchak dow akeng krungchakuüa lak-e nalang ka prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">amatni kowi dow amatni kowh tainau-uüa nalang sakrauah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Amatni kowh pren kowi dow lainowmma kanrawn sau naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Naiawng rakowi aia dow kanrawn sau hown nasau khawk kown.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Amatni kowh marow tapplawt dow akhawtma pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">marow tapplawt klia dow lawngha hai kri pana lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:25">Amatni dow akürma pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">amatni sing uowi mowr dow aiungma pacham uowi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Mosi kiow Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />“Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh Thurai iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">aia dow nauang khowng enni kownkow mukuang kowi kowh uangnim dawng iawng uang reng.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Chowngchowng saksakma mih Thurai dow enni kowh tatung tanimra chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">aia kowh achowngma kür hown aia mih lawng enni reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Enni kowh ransu-uüa kowi aia mih enni pur hownia prütta enni reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">aia tek mih, ‘Naiawngün ransu-uüa kowi piakta büa diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Naiawng rakowi enni Israeluüa dow aiungma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">enni Jakawb krungchak tut-e dow phih nauang ting kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">Enni nauowiah kown mih pren kowi dow kuang hownia uang nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">nahanow luprak hai grep tui sar dow lainowmma naphaw kown.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Aw Israeluüa, enni dow ka prasi mih maru chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Enni dow CHAKRAMANG lawng enni mih chenchap chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">enni iawng mih chenchap dow miapaw uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Aia mih <char style="w">kawngma</char> iawng towkala enni reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">aia mih saidawng iawng pe awng enni reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Ransu-uüa dow kram kowh enni pur kowi nachürla kluk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow enni nanün nathuaah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Mosi kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Nami kung kowi Mosi dow Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai hownia Pisga hungh kowi kowkowi khai, now Nebo hungh kowi kowh lang kro mih chut kowi kowpün khai. Nami chut dow Jeriko marow hown tatang dowk chekhai. Nami chut hownia Mosi kowi mih Kanan pren paprenma CHAKRAMANG tüng pe khai. CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi Gileaduüa uowi rah süng hownia Dan krungchakuüa uowi rah süng mowr tüng pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Now Naptali krungchakuüa uowi rah süng, Efraim krungchakuüa uowi rah süng hai Manase krungchakuüa uowi rah süng paw aia kowi CHAKRAMANG tüng pe khai. Now satkup prakowi paw Mediteranean sata mowr Juda krungchakuüa uowi rah süng maten aia kowi CHAKRAMANG tüng pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Nami klen kowi aia dow Negeb süng hai Jeriko marow uowi mih süng paw Mosi kowi tüng pe khai. Jeriko marow kowi dow chekmarawng singh marow pahai maru tukah khai. Now Jawrdan aw mrawkphak pra kowh anaima mih süng hownia Zoar marow uowi mih süng paw Mosi kowi aia tüng pe khai. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowi amatni krungchakuüa kowi napeah kownkow ang khamah mih pren dow mami chowbowt. Pren dow en matia mik hown khila kown mih khin ang pe en khai. Tawkche Jawrdan aw haipown hanow pai kowi dow en naka kowi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Now CHAKRAMANG tekah iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Mosi dow Moab pren kowi kowng khai. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Aia kowi dow Moab pren kowi kowh Bet-Peur marow re-e lawngrawi kowi CHAKRAMANG dupah khai. Tawkchedow Mosi kowh tadupra kuam mih tawng re-e chow mih kawmat mowr miapaw tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Kowng khowk khe Mosi dow 120 ning khowk chekhai. Tawkchedow aia kowng mih khin khe aia kowh mik sa paw uak dowi tak chekhai, now aia kowh kow kür paw iaw dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Israeluüa dow Moab pren kowi kowh dowm nai kowi 30 ni mowr Mosi kowi karah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Mosi kowi karah mih hai uowila uiting uangtak mih khin chur khai.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Mosi mih aia kowng dowi rawn tak khe Nun kowh chapa Josua luk kowi tang pe rut hanow peah prasi khai rakowi Josua dow prengia pek mih <char style="w">Lümlasai</char> hown atekma uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Josua laiklow iawng uowi khai bowt. Now Mosi hownia kowh amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana pek paw chün büah khai bowt.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Mosi iawng mih risi dow ani mowr kowi Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw uang dia dowi tak chekhai. Mosi hown dow auiua iawng tamü maklak se CHAKRAMANG taklowp taklang khai. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa tut-e kowchinah khai, now Aigupta pren paprenma kowi awdara uowima mih lup hai amatra pe changah khai. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Israeluüa maten pur kowi akri kraingma mih kür Mosi tüng pe khai, now kramra uowima mih lup Mosi chang pe khai. Kawmat mowr pat paw Mosi iawng mih risi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw uowi dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>